Output~2025-04-24 16:33:29.993381: [RequestOutput(request_id=45, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Explain the concept of artificial intelligence in simple terms. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 83017, 279, 7434, 315, 21075, 11478, 304, 4382, 3878, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a simple explanation of artificial intelligence:\n\nArtificial intelligence, or AI, refers to the ability of machines or computers to think and learn like humans. Just like how humans can solve problems, recognize patterns, and make decisions, AI systems can do the same things, but with the help of complex algorithms and data.\n\nThink of AI like a super-smart robot that can perform tasks on its own, without being explicitly programmed to do so. For example, a self-driving car uses AI to navigate through roads, recognize traffic lights, and avoid obstacles. A virtual assistant like Siri or Alexa uses AI to understand your voice commands and respond accordingly.\n\nAI works by processing vast amounts of data, identifying patterns, and making predictions or decisions based on that data. It can also learn from its mistakes and improve its performance over time, just like how humans learn from experience.\n\nThere are many types of AI, including:\n\n1. Narrow or weak AI: This type of AI is designed to perform a specific task, like playing chess or recognizing faces.\n2. General or strong AI: This type of AI is designed to perform any intellectual task that a human can, like solving complex problems or creating art.\n3. Superintelligence: This type of AI is far more intelligent than humans and has the potential to revolutionize many aspects of our lives.\n\nOverall, AI has the potential to make our lives easier, more efficient, and more enjoyable, but it also raises important questions about its impact on society and our jobs.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 4382, 16540, 315, 21075, 11478, 1473, 9470, 16895, 11478, 11, 477, 15592, 11, 19813, 311, 279, 5845, 315, 12933, 477, 19002, 311, 1781, 323, 4048, 1093, 12966, 13, 4702, 1093, 1268, 12966, 649, 11886, 5435, 11, 15641, 12912, 11, 323, 1304, 11429, 11, 15592, 6067, 649, 656, 279, 1890, 2574, 11, 719, 449, 279, 1520, 315, 6485, 26249, 323, 828, 382, 39787, 315, 15592, 1093, 264, 2307, 4773, 472, 12585, 430, 649, 2804, 9256, 389, 1202, 1866, 11, 2085, 1694, 21650, 56168, 311, 656, 779, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 264, 659, 60811, 1841, 5829, 15592, 311, 21546, 1555, 19795, 11, 15641, 9629, 13001, 11, 323, 5766, 32116, 13, 362, 4200, 18328, 1093, 76074, 477, 50712, 5829, 15592, 311, 3619, 701, 7899, 11545, 323, 6013, 28178, 382, 15836, 4375, 555, 8863, 13057, 15055, 315, 828, 11, 25607, 12912, 11, 323, 3339, 20492, 477, 11429, 3196, 389, 430, 828, 13, 1102, 649, 1101, 4048, 505, 1202, 21294, 323, 7417, 1202, 5178, 927, 892, 11, 1120, 1093, 1268, 12966, 4048, 505, 3217, 382, 3947, 527, 1690, 4595, 315, 15592, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 83411, 477, 7621, 15592, 25, 1115, 955, 315, 15592, 374, 6319, 311, 2804, 264, 3230, 3465, 11, 1093, 5737, 33819, 477, 49183, 12580, 627, 17, 13, 3331, 477, 3831, 15592, 25, 1115, 955, 315, 15592, 374, 6319, 311, 2804, 904, 20207, 3465, 430, 264, 3823, 649, 11, 1093, 22581, 6485, 5435, 477, 6968, 1989, 627, 18, 13, 7445, 93375, 25, 1115, 955, 315, 15592, 374, 3117, 810, 25530, 1109, 12966, 323, 706, 279, 4754, 311, 14110, 553, 1690, 13878, 315, 1057, 6439, 382, 28589, 11, 15592, 706, 279, 4754, 311, 1304, 1057, 6439, 8831, 11, 810, 11297, 11, 323, 810, 321