 services, such as travel, entertainment, and food delivery.\n\nIn terms of their values, this segment is likely to prioritize convenience, flexibility, and sustainability. They may be interested in eco-friendly and socially responsible products and brands. They may also be open to trying new things and are likely to be influenced by social and cultural trends.\n\nOverall, this customer segment is a key target audience for e-commerce businesses, as they are likely to be active online, tech-savvy, and open to new experiences and products.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 11, 279, 6130, 10449, 374, 4461, 311, 387, 3995, 12884, 889, 527, 4642, 2930, 49835, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 11, 20330, 1990, 220, 972, 323, 220, 914, 1667, 2362, 13, 1115, 38462, 374, 3629, 14183, 311, 439, 330, 10172, 1901, 1, 477, 330, 12608, 2734, 10522, 3343, 5810, 374, 264, 4096, 315, 420, 6130, 10449, 1473, 2028, 6130, 10449, 374, 32971, 555, 872, 13312, 1355, 402, 85, 1918, 11, 449, 264, 3831, 51552, 369, 2930, 12185, 323, 3674, 3772, 13, 2435, 527, 4461, 311, 387, 11537, 449, 5526, 384, 42685, 15771, 11, 2930, 3157, 27170, 11, 323, 3674, 3772, 15771, 1778, 439, 14318, 11, 73842, 53954, 11, 323, 13674, 13, 2435, 527, 1101, 4461, 311, 387, 28160, 555, 2930, 8544, 11, 18594, 11, 323, 19075, 505, 4885, 323, 87333, 382, 644, 3878, 315, 872, 12185, 26870, 11, 420, 10449, 374, 4461, 311, 387, 3430, 66666, 323, 907, 32505, 11, 449, 264, 22698, 369, 17049, 323, 58930, 3956, 13, 2435, 1253, 387, 29123, 311, 5043, 11401, 11, 13444, 323, 4443, 2512, 3956, 11, 323, 31591, 13, 2435, 1253, 1101, 387, 8173, 304, 11704, 323, 3600, 11, 1778, 439, 5944, 11, 16924, 11, 323, 3691, 9889, 382, 644, 3878, 315, 872, 2819, 11, 420, 10449, 374, 4461, 311, 63652, 19679, 11, 25152, 11, 323, 41329, 13, 2435, 1253, 387, 8173, 304, 42688, 22658, 323, 40418, 8647, 3956, 323, 16097, 13, 2435, 1253, 1101, 387, 1825, 311, 4560, 502, 2574, 323, 527, 4461, 311, 387, 28160, 555, 3674, 323, 13042, 18845, 382, 28589, 11, 420, 6130