and run, but her legs wouldn\'t move. She was trapped, frozen in place by the figure\'s unblinking stare.\n\nAnd then, in a voice that was like the rustling of dry leaves, the figure spoke. "I have been waiting for you," it said. "You have something that belongs to me."\n\nShe tried to shake her head, to deny whatever it was that the figure was talking about, but her voice was stuck in her throat. The figure took another step closer, its eyes burning brighter, and she felt herself being pulled towards it, like a moth to a flame.', token_ids=[8100, 9107, 279, 6134, 311, 1505, 264, 16615, 7216, 5405, 7897, 304, 35612, 13, 578, 3805, 574, 12314, 449, 279, 41466, 315, 41369, 9578, 323, 1654, 17718, 11141, 11, 323, 279, 29447, 4776, 52305, 430, 32393, 279, 51902, 6445, 97383, 5554, 18664, 47003, 389, 279, 14620, 13, 578, 7216, 3287, 956, 3351, 11, 3287, 956, 6604, 11, 3287, 956, 1524, 2873, 311, 37397, 13, 1102, 574, 439, 422, 433, 574, 264, 35372, 11, 264, 6453, 323, 2291, 65, 3785, 81878, 80600, 1063, 14154, 6367, 382, 2170, 1364, 25319, 12401, 11, 279, 7216, 14297, 9408, 1202, 2010, 11, 1202, 3663, 2103, 559, 583, 9988, 304, 27394, 13, 3005, 6612, 264, 559, 1553, 1629, 1523, 1077, 35776, 439, 1202, 6548, 11, 1403, 2840, 396, 287, 3585, 315, 3177, 11, 8521, 389, 1077, 13, 3005, 6818, 311, 1935, 264, 3094, 1203, 11, 719, 1077, 7693, 9508, 41976, 311, 279, 7858, 382, 1, 15546, 527, 499, 7673, 1364, 58366, 11, 1077, 7899, 20025, 80415, 927, 279, 272, 1127, 287, 315, 279, 2362, 23162, 6558, 19826, 382, 791, 7216, 3287, 956, 6013, 11, 719, 4619, 3952, 264, 6435, 11, 46072, 3094, 4741, 13, 3005, 1436, 2733, 1202, 36496, 20252, 1139, 1077, 6930, 11, 1093, 264, 9439, 11, 6453, 35678, 13, 3005, 6818, 311, 2543, 323, 1629, 11, 719, 1077, 14535, 8434, 956, 3351, 13, 3005, 574, 31691, 11, 20268, 304, 2035, 555, 279, 7216, 596, 653, 2067, 16113, 46943, 382, 3112, 1243, 11, 304, 264, 7899, 430, 574, 1093, 279, 23941, 2785, 315, 9235, 11141, 11, 279, 7216, 12570, 13, 330, 40, 617, 10