 frisbee or other outdoor games\n* A book or magazine to read\n* A frisbee or other outdoor games\n\nRemember to check the weather forecast and adjust your packing list accordingly. You may also want to consider any specific rules or regulations at your picnic location. Have a great picnic!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 3673, 499, 1253, 1390, 311, 2980, 36813, 369, 264, 55562, 1473, 334, 27844, 25, 57277, 9, 67836, 288, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 13824, 323, 17604, 11, 45405, 11, 50933, 14432, 323, 52441, 340, 9, 30260, 14098, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 41776, 11, 66008, 11, 63494, 340, 9, 45419, 323, 94911, 198, 9, 87768, 323, 24522, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 1709, 96708, 1286, 11, 2854, 38827, 340, 9, 19177, 6651, 449, 31049, 323, 32720, 14098, 198, 9, 27085, 477, 14198, 552, 369, 43849, 198, 9, 10164, 477, 1023, 21662, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 23661, 11, 39962, 11, 13378, 696, 334, 33, 2099, 1154, 25, 57277, 9, 10164, 27474, 477, 264, 74815, 481, 5593, 198, 9, 66851, 15039, 477, 56952, 288, 320, 2000, 6980, 340, 9, 32926, 477, 1023, 6822, 47497, 320, 333, 5535, 520, 701, 55562, 3813, 696, 334, 23610, 295, 323, 38399, 25, 57277, 9, 362, 3544, 39139, 477, 55562, 5634, 198, 9, 13011, 26993, 477, 264, 55562, 14351, 449, 5918, 3502, 38399, 198, 9, 362, 23665, 55562, 2007, 477, 264, 3544, 48998, 369, 28601, 271, 334, 61220, 729, 8839, 323, 25485, 25, 57277, 9, 1050, 23620, 25485, 11, 26446, 11, 323, 82036, 8839, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 74674, 11, 49995, 11, 20016, 2439, 340, 9, 18343, 25485, 11, 26446, 11, 323, 82036, 8839, 320, 333, 499, 10932, 44890, 2671, 340, 9, 29576, 11966, 323, 5684, 53984, 271, 334, 52079, 41242, 25, 57277, 9, 362, 36921, 449, 10054, 31406, 311, 2567, 3691, 323, 21662, 7155, 198, 9, 362, 23701, 9145, 311, 6667, 701, 12571, 198, 9, 8219, 8337, 323, 27080, 88874, 306, 198, 9, 362, 6382, 311, 12602, 19459, 198, 9, 362, 1176, 12576, 16530, 320, 4345, 304, 1162, 696, 334, 15669, 3673, 25, 57277, 9, 362, 23665, 19114, 311, 1514, 4731, 198, 9, 362, 1448, 285, 33131, 477, 102