ysical infrastructure of a community, it can create a more stable and supportive environment that allows individuals to thrive. Additionally, community development initiatives can also help to promote social cohesion and a sense of community, which can be an important factor in reducing poverty.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 3947, 527, 1690, 5627, 311, 8108, 19542, 304, 264, 4029, 11, 719, 1618, 527, 1403, 2204, 20414, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 36, 32107, 13714, 1223, 479, 1555, 11930, 323, 12280, 16543, 96618, 3861, 1648, 311, 8108, 19542, 374, 311, 3493, 6873, 323, 2683, 4967, 10708, 311, 7931, 304, 279, 4029, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 89486, 4967, 11, 53082, 7620, 11, 323, 75505, 7512, 4500, 13, 3296, 3312, 5772, 7931, 449, 279, 7512, 323, 6677, 4460, 311, 9966, 2731, 89823, 7032, 11, 814, 649, 5376, 872, 28744, 4754, 323, 1464, 279, 11008, 315, 19542, 13, 23212, 11, 6873, 323, 2683, 4967, 649, 1101, 1520, 7931, 2274, 264, 5647, 315, 659, 2695, 2419, 323, 12410, 11, 902, 649, 617, 264, 6928, 5536, 389, 872, 8244, 1664, 33851, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 34868, 11050, 323, 45587, 22728, 12760, 96618, 13596, 1648, 311, 8108, 19542, 374, 311, 5357, 389, 4029, 4500, 323, 14054, 18637, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 28271, 1778, 439, 4857, 17049, 11983, 11, 18899, 2680, 311, 18985, 323, 77623, 13077, 11, 323, 6968, 4029, 19169, 430, 3493, 7718, 3600, 1778, 439, 3691, 14286, 323, 2683, 22165, 3600, 13, 3296, 26012, 304, 279, 7106, 14054, 315, 264, 4029, 11, 433, 649, 1893, 264, 810, 15528, 323, 33445, 4676, 430, 6276, 7931, 311, 41972, 13, 23212, 11, 4029, 4500, 28271, 649, 1101, 1520, 311, 12192, 3674, 96393, 323, 264, 5647, 315, 4029, 11, 902, 649, 387, 459, 3062, 8331, 304, 18189, 19542, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
