his theme adds a layer of depth and complexity to the poem, suggesting that there is more to life than the immediate, tangible world.\n4. **Longing**: The poem\'s focus on making love in the darkness implies a sense of longing or yearning for human connection. This theme is closely tied to the idea of loneliness, suggesting that the speaker is seeking to fill the void left by their isolation.\n\nOverall, the poem explores the complex and often contradictory nature of human emotions, highlighting the importance of intimacy and connection in the face of loneliness and uncertainty.', token_ids=[791, 33894, 41424, 3892, 22100, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 54324, 55798, 96618, 578, 33894, 12302, 555, 23524, 279, 9958, 330, 66, 28609, 1093, 1193, 75040, 649, 498, 6376, 264, 87163, 7918, 16630, 323, 82003, 279, 7057, 315, 31398, 13, 1115, 7057, 374, 4726, 49680, 555, 279, 4623, 315, 3339, 3021, 304, 279, 27394, 11, 902, 13533, 264, 12876, 369, 3823, 3717, 304, 279, 35446, 315, 99544, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1090, 318, 2826, 96618, 578, 33894, 596, 5357, 389, 3339, 3021, 304, 279, 27394, 22020, 279, 7057, 315, 66264, 11, 23377, 264, 5655, 14604, 323, 7106, 3717, 1990, 1403, 1274, 13, 1115, 7057, 374, 13168, 291, 449, 279, 75040, 315, 279, 9958, 11, 82003, 279, 12939, 315, 3823, 3717, 304, 279, 3663, 315, 31398, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 44, 96357, 96618, 578, 33894, 596, 1005, 315, 279, 9958, 323, 27394, 11705, 264, 5647, 315, 23347, 11, 3721, 10979, 264, 5647, 315, 279, 9987, 323, 279, 24746, 13, 1115, 7057, 11621, 264, 6324, 315, 8149, 323, 23965, 311, 279, 33894, 11, 23377, 430, 1070, 374, 810, 311, 2324, 1109, 279, 14247, 11, 50401, 1917, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 6720, 287, 96618, 578, 33894, 596, 5357, 389, 3339, 3021, 304, 279, 27394, 24897, 264, 5647, 315, 79422, 477, 1060, 1251, 369, 3823, 3717, 13, 1115, 7057, 374, 15499, 17791, 311, 279, 4623, 315, 75040, 11, 23377, 430, 279, 19114, 374, 11125, 311, 5266, 279, 742, 2163, 555, 872, 31398, 382, 28589, 11, 279, 33894, 41424, 279, 648