teak on the grill or grill pan and cook for about 4-5 minutes per side, or until it reaches your desired level of doneness. For medium-rare, cook for 8-10 minutes total.\n\n**Step 5: Finish with the Gochujang Glaze and Smoked Pineapple**\n\nOnce the steak is cooked, brush the gochujang glaze all over the steak, making sure to coat it evenly. Place the smoked pineapple slices on top of the steak and serve immediately.\n\nThis unique cooking method combines the bold flavors of gochujang with the sweetness of smoked pineapple, creating a truly unforgettable steak experience. The caramelized pineapple adds a pop of color and texture to the dish, making it perfect for a special occasion or dinner party.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 5016, 1648, 311, 4394, 264, 50059, 1473, 334, 42, 46295, 12, 2377, 85343, 449, 480, 5059, 9832, 526, 8444, 10033, 323, 4487, 11059, 42609, 23182, 57277, 2520, 264, 94631, 323, 43395, 20441, 50059, 11, 1456, 17677, 433, 1701, 264, 16526, 53161, 1749, 430, 33511, 279, 94760, 32523, 315, 733, 331, 9832, 526, 320, 42, 46295, 59717, 25982, 8, 449, 279, 64550, 315, 48637, 78182, 13, 5810, 596, 1268, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 32266, 279, 85343, 57277, 25017, 264, 1579, 22867, 20735, 19494, 477, 13619, 78060, 50059, 11, 922, 220, 16, 12, 16, 13, 20, 15271, 12314, 13, 14598, 279, 50059, 449, 264, 21655, 315, 12290, 11, 3776, 25349, 11, 323, 264, 50346, 315, 13465, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 7557, 279, 480, 5059, 9832, 526, 8444, 10033, 57277, 644, 264, 2678, 19737, 857, 11, 16343, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 733, 331, 9832, 526, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 29839, 19737, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 14198, 13465, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 20228, 47205, 11, 323, 220, 16, 62611, 315, 92223, 5707, 13, 1254, 3267, 3156, 11113, 13, 40224, 279, 21655, 311, 264, 62915, 927, 11298, 8798, 323, 4394, 369, 922, 220, 20, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 2840, 10033, 706, 12314, 6901, 10284, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 54304, 279, 42609, 23182, 57277, 4808, 20559, 701, 40158, 477,