s (e.g., documents, images, videos)\n\t* Messaging: enable team members to send messages to each other, with the option to @mention colleagues\n\t* Commenting: allow team members to comment on shared files and messages\n\t* Notifications: send notifications to team members when someone comments or shares a file\n3. Functionality:\n\t* Integrate with existing project management tools (e.g., Trello, Asana) for seamless collaboration\n\t* Allow team members to create and manage their own channels for specific projects or topics\n\t* Enable team members to search for files and messages using keywords and tags\n\n**Design Deliverables:**\n\n1. Wireframes: create low-fidelity wireframes to visualize the tool's layout and functionality\n2. High-Fidelity Prototype: create a high-fidelity prototype to test the tool's usability and user experience\n3. Design System: develop a design system that outlines the visual design, typography, and color scheme for the tool\n4. User Documentation: create user documentation that explains how to use the tool, including tutorials and FAQs\n\n**Timeline:**\n\n* Research and planning: 2 days\n* Wireframing and prototyping: 4 days\n* Design development: 6 days\n* Testing and iteration: 4 days\n* Final design delivery: 2 days\n\n**Design Team:**\n\n* [Name], Lead Designer\n* [Name], UX Designer\n* [Name], Visual Designer\n* [Name], Interaction Designer\n\n**Project Manager:**\n\n* [Name], Project Manager\n\n**Deadline:** [Date]\n\n", token_ids=[334, 6396, 35527, 25, 57277, 334, 6396, 4076, 68063, 7127, 264, 31966, 13782, 369, 15774, 8068, 17384, 271, 334, 79406, 68063, 4324, 264, 1217, 22658, 323, 7524, 10758, 5507, 369, 5419, 2128, 3697, 311, 4430, 2038, 11, 51696, 11, 323, 4822, 6177, 389, 2447, 5208, 382, 334, 11037, 25, 57277, 9, 578, 5507, 1288, 387, 15987, 389, 17963, 323, 6505, 7766, 198, 9, 1102, 1288, 2187, 2128, 3697, 311, 4430, 3626, 11, 6743, 11, 323, 9013, 198, 9, 1102, 1288, 7431, 1972, 7394, 41365, 323, 571, 30348, 287, 369, 422