Output~2025-04-24 16:39:54.185715: [RequestOutput(request_id=257, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the painting "The Great Wave off Kanagawa" by Katsushika Hokusai. ### Response:\'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 19354, 330, 791, 8681, 32418, 1022, 31663, 351, 14406, 1, 555, 735, 1900, 1136, 11755, 473, 91176, 2192, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='"The Great Wave off Kanagawa" is a renowned woodblock print created by the Japanese artist Katsushika Hokusai in the early 19th century. The painting is part of a series of prints known as "Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji," which showcases the iconic Japanese mountain from different vantage points.\n\nThe print depicts a massive wave about to break, with the snow-capped peak of Mount Fuji visible in the background. The wave is rendered in bold, expressive brushstrokes, with white foam and spray flying off its crest. The wave\'s movement is dynamic and turbulent, as if it\'s about to engulf the nearby boats and shore.\n\nIn the foreground, a few boats are seen riding the wave, their sails and masts bent and twisted by the force of the water. The boats are tiny in comparison to the massive wave, emphasizing the power and fury of the ocean. The composition is carefully balanced, with the wave\'s crest forming a diagonal line that leads the viewer\'s eye to the majestic peak of Mount Fuji.\n\nThe print is characterized by its use of bold, vibrant colors, with the wave\'s white foam and spray contrasting with the deep blues and greens of the ocean. The overall effect is one of energy, movement, and drama, capturing the awe-inspiring power of nature. "The Great Wave off Kanagawa" is widely considered one of the most iconic and influential works of Japanese art, and its imagery has been reproduced and parodied countless times in popular culture.', token_ids=[10227, 8681, 32418, 1022, 31663, 351, 14406, 1, 374, 264, 37048, 7732, 4677, 1194, 3549, 555, 279, 11002, 10255, 735, 1900, 1136, 11755, 473, 91176, 2192, 304, 279, 4216, 220, 777, 339, 9478, 13, 578, 19354, 374, 961, 315, 264, 4101, 315, 24370, 3967, 439, 330, 92702, 55541, 25987, 315, 10640, 88153, 1359, 902, 71849, 279, 27373, 11002, 16700, 505, 2204, 348, 25843, 3585, 382, 791, 1194, 62991, 264, 11191, 12330, 922, 311, 1464, 11, 449, 279, 12056, 1824, 5795, 16557, 315, 10640, 88153, 9621, 304, 279, 4092, 13, 578, 12330, 374, 23188, 304, 14265, 11, 78223, 15998, 267, 56137, 11, 449, 4251, 32183, 323, 23749, 16706, 1022, 1202, 73024, 13, 578, 12330, 596, 7351, 374, 8915, 323, 83321, 11, 439, 422, 433, 596, 922, 311, 77836, 279, 14373, 32731, 323, 31284, 382, 644, 279, 40405, 11, 264, 2478, 32731, 527, 3970, 20427, 279, 12330, 11, 872, 86105, 323, 296, 12019, 30280, 323, 38817, 555, 279, 5457, 315, 279, 3090, 13, 578, 32731, 527, 13987, 304, 12593, 311, 279, 11191, 12330, 11, 82003, 279, 2410, 323, 64159, 315, 279, 18435, 13, 578, 18528, 374, 15884, 24770, 11, 449, 279, 12330, 596, 73024, 30164, 264, 38336, 1584, 430, 11767, 279, 26792, 596, 8071, 311, 279, 81389, 16557, 315, 10640, 88153, 382, 791, 1194, 374, 32971, 555, 1202, 1005, 315, 14265, 11, 34076, 8146, 11, 449, 279, 12330, 596, 4251, 32183, 323, 23749, 75055, 449, 279, 5655, 44695, 323, 52011, 315, 279, 18435, 13, 578, 8244, 2515, 374, 832, 315, 4907, 11, 7351, 11, 323, 20156, 11, 40880, 279, 51517, 22610, 79863, 2410, 315, 7138, 13, 330, 791, 8681, 32418, 1022, 31663, 351, 14406, 1, 374, 13882, 6646, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 27373, 323, 32549, 