n, in a flash of glory, the sun vanished, leaving behind a sky ablaze with stars, a moon glowing like a silver crescent, and the beach bathed in the soft, ethereal light of twilight. The world was bathed in a peaceful silence, as if the very essence of the day's beauty had been distilled into this one, perfect moment.", token_ids=[2170, 279, 1938, 596, 1620, 11745, 28883, 11, 279, 13180, 24411, 1139, 264, 63577, 13652, 2474, 315, 8369, 82757, 11, 264, 57192, 44084, 33831, 389, 279, 11573, 13, 578, 35174, 11, 3131, 264, 17676, 1584, 11, 6137, 311, 29613, 323, 81045, 11, 439, 422, 59334, 555, 279, 22443, 19779, 315, 264, 30581, 13, 25046, 281, 15872, 323, 1069, 14576, 50459, 1139, 279, 13180, 11, 27115, 5655, 6147, 1139, 50440, 85138, 323, 64942, 2579, 82, 13, 578, 30614, 11, 49104, 291, 449, 37199, 315, 53103, 323, 41420, 11, 9508, 311, 37066, 505, 2949, 11, 439, 422, 72903, 449, 459, 9358, 3177, 382, 791, 3805, 574, 13989, 449, 279, 10437, 41466, 315, 12290, 13284, 323, 279, 29827, 1650, 315, 513, 351, 71523, 11, 872, 58845, 11953, 389, 279, 22443, 46385, 1093, 264, 65464, 62684, 13, 578, 5222, 315, 279, 17301, 11, 264, 6926, 37390, 11, 3984, 264, 65464, 4092, 2854, 11, 439, 279, 43038, 25470, 2788, 323, 85750, 449, 279, 384, 6194, 323, 6530, 315, 279, 1938, 596, 1620, 14269, 382, 2170, 279, 7160, 73307, 4827, 11, 1202, 45220, 84852, 4028, 279, 17301, 11, 25146, 264, 21411, 37066, 389, 279, 3090, 13, 578, 11573, 11, 3131, 264, 90256, 19240, 315, 5820, 11, 14264, 11594, 11, 439, 422, 279, 1633, 1917, 574, 10168, 1202, 11745, 304, 50919, 315, 279, 7160, 596, 1620, 38052, 13, 578, 13180, 11, 1457, 264, 5655, 28601, 315, 97119, 11, 9508, 311, 28334, 449, 459, 1023, 14957, 398, 4907, 11, 439, 422, 279, 1633, 13354, 315, 8903, 574, 1694, 79722, 16651, 449, 1475, 12579, 4545, 382, 3112, 1243, 11, 304, 264, 8381, 315, 27025, 11, 279, 7160, 59581, 11, 9564, 4920, 264, 13180, 98492, 10033, 449, 9958, 11, 264, 18266, 49592, 1093, 264, 15310, 46858, 1189, 11, 323, 279, 11573, 9