ven if and only if one of them is even. Since A-B and A+B are both odd, neither of them can be even, so their sum is even if and only if A is even.\n\nIn either case, the sum of the four primes is even, so the correct answer is:\n\nA. even", token_ids=[10267, 596, 24564, 279, 2728, 2038, 1473, 9, 362, 11, 426, 11, 362, 7826, 11, 323, 362, 80826, 527, 682, 10461, 5219, 627, 9, 578, 2694, 315, 1521, 3116, 50533, 374, 362, 382, 12834, 362, 11, 426, 11, 362, 7826, 11, 323, 362, 80826, 527, 682, 10461, 5219, 11, 814, 527, 682, 10535, 5219, 320, 11945, 369, 279, 13336, 430, 832, 315, 1124, 374, 220, 17, 11, 719, 584, 3358, 2586, 1203, 311, 430, 3010, 3677, 791, 2694, 315, 3116, 10535, 5219, 374, 1524, 422, 323, 1193, 422, 832, 315, 279, 5219, 374, 1524, 13, 8876, 362, 374, 279, 2694, 315, 1521, 3116, 50533, 11, 362, 2011, 387, 1524, 382, 7184, 11, 1095, 596, 2980, 279, 24525, 1473, 9, 1442, 362, 284, 220, 17, 11, 1243, 426, 284, 220, 16, 11, 362, 7826, 284, 220, 16, 11, 323, 362, 80826, 284, 220, 18, 11, 902, 527, 682, 10461, 5219, 13, 763, 420, 1162, 11, 279, 2694, 315, 279, 3116, 50533, 374, 220, 17, 11, 902, 374, 1524, 627, 9, 1442, 362, 871, 220, 17, 11, 1243, 362, 7826, 323, 362, 80826, 527, 2225, 10535, 11, 323, 872, 2694, 374, 1524, 422, 323, 1193, 422, 832, 315, 1124, 374, 1524, 13, 8876, 362, 7826, 323, 362, 80826, 527, 2225, 10535, 11, 14188, 315, 1124, 649, 387, 1524, 11, 779, 872, 2694, 374, 1524, 422, 323, 1193, 422, 362, 374, 1524, 382, 644, 3060, 1162, 11, 279, 2694, 315, 279, 3116, 50533, 374, 1524, 11, 779, 279, 4495, 4320, 374, 1473, 32, 13, 1524, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
