ether, Sophia and Sir Edward faced the dragon, its scales glinting like gold in the fading light. The battle was fierce, with flames and steel clashing in a spectacular display. Sophia, with her quick wit and cunning, used her knowledge of the dragon's weaknesses to guide Sir Edward's attacks. The knight struck true, and with a final blow, Tharros lay defeated.\n\nAs the people of Azura celebrated their victory, Sophia and Sir Edward returned to the castle, where they were greeted as heroes. The king, proud of his daughter's bravery, declared that she would be the one to ride alongside Sir Edward on his future quests, and together they would bring peace and prosperity to the land. And so, the princess and the knight set off into the sunset, ready to face whatever adventures lay ahead.", token_ids=[644, 279, 4363, 315, 15757, 5808, 11, 1405, 279, 7160, 73307, 1139, 279, 35174, 323, 24937, 279, 13180, 449, 82757, 315, 97119, 323, 6761, 11, 264, 6366, 40688, 7086, 71471, 594, 4591, 304, 279, 33684, 315, 18374, 6798, 13, 3005, 574, 3967, 6957, 279, 22651, 369, 1077, 45972, 11, 30481, 11, 323, 86166, 13, 71471, 596, 2324, 574, 832, 315, 19913, 323, 6981, 11, 23712, 555, 279, 28807, 5554, 2857, 11, 9231, 85, 1441, 11, 323, 86131, 13, 4452, 11, 1077, 2919, 1051, 539, 10409, 449, 279, 13783, 22006, 315, 264, 40688, 11, 369, 1364, 1047, 264, 6367, 11939, 482, 311, 13488, 279, 1917, 7953, 279, 33684, 14620, 382, 4054, 1938, 11, 264, 42727, 26161, 7086, 666, 277, 3714, 58842, 5304, 279, 26135, 11, 27027, 4027, 323, 19814, 28578, 433, 4024, 13, 578, 1274, 315, 15757, 5808, 272, 80313, 304, 8850, 11, 323, 279, 11734, 11, 71471, 596, 7126, 11, 2663, 5304, 279, 76813, 478, 47709, 304, 279, 4363, 11, 17177, 22653, 11, 311, 1776, 352, 279, 32236, 382, 51290, 22653, 11, 264, 523, 4023, 27620, 323, 26611, 38490, 11, 11928, 279, 8815, 13, 1283, 41761, 813, 7095, 88, 4179, 291, 11, 10845, 1494, 329, 11, 311, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 26161, 596, 1208, 404, 11, 1405, 568, 1766, 71471, 8748, 3