Output~2025-04-24 16:41:52.850561: [RequestOutput(request_id=310, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List five factors that lead to global warming. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 4330, 9547, 430, 3063, 311, 3728, 24808, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are five factors that contribute to global warming:\n\n1. **Greenhouse gases**: The burning of fossil fuels such as coal, oil, and gas releases carbon dioxide (CO2) and other greenhouse gases into the atmosphere, trapping heat and leading to global warming. Human activities like driving, flying, and using electricity contribute to this emission.\n2. **Deforestation and land-use changes**: The clearing of forests for agriculture, urbanization, and other human activities releases carbon dioxide and reduces the ability of forests to absorb CO2. Forests are a significant carbon sink, and their destruction or degradation contributes to global warming.\n3. **Agriculture**: The production of meat, especially beef, and other animal products leads to the release of methane (CH4) and nitrous oxide (N2O), both potent greenhouse gases. Additionally, the use of synthetic fertilizers and pesticides in agriculture contributes to the production of nitrous oxide.\n4. **Industrial processes**: Industrial activities such as cement production, steel manufacturing, and the production of chemicals and plastics release large amounts of CO2 and other greenhouse gases.\n5. **Population growth and consumption**: As the global population grows, so does the demand for energy, food, and other resources. This increased consumption leads to more greenhouse gas emissions from various sectors, including transportation, energy production, and waste management.\n\nThese factors are interconnected and often have a cumulative effect, contributing to the overall increase in global temperatures and the resulting climate change.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 9547, 430, 17210, 311, 3728, 24808, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 20147, 7830, 45612, 96618, 578, 20252, 315, 31376, 40373, 1778, 439, 11756, 11, 5707, 11, 323, 6962, 19786, 12782, 40589, 320, 8445, 17, 8, 323, 1023, 37647, 45612, 1139, 279, 16975, 11, 93669, 8798, 323, 6522, 311, 3728, 24808, 13, 11344, 7640, 1093, 10043, 11, 16706, 11, 323, 1701, 18200, 17210, 311, 420, 41353, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 2685, 97893, 323, 4363, 25700, 4442, 96618, 578, 33850, 315, 36658, 369, 30029, 11, 16036, 2065, 11, 323, 1023, 3823, 7640, 19786, 12782, 40589, 323, 26338, 279, 5845, 315, 36658, 311, 35406, 7432, 17, 13, 20585, 82, 527, 264, 5199, 12782, 19868, 11, 323, 872, 19814, 477, 53568, 44072, 311, 3728, 24808, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 32, 13130, 554, 96618, 578, 5788, 315, 13339, 11, 5423, 25309, 11, 323, 1023, 10065, 3956, 11767, 311, 279, 4984, 315, 61083, 320, 2198, 19, 8, 323, 25719, 27620, 51180, 320, 45, 17, 46, 705, 2225, 36875, 37647, 45612, 13, 23212, 11, 279, 1005, 315, 28367, 36214, 12509, 323, 61257, 304, 30029, 44072, 311, 279, 5788, 315, 25719, 27620, 51180, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 84212, 11618, 96618, 25563, 7640, 1778, 439, 24532, 5788, 11, 9699, 15266, 11, 323, 279, 5788, 315, 26333, 323, 68386, 4984, 3544, 15055, 315, 7432, 17, 323, 1023, 37647, 45612, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 54471, 6650, 323, 15652, 96618, 1666, 279, 3728, 7187, 28815, 11, 779, 1587, 279, 7631, 369, 4907, 11, 3691, 11, 323, 1023, 5070, 13, 1115, 7319, 15652, 11767, 311, 810, 37647, 6962, 20748, 505, 5370, 26593, 11, 2737, 18386, 11, 4907, 5788, 11, 323, 12571, 6373, 382, 9673, 954