\n\n* Oxygen requirement: Aerobic exercises require the body to use oxygen to produce energy, whereas anaerobic exercises do not rely on oxygen for energy production.\n* Intensity: Aerobic exercises are typically performed at moderate intensity, while anaerobic exercises involve high-intensity efforts.\n* Duration: Aerobic exercises are performed for longer durations, whereas anaerobic exercises involve short bursts of effort.\n* Muscle groups: Aerobic exercises typically involve large muscle groups, whereas anaerobic exercises may focus on specific muscle groups or smaller muscle groups.\n\nIn summary, aerobic exercises are characterized by their moderate intensity, longer duration, and reliance on oxygen for energy production, whereas anaerobic exercises are marked by their high intensity, short duration, and lack of oxygen dependence.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 3984, 2317, 11, 279, 1925, 12062, 1990, 91490, 323, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 527, 1473, 9, 87669, 16686, 25, 64150, 31906, 23783, 1397, 279, 2547, 311, 1005, 24463, 311, 8356, 4907, 11, 20444, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 656, 539, 17631, 389, 24463, 369, 4907, 5788, 627, 9, 1357, 8127, 25, 64150, 31906, 23783, 527, 11383, 10887, 520, 24070, 21261, 11, 1418, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 21736, 1579, 20653, 8127, 9045, 627, 9, 21722, 25, 64150, 31906, 23783, 527, 10887, 369, 5129, 90204, 11, 20444, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 21736, 2875, 66801, 315, 5149, 627, 9, 68427, 5315, 25, 64150, 31906, 23783, 11383, 21736, 3544, 16124, 5315, 11, 20444, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 1253, 5357, 389, 3230, 16124, 5315, 477, 9333, 16124, 5315, 382, 644, 12399, 11, 91490, 23783, 527, 32971, 555, 872, 24070, 21261, 11, 5129, 8250, 11, 323, 54180, 389, 24463, 369, 4907, 5788, 11, 20444, 41390, 261, 31906, 23783, 527, 13160, 555, 872, 1579, 21261, 11, 2875, 8250, 11, 323, 6996, 315, 24463, 44393, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=