 which has applications in areas like self-driving cars, medical diagnosis, and customer service.\n5. **Research and Development**: Computer scientists conduct research to advance the field of computer science, exploring new technologies, and developing innovative solutions to real-world problems.\n6. **Collaboration and Communication**: They work closely with other professionals, such as engineers, designers, and business stakeholders, to ensure that technology solutions meet the needs of users and organizations.\n7. **Troubleshooting and Maintenance**: Computer scientists troubleshoot and maintain existing systems, ensuring they continue to function efficiently and effectively.\n8. **Education and Training**: They educate and train others on the use and development of computer systems, software, and technologies, helping to bridge the gap between technology and society.\n\nIn summary, computer scientists play a crucial role in the modern world by designing, developing, and maintaining the technology that underlies many aspects of our daily lives. Their work has a significant impact on various industries, from healthcare and finance to entertainment and education, and continues to shape the future of technology and society.', token_ids=[644, 279, 6617, 1917, 11, 264, 6500, 28568, 11335, 264, 16595, 3560, 304, 46620, 279, 1648, 584, 3974, 11, 990, 11, 323, 19570, 13, 2435, 527, 8647, 369, 30829, 11, 11469, 11, 323, 7649, 3241, 11, 12035, 11, 323, 6067, 430, 2410, 1057, 7446, 6439, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 315, 279, 1401, 28423, 323, 19564, 315, 264, 6500, 28568, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 21103, 323, 11050, 315, 4476, 323, 15264, 96618, 17863, 14248, 2955, 323, 2274, 3241, 8522, 11, 10565, 6067, 11, 323, 14488, 430, 7431, 603, 311, 2804, 5370, 9256, 11, 1778, 439, 32421, 279, 7757, 11, 11889, 14633, 11, 323, 1701, 3674, 3772, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1061, 18825, 323, 29225, 96618, 2435, 24564, 323, 1920, 3544, 15055, 315, 828, 311, 8819, 26793, 11, 10765, 12912, 11, 323, 1304, 2049