Output~2025-04-24 16:43:40.631013: [RequestOutput(request_id=346, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a Satire article about the coronavirus pandemic ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 13479, 556, 4652, 922, 279, 33333, 28522, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**"Coronavirus Pandemic: A Global Phenomenon of Epic Proportions (and Utterly Unnecessary)"**\n\nIn a shocking turn of events, the world has been gripped by a mysterious illness known as the coronavirus, which has left scientists baffled and the general public in a state of utter panic. But let\'s be real, folks, this is just a minor inconvenience compared to the real crisis: the lack of avocado toast in our refrigerators.\n\nAs the death toll rises to a whopping 10,000 (give or take a few dozen), world leaders are scrambling to find a cure, but let\'s be real, it\'s not like they\'re going to find one anytime soon. I mean, have you seen the state of our healthcare system lately? It\'s like trying to find a needle in a haystack, but the haystack is on fire and the needle is a unicorn.\n\nIn the meantime, the government has implemented a series of "draconian" measures to contain the spread of the virus, including mandatory mask-wearing, social distancing, and the closure of all non-essential businesses. But let\'s be real, these measures are just a thinly veiled attempt to control our minds and turn us into mindless drones who will do their bidding.\n\nAnd don\'t even get me started on the so-called "experts" who are telling us to wash our hands frequently and avoid touching our faces. I mean, come on, who needs personal hygiene when you can just blame the virus on the government and the Illuminati?\n\nBut in all seriousness, the real tragedy here is the impact this pandemic is having on our social lives. I mean, who needs human connection when you can just stay home and binge-watch Netflix for the 12th time this week? And don\'t even get me started on the poor, poor economy. I mean, who needs jobs and financial stability when you can just live off your trust fund and complain about the government on social media?\n\nIn conclusion, the coronavirus pandemic is a total hoax, a government conspiracy to control our minds and steal our avocado toast. But hey, at least we\'ll all have each other... from a safe distance, of course.', token_ids=[334, 1, 10803, 263, 24713, 34606, 8274, 25, 362, 8121, 69883, 6431, 263, 315, 40467, 1322, 403, 919, 320, 438, 17578, 466, 398, 1252, 95317, 10143, 57277, 644, 264, 34734, 2543, 315, 4455, 11, 279, 1917, 706, 1027, 23854, 7069, 555, 264, 26454, 17563, 3967, 439, 279, 33333, 11, 902, 706, 2163, 14248, 65516, 839, 323, 279, 4689, 586, 304, 264, 1614, 315, 22256, 22743, 13, 2030, 1095, 596, 387, 1972, 11, 15687, 11, 420, 374, 1120, 264, 9099, 61109, 7863, 311, 279, 1972, 11501, 25, 279, 6996, 315, 68346, 23211, 304, 1057, 30477, 3046, 382, 2170, 279, 4648, 26936, 38268, 311, 264, 63969, 220, 605, 11, 931, 320, 47530, 477, 1935, 264, 2478, 21030, 705, 1917, 6164, 527, 85327, 311, 1505, 264, 27208, 11, 719, 1095, 596, 387, 1972, 11, 433, 596, 539, 1093, 814, 2351, 2133, 311, 1505, 832, 30194, 5246, 13, 358, 3152, 11, 617, 499, 3970, 279, 1614, 315, 1057, 18985, 1887, 31445, 30, 1102, 596, 1093, 4560, 311, 1505, 264, 31409, 304, 264, 89547, 11, 719, 279, 89547, 374, 389, 4027, 323, 279, 31409, 374, 264, 82930, 382, 644, 279, 33953, 11, 279, 3109, 706, 11798, 264, 4101, 315, 330, 23044, 444, 1122, 1, 11193, 311,