ure even after the rose has faded.\n\nThe poem can also be seen as a commentary on the human experience, where love is often compared to something beautiful and fleeting, like a rose. The speaker is acknowledging that their love is not just a feeling, but a choice that they have made, and that it will continue to grow and flourish even in the face of adversity.\n\nOverall, the poem "My love is like a red, red rose" is a beautiful expression of romantic love, and its meaning is a celebration of the beauty and passion that it brings to our lives.', token_ids=[791, 33894, 330, 5159, 3021, 374, 1093, 264, 2579, 11, 2579, 16392, 1, 374, 264, 11670, 27188, 5041, 329, 11, 323, 1202, 7438, 374, 264, 6366, 7645, 315, 24364, 3021, 13, 578, 33894, 11, 5439, 555, 8563, 51016, 11, 43565, 279, 19114, 596, 3021, 311, 264, 2579, 16392, 11, 82003, 1202, 13444, 11, 11939, 11, 323, 52876, 7138, 382, 791, 16392, 374, 3629, 264, 7891, 315, 3021, 323, 11939, 304, 17649, 323, 32349, 11, 323, 304, 420, 33894, 11, 433, 11105, 279, 19114, 596, 5655, 323, 671, 6714, 3021, 369, 4423, 13, 578, 1005, 315, 279, 3492, 330, 1171, 1, 311, 7664, 279, 16392, 374, 5199, 11, 439, 433, 390, 50369, 264, 5647, 315, 21261, 323, 11939, 13, 578, 16392, 374, 539, 1120, 904, 19664, 23153, 11, 719, 264, 34076, 323, 21933, 832, 430, 41255, 279, 19114, 596, 6666, 323, 21958, 382, 791, 33894, 1101, 29727, 389, 279, 4623, 315, 279, 96435, 7138, 315, 2324, 323, 279, 17190, 1543, 768, 315, 13444, 13, 578, 16392, 11, 1093, 682, 2574, 304, 2324, 11, 374, 3917, 311, 279, 8603, 315, 7138, 323, 690, 9778, 75596, 323, 2815, 13, 4452, 11, 279, 19114, 596, 3021, 374, 539, 1120, 264, 12579, 27555, 11, 719, 264, 5655, 323, 671, 6714, 20356, 430, 690, 46753, 1524, 1306, 279, 16392, 706, 54434, 382, 791, 33894, 649, 1101, 387, 3970, 439, 264, 31710, 389, 279, 3823, 3217, 11, 1405, 3021, 374, 3629, 7863, 311, 2555, 6366, 323, 96435, 11, 1093, 264, 16392, 13, 578, 19114, 374, 61708, 430, 872, 3021, 374, 539, 1120, 264, 8430, 11, 71