electricity bill**: Based on the average electricity rate in California (18.45 cents/kWh), the monthly bill would be:\n\t* 180 kWh × 0.1845/kWh = $33.18 per month\n\nSo, the predicted monthly electricity bill for a 1000 square-foot apartment in California would be approximately $33.18. However, please note that this is a rough estimate and actual bills may vary depending on several factors, such as:\n\n* Actual usage patterns and habits\n* Efficiency of appliances and lighting\n* Climate and insulation of the apartment\n* Any additional features like pool pumps, hot tubs, or electric vehicle charging stations\n\nKeep in mind that this is just an estimate, and actual bills may differ. It's always a good idea to consult with your electricity provider or review your past bills to get a more accurate estimate of your electricity consumption and costs.", token_ids=[1271, 7168, 279, 15438, 18200, 4121, 315, 264, 220, 1041, 15, 9518, 21117, 13455, 304, 7188, 11, 584, 3358, 1205, 311, 2980, 3892, 9547, 430, 7958, 18200, 15652, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 31085, 315, 279, 13240, 7194, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 27388, 18200, 4478, 304, 7188, 96618, 10771, 311, 279, 7188, 3142, 36094, 9849, 11, 279, 5578, 18200, 4478, 304, 7188, 374, 2212, 220, 972, 13, 1774, 31291, 824, 15395, 363, 1617, 21925, 320, 74, 1671, 4390, 17, 13, 3146, 10835, 3275, 1404, 323, 10648, 96618, 362, 220, 1041, 15, 9518, 21117, 13455, 374, 6646, 264, 24070, 28935, 13455, 13, 65064, 459, 5578, 66419, 315, 220, 17, 12, 18, 1274, 11, 584, 649, 16430, 279, 7446, 18200, 10648, 439, 11263, 512, 197, 9, 45623, 25, 220, 16, 12, 17, 96987, 824, 1938, 320, 66463, 220, 605, 12, 508, 13414, 54320, 11, 220, 23, 4207, 45839, 340, 197, 9, 97433, 320, 1116, 65044, 859, 11, 24276, 11, 42374, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 220, 17, 12, 18, 96987, 824, 1938, 198, 197, 9, 68954, 323, 28015, 25, 220, 16, 12, 17, 96987, 824, 1938, 320, 81580, 389, 279, 10182, 323, 49117, 340, 197, 9, 38784, 320, 16027, 11, 6500, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 220, 16, 12, 17, 96