ecies of snakes, lizards, and spiders.\n7. **Antarctica**: Antarctica has no native carnivore species, as it is inhospitable to most life forms due to its extreme climate.\n\nPlease note that these numbers are approximate and may vary depending on the source and classification of species.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 5370, 8336, 11, 2737, 279, 7327, 9323, 369, 45435, 315, 22037, 320, 40, 5576, 45, 8, 323, 12624, 7978, 11, 1618, 527, 279, 66959, 449, 279, 1455, 97733, 4692, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 74691, 96618, 10384, 374, 2162, 311, 279, 8592, 1396, 315, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 449, 927, 220, 8652, 9606, 11, 2737, 69132, 11, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 3091, 295, 1494, 82, 11, 6409, 28043, 11, 8545, 12875, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 34914, 20274, 11, 757, 17172, 1900, 11, 323, 18969, 1441, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 39563, 96618, 13936, 706, 279, 2132, 2902, 7656, 1396, 315, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 449, 927, 220, 5154, 9606, 11, 2737, 259, 33214, 11, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 12056, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 9624, 291, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 88810, 780, 69132, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 323, 39935, 288, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 26287, 5270, 96618, 4892, 5270, 374, 2162, 311, 2212, 220, 3965, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 16700, 69132, 11, 36292, 38552, 11, 75709, 6429, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 39935, 288, 11, 584, 300, 2053, 11, 323, 9148, 1030, 2439, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 26070, 5270, 96618, 4987, 5270, 706, 2212, 220, 4364, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 27840, 67487, 11, 281, 55024, 11, 297, 3757, 2469, 11, 19205, 954, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 39935, 288, 11, 584, 300, 2053, 11, 323, 9148, 1030, 2439, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 31880, 96618, 4606, 706, 2212, 220, 1135, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 90303, 90774, 11, 39935, 288, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 584, 300, 2053, 323, 43132, 1900, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 49137, 96618, 8494, 706, 2212, 220, 508, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 294, 15278, 7183, 11, 934, 68978, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 57196, 11, 326, 35191, 11, 323, 