f copper sheets that are 3/32 of an inch thick, not pure gold.\n\n3. Error: The statue was unveiled on October 28, 1848.\nCorrection: The Statue of Liberty was actually unveiled on October 28, 1886, not 1848.\n\nHere is the corrected paragraph:\n\nThe Statue of Liberty was a gift from France to the United States, designed by French sculptor Frédéric Auguste Bartholdi in the late 19th century. It is made of copper sheets that are 3/32 of an inch thick and is located on Liberty Island, just off the coast of New Jersey. The statue represents freedom and was unveiled on October 28, 1886.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 279, 2380, 61001, 6103, 304, 279, 2728, 14646, 323, 872, 51479, 1473, 16, 13, 4703, 25, 578, 89675, 315, 32492, 574, 6319, 555, 11726, 23245, 480, 15891, 627, 85655, 25, 578, 89675, 315, 32492, 574, 3604, 6319, 555, 8753, 27863, 269, 2939, 15433, 39965, 6287, 68, 89764, 820, 72, 11, 539, 23245, 480, 15891, 382, 17, 13, 4703, 25, 578, 89675, 315, 32492, 374, 1903, 315, 10748, 6761, 627, 85655, 25, 578, 89675, 315, 32492, 374, 3604, 1903, 315, 24166, 25112, 430, 527, 220, 18, 14, 843, 315, 459, 17560, 12314, 11, 539, 10748, 6761, 382, 18, 13, 4703, 25, 578, 35372, 574, 39297, 389, 6664, 220, 1591, 11, 220, 10336, 23, 627, 85655, 25, 578, 89675, 315, 32492, 574, 3604, 39297, 389, 6664, 220, 1591, 11, 220, 9367, 21, 11, 539, 220, 10336, 23, 382, 8586, 374, 279, 37065, 14646, 1473, 791, 89675, 315, 32492, 574, 264, 8352, 505, 9822, 311, 279, 3723, 4273, 11, 6319, 555, 8753, 27863, 269, 2939, 15433, 39965, 6287, 68, 89764, 820, 72, 304, 279, 3389, 220, 777, 339, 9478, 13, 1102, 374, 1903, 315, 24166, 25112, 430, 527, 220, 18, 14, 843, 315, 459, 17560, 12314, 323, 374, 7559, 389, 32492, 10951, 11, 1120, 1022, 279, 13962, 315, 1561, 16228, 13, 578, 35372, 11105, 11542, 323, 574, 39297, 389, 6664, 220, 1591, 11, 220, 9367, 21, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_ca