Output~2025-04-24 16:46:03.955503: [RequestOutput(request_id=415, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a list of fashion trends for Spring 2021. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 1160, 315, 11401, 18845, 369, 12531, 220, 2366, 16, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Based on the latest fashion forecasts and trends, here's a list of fashion trends that are expected to dominate the Spring 2021 season:\n\n**1. Neon Colors**: Neon hues are back in a big way, with bright and bold shades of pink, green, yellow, and orange making a statement on runways and streets alike.\n\n**2. Utility Chic**: Practicality meets fashion with utility-inspired clothing, featuring functional details like pockets, buckles, and zippers. Think cargo pants, combat boots, and utility jackets.\n\n**3. 80s Revival**: The 80s are back, baby! Expect to see plenty of retro-inspired silhouettes, bold prints, and statement accessories like oversized sunglasses and chunky jewelry.\n\n**4. Sustainable Fashion**: As consumers become more eco-conscious, sustainable fashion is taking center stage. Look for clothing made from recycled materials, upcycled fabrics, and second-hand shopping.\n\n**5. Soft Pastels**: Soft, delicate pastel shades are a key trend for Spring 2021, adding a touch of whimsy and romance to everything from dresses to tops and accessories.\n\n**6. Corsetry**: Corset-inspired tops and dresses are a major trend, offering a nod to the Victorian era's love of corsetry. Expect to see lacing, boning, and other structural details.\n\n**7. Crochet and Lace**: Crochet and lace are back in a big way, adding a touch of bohemian charm to everything from tops to dresses and even shoes.\n\n**8. Oversized Silhouettes**: Oversized clothing is still going strong, with loose-fitting silhouettes dominating the runways and streets. Think loose-fitting dresses, wide-leg pants, and oversized jackets.\n\n**9. Statement Accessories**: Statement accessories are a must-have for Spring 2021, with oversized hats, chunky jewelry, and bold handbags making a statement.\n\n**10. Comfortable Shoes**: Comfort is key for Spring 2021, with comfortable shoes like sneakers, sandals, and loafers taking center stage. Say goodbye to stilettos and hello to practical footwear!\n\nThese are just a few of the fashion trends that are expected to dominate the Spring 2021 season. Whether you're looking to refresh your wardrobe or simply stay on top of the latest fashion trends, these styles are sure to inspire!", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 5652, 11401, 51165, 323, 18845, 11, 1618, 596, 264, 1160, 315, 11401, 18845, 430, 527, 3685, 311, 41836, 279, 12531, 220, 2366, 16, 3280, 1473, 334, 16, 13, 78064, 9718, 96618, 78064, 82757, 527, 1203, 304, 264, 2466, 1648, 11, 449, 10107, 323, 14265, 37199, 315, 18718, 11, 6307, 11, 14071, 11, 323, 19087, 3339, 264, 5224, 389, 1629, 2336, 323, 14708, 27083, 382, 334, 17, 13, 26230, 71820, 96618, 66736, 488, 20628, 11401, 449, 15919, 53161, 17895, 11, 16850, 16003, 3649, 1093, 30278, 11, 22786, 645, 11, 323, 1167, 32997, 13, 21834, 26735, 25567, 11, 12896, 26302, 11, 323, 15919, 61242, 382, 334, 18, 13, 220, 1490, 82, 10315, 4023, 96618, 578, 220, 1490, 82, 527, 1203, 11, 8945, 0, 33185, 311, 1518, 11510, 315, 17189, 53161, 5554, 18664, 47003, 11, 14265, 24370, 11, 323, 5224, 23090, 1093, 62305, 60469, 323, 12143, 88, 31817, 382, 334, 19, 13, 61593, 31700, 96618, 1666, 13723, 3719, 810, 42688, 66666, 11, 22556, 11401, 37