asted vegetables. The portion was generous, and we left feeling satisfied but not stuffed.\n\nThe prices were reasonable, and the service was prompt and friendly. Overall, I would highly recommend La Taqueria to anyone looking for a delicious and authentic Mexican meal. The only reason I didn't give it a full 5 stars is that the music was a bit too loud, making it difficult to carry on a conversation at times. However, this is a minor quibble, and we will definitely be back to try more of their menu items.", token_ids=[334, 19, 13, 20, 14, 20, 9958, 57277, 40, 6051, 1047, 279, 17069, 315, 18397, 520, 5034, 24172, 16339, 689, 11, 323, 358, 2011, 2019, 11, 433, 574, 264, 50189, 3217, 13, 5659, 279, 4545, 584, 15203, 304, 11, 279, 8369, 323, 42292, 16975, 7214, 2231, 603, 520, 14553, 13, 578, 10799, 574, 34076, 323, 34966, 11, 449, 8776, 24160, 21130, 323, 49277, 4731, 6376, 279, 16630, 369, 264, 2523, 323, 59937, 15496, 382, 8140, 3622, 11, 30397, 11, 574, 73898, 323, 42066, 11, 4737, 279, 892, 311, 10552, 279, 5130, 323, 1304, 19075, 13, 1226, 3940, 449, 279, 1709, 96708, 1286, 11, 902, 574, 47985, 323, 7878, 11, 10434, 449, 73624, 16831, 6374, 24512, 430, 1051, 4832, 369, 25661, 34807, 709, 279, 18406, 24522, 382, 2520, 856, 1925, 3388, 11, 358, 41867, 369, 279, 95954, 439, 2649, 85501, 11, 902, 1550, 539, 14429, 13, 578, 61733, 50059, 574, 28682, 323, 94631, 11, 10434, 449, 264, 28771, 13651, 315, 829, 332, 978, 291, 45697, 323, 29519, 58573, 13, 578, 16831, 34344, 1051, 8579, 323, 628, 2205, 11, 323, 279, 74314, 3703, 9076, 264, 8205, 315, 2671, 311, 923, 459, 5066, 10536, 382, 5159, 22489, 596, 48438, 22235, 7951, 29141, 574, 1101, 264, 4295, 11, 19937, 449, 264, 28771, 10695, 315, 27994, 11, 17604, 11, 323, 54662, 24822, 13, 578, 13651, 574, 28771, 11, 323, 584, 2163, 8430, 20097, 719, 539, 45413, 382, 791, 7729, 1051, 13579, 11, 323, 279, 2532, 574, 10137, 323, 11919, 13, 28993, 11, 358, 1053, 7701, 7079, 5034, 24172, 16339, 689, 311, 5606, 3411, 369, 264, 1840