man Warders (also known as Beefeaters).\n* 12:00 PM: Take a stroll along the South Bank of the Thames, which offers great views of the city and the river. Stop by the Borough Market for lunch and try some artisanal foods and drinks.\n* 2:00 PM: Visit the Tate Modern, a museum of modern and contemporary art that is housed in a former power station.\n* 5:00 PM: Take a ride on the London Eye, a giant Ferris wheel that offers panoramic views of the city.\n* 7:30 PM: Enjoy dinner at a classic London restaurant, such as Simpson's-in-the-Strand or Rules.\n\n**Day 3:**\n\n* 9:00 AM: Start the day in the trendy Notting Hill neighborhood, where you can explore the famous Portobello Road Market and its many vintage shops and street food stalls.\n* 12:00 PM: Visit the nearby Kensington Palace, where you can take a tour of the State Rooms and see the gardens.\n* 2:00 PM: Take a walk in one of London's many royal parks, such as Hyde Park or Regent's Park.\n* 4:00 PM: Visit the National Gallery, which houses a vast collection", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 12090, 74004, 369, 264, 2380, 11477, 8577, 311, 7295, 11, 9635, 1473, 334, 10369, 220, 16, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 24, 25, 410, 6912, 25, 5256, 279, 1938, 520, 96011, 31396, 11, 279, 4033, 22423, 315, 279, 8013, 63854, 11, 311, 3821, 279, 51269, 315, 279, 12542, 22260, 627, 9, 220, 605, 25, 966, 6912, 25, 12040, 264, 2875, 4321, 311, 6295, 7505, 323, 279, 58759, 315, 20302, 11, 1405, 499, 649, 1935, 264, 33687, 7364, 315, 279, 18526, 4857, 627, 9, 220, 16, 25, 410, 5975, 25, 37294, 16163, 520, 264, 8776, 6498, 6814, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 32269, 12225, 451, 921, 90345, 45419, 477, 279, 12168, 81560, 17382, 627, 9, 220, 17, 25, 966, 5975, 25, 19545, 279, 8013, 16730, 11, 902, 15316, 264, 13057, 4526, 315, 36136, 505, 2212, 279, 1917, 11, 2737, 279, 16870, 27625, 14637, 323, 279, 4072, 8326, 2947, 39863, 627, 9, 220, 21, 25, 410, 5975, 25, 23485, 14177, 520, 264, 58930, 10960, 304, 279, 58930, 1443, 3093, 1641, 12818, 11, 1778, 439, 49268, 