hensive network of bike lanes, bike-share systems, and secure parking facilities to encourage cycling as a viable transportation option.\n2. **Pedestrian-Friendly Infrastructure**: Improve pedestrian infrastructure, including sidewalks, crosswalks, and pedestrian bridges, to ensure safe and accessible walking routes.\n3. **Shared Mobility**: Introduce shared mobility services, such as car-sharing and bike-sharing, to reduce the number of privately owned vehicles on the road.\n\n**III. Intelligent Transportation Systems (ITS)**\n\n1. **Smart Traffic Management**: Implement intelligent traffic management systems to optimize traffic flow, reduce congestion, and minimize travel times.\n2. **Real-Time Information**: Provide real-time information to passengers through digital displays, mobile apps, and social media to enhance the overall travel experience.\n3. **Intelligent Parking**: Implement smart parking systems that guide drivers to available parking spots, reducing congestion and emissions.\n\n**IV. Alternative Modes of Transportation**\n\n1. **Water Transportation**: Develop a water transportation system, including ferries and water taxis, to connect waterfront areas and reduce traffic congestion.\n2. **Electric Vehicle Incentives**: Offer incentives for electric vehicle adoption, such as tax breaks, parking perks, and preferential access to HOV lanes.\n3. **Car-Sharing and Carpooling**: Promote car-sharing and carpooling services to reduce the number of privately owned vehicles on the road.\n\n**V. Implementation and Funding**\n\n1. **Public-Private Partnerships**: Collaborate with private companies to finance and develop transportation infrastructure projects.\n', token_ids=[334, 28660, 367, 12761, 369, 264, 4409, 449, 48090, 40629, 34871, 57277, 2170, 279, 3363, 11704, 11295, 7187, 6650, 11, 433, 374, 7718, 311, 2274, 264, 16195, 18386, 6425, 430, 14564, 279, 7859, 18651, 389, 279, 6484, 14054, 13, 578, 11223, 6425, 22262, 311, 3493, 264, 22556, 11, 11297, 11, 323, 15062, 18386, 1887, 430, 20628, 279, 3966, 315, 11062, 11, 82821, 11, 323, 15613, 382, 334, 40, 13, 3142, 30978, 8304, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 15423, 48090, 46955, 320, 33, 5463, 8, 744, 96618, 32175, 264, 426, 5463, 1887, 449, 12514, 5951, 34125, 11, 6617, 34480, 11, 323, 25530, 18386, 6067, 320, 14813, 8, 311, 8108, 55146, 323, 5944, 3115, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 14235, 24720, 46955, 320, 43, 5463, 8, 744, 96618, 51241, 279, 6484, 445, 5463, 4009, 311, 4667, 3682, 14740, 19169, 11, 20658, 5789, 11, 323, 8518, 27536, 11, 8405, 459, 11297, 323, 57340, 11919, 3072, 369, 82821, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 1110, 7129, 261, 24720, 96618, 29757, 685, 279, 89103, 13881, 2532, 555, 7859, 279, 11900, 315, 28788, 11, 33018, 502, 11543, 11, 323, 47035, 14054, 311, 29376, 7982, 24023, 7631, 382, 334, 5660, 13, 11842, 5364, 10088, 1534, 30978, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 34, 16404, 45587, 96618, 8000, 264, 16195, 4009, 315, 13260, 34125, 11, 13260, 60820, 6067, 11, 323, 9966, 13217, 13077, 311, 15253, 33162, 439, 264, 31528, 18386, 3072, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 36294, 478, 7414, 7424, 18260, 45587, 96618, 65184, 47854, 14054, 11, 2737, 82835, 11, 5425, 19599, 82, 11, 323, 47854, 40073, 11, 311, 6106, 6220, 323, 15987, 11689, 11543, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 17430, 63410, 96618, 1357, 48945, 6222, 31139, 3600, 11, 1778, 439, 1841, 55856, 323, 13260, 55856, 11, 311, 8108, 279, 1396, 315, 38171, 13234, 11731, 389, 279, 5754, 382, 334, 23440, 13, 78188, 30978, 15264, 320, 14813, 33395, 271, 16, 13, 3146, 34917, 38081, 9744, 96618, 32175, 25530, 9629, 6373, 6067, 311, 30536, 9629, 6530, 11, 8108, 55146, 11, 323, 30437, 5944, 3115, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 13058, 55585, 8245, 96618, 40665, 1972, 7394, 2038, 311, 22961, 1555, 7528, 19207, 11, 6505, 10721, 11, 323, 3674, 3772, 311, 18885, 279, 8244, 5944, 3217, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 1090, 21149, 41282, 96618, 32175, 7941, 13217, 6067, 430, 8641, 12050, 311, 2561, 13217, 19300, 11, 18189, 55146, 323, 20748, 382, 334, 3166, 13, 42209, 82789, 315, 30978, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 293