ght entertainment options?\n\n**Flight Attendant:** Absolutely! We have a wide selection of movies, TV shows, music, and games available on our in-flight entertainment system. You can access it through the screen in front of you or through our app on your personal device.\n\n**Customer:** That sounds great. I think I'll check it out. Thanks again for your help.\n\n**Flight Attendant:** You're welcome! Enjoy your flight, and don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything else.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 21976, 1990, 264, 6130, 323, 264, 11213, 65022, 369, 264, 11277, 12141, 1473, 334, 13084, 68063, 21694, 11, 358, 2846, 12304, 311, 387, 389, 420, 11213, 311, 1561, 4356, 13, 3053, 358, 636, 264, 9168, 315, 3090, 11, 4587, 1980, 334, 46405, 7867, 20995, 68063, 5046, 3388, 0, 358, 4265, 387, 6380, 311, 636, 430, 369, 499, 13, 1226, 2351, 2103, 389, 279, 5015, 11, 779, 433, 596, 264, 2294, 892, 311, 636, 23183, 304, 13, 3053, 358, 1101, 3085, 499, 264, 40459, 477, 264, 17222, 311, 1212, 701, 11213, 1022, 1314, 1980, 334, 13084, 68063, 3011, 10578, 2294, 11, 9901, 499, 13, 358, 3358, 1935, 264, 9168, 315, 3090, 323, 264, 17222, 11, 4587, 382, 334, 46405, 7867, 20995, 68063, 40991, 1314, 709, 13, 320, 89112, 6130, 264, 9168, 315, 3090, 323, 264, 17222, 8, 5810, 499, 733, 0, 1226, 3358, 387, 4737, 1022, 304, 1120, 264, 2478, 4520, 11, 779, 1304, 2771, 701, 10954, 76948, 374, 52123, 5043, 6901, 323, 682, 14683, 7766, 527, 304, 44024, 3941, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 25545, 433, 11, 9523, 13, 3053, 358, 2610, 11, 374, 1070, 904, 95167, 3685, 389, 420, 11213, 1980, 334, 46405, 7867, 20995, 68063, 1226, 2351, 23132, 264, 11113, 12141, 11, 719, 439, 2744, 11, 584, 3358, 387, 10494, 459, 8071, 389, 279, 9282, 4787, 13, 1442, 1070, 527, 904, 4442, 11, 584, 3358, 1095, 499, 1440, 13, 763, 279, 33953, 11, 2733, 1949, 311, 12234, 323, 4774, 701, 11213, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 8681, 11, 9523, 369, 20806, 757, 1440, 13, 3053, 358, 1101, 2610, 922, 279, 304, 77303, 16924, 2671, 1980, 3