its, it also raises important ethical and societal concerns, such as job displacement, data privacy, and bias.\n\nIn conclusion, while "AI is the new electricity" is an oversimplification, it does highlight the significant impact AI is having on our world. As we continue to develop and refine AI technologies, it\'s crucial that we prioritize responsible innovation, ensuring that the benefits of AI are shared equitably and that its potential risks are mitigated.', token_ids=[3923, 459, 41765, 5224, 0, 330, 15836, 374, 279, 502, 18200, 1, 374, 264, 3463, 10039, 85, 10979, 3802, 430, 55688, 264, 12401, 24481, 382, 644, 28591, 11, 420, 5224, 13533, 430, 59294, 22107, 320, 15836, 8, 374, 10671, 439, 64564, 323, 87435, 439, 18200, 574, 304, 279, 3347, 13, 4702, 439, 18200, 14110, 1534, 279, 1648, 584, 3974, 11, 990, 11, 323, 16681, 449, 1855, 1023, 11, 15592, 374, 54946, 311, 617, 264, 4528, 5536, 389, 1057, 6439, 382, 644, 1690, 5627, 11, 420, 5224, 25562, 837, 13, 15592, 374, 2736, 46890, 5370, 19647, 11, 505, 18985, 323, 17452, 311, 18386, 323, 6873, 13, 1102, 596, 28462, 33762, 11, 18899, 15374, 11, 323, 6968, 502, 10708, 369, 19297, 13, 23674, 11, 15592, 374, 10671, 15098, 15987, 11, 449, 83787, 304, 5780, 6975, 323, 5933, 4221, 8863, 3339, 433, 8831, 369, 13707, 311, 32172, 15592, 1139, 872, 8522, 382, 11458, 11, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 25670, 430, 15592, 374, 2103, 304, 1202, 4216, 18094, 315, 4500, 11, 323, 1202, 2539, 4754, 374, 3686, 311, 387, 15393, 13, 6104, 15592, 706, 279, 4754, 311, 4546, 922, 5199, 7720, 11, 433, 1101, 25930, 3062, 31308, 323, 59529, 10742, 11, 1778, 439, 2683, 44153, 11, 828, 12625, 11, 323, 15837, 382, 644, 17102, 11, 1418, 330, 15836, 374, 279, 502, 18200, 1, 374, 459, 17918, 6517, 2461, 11, 433, 1587, 11415, 279, 5199, 5536, 15592, 374, 3515, 389, 1057, 1917, 13, 1666, 584, 3136, 311, 2274, 323, 46464, 15592, 14645, 11, 433, 596, 16996, 430, 584, 63652, 8647, 19297, 11, 23391, 430, 279, 7720, 315, 15592, 527, 6222, 3312, 35768, 323, 430, 