behaviors such as cooperation and altruism, but they can also perpetuate negative behaviors such as prejudice and discrimination. The paper also suggests that social networks can be used to promote positive change by targeting specific networks and influencing the attitudes and behaviors of key individuals within those networks.\n\nOverall, the main argument of the paper is that social networks are a powerful force that can shape individuals\' attitudes and behaviors, and that understanding the dynamics of social networks is essential for promoting positive change and addressing social problems.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 5684, 330, 32, 9983, 8304, 430, 88654, 2436, 7867, 21237, 323, 14954, 22965, 498, 279, 1925, 5811, 374, 430, 3674, 14488, 1514, 264, 5199, 3560, 304, 46620, 7931, 6, 33726, 323, 28198, 13, 578, 12283, 30714, 430, 3674, 14488, 11, 902, 527, 4613, 439, 279, 13537, 323, 12135, 1990, 7931, 11, 617, 264, 28254, 5536, 389, 1268, 1274, 1781, 11, 2733, 11, 323, 36792, 382, 791, 5684, 13533, 430, 3674, 14488, 649, 10383, 33726, 323, 28198, 1555, 3892, 24717, 11, 2737, 3674, 10383, 11, 3674, 9764, 11, 323, 3674, 40851, 13, 9983, 10383, 19813, 311, 279, 1648, 304, 902, 7931, 527, 28160, 555, 279, 33726, 323, 28198, 315, 3885, 304, 872, 4009, 13, 9983, 9764, 19813, 311, 279, 1648, 304, 902, 7931, 43530, 264, 5647, 315, 659, 505, 872, 16250, 304, 264, 4040, 1912, 477, 4009, 13, 9983, 40851, 8464, 311, 279, 15375, 12429, 5718, 430, 2633, 7865, 2949, 264, 4040, 1912, 477, 4009, 382, 791, 12283, 18046, 430, 3674, 14488, 649, 617, 2225, 6928, 323, 8389, 6372, 389, 33726, 323, 28198, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 3674, 14488, 649, 12192, 6928, 28198, 1778, 439, 23915, 323, 93592, 2191, 11, 719, 814, 649, 1101, 22313, 6426, 8389, 28198, 1778, 439, 48786, 323, 21934, 13, 578, 5684, 1101, 13533, 430, 3674, 14488, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 12192, 6928, 2349, 555, 25103, 3230, 14488, 323, 66700, 279, 33726, 323, 28198, 315, 1401, 7931, 2949, 1884, 14488, 382, 28589, 11, 279, 1925, 5