Output~2025-04-24 16:52:59.231721: [RequestOutput(request_id=568, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a to-do list for a given holiday. ### Input: Thanksgiving ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 311, 30659, 1160, 369, 264, 2728, 13560, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 37250, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a to-do list for Thanksgiving:\n\n**Pre-Thanksgiving Tasks:**\n\n1. **Plan the menu**: Decide on the dishes to serve, including the main course, sides, and desserts. Consider any dietary restrictions or preferences of your guests.\n2. **Make a guest list**: Confirm the number of guests attending and send out invitations or reminders.\n3. **Shop for ingredients**: Make a list of the necessary ingredients and head to the store to purchase them.\n4. **Prepare the house**: Clean and declutter the living areas, and set the table with a festive tablecloth, plates, and utensils.\n5. **Plan activities**: Consider hosting games, watching a football game, or having a movie marathon to keep guests entertained.\n\n**Thanksgiving Day Tasks:**\n\n1. **Cook the turkey**: Prepare the turkey according to your recipe, and make sure it's cooked to perfection.\n2. **Prepare side dishes**: Cook the sides, such as mashed potatoes, green beans, and stuffing, according to your recipe.\n3. **Set the table**: Set the table with the prepared dishes and add any finishing touches, such as candles or centerpieces.\n4. **Serve and enjoy**: Serve the meal and enjoy the company of your guests.\n5. **Clean up**: Clean up the kitchen and living areas after the meal to ensure a comfortable and relaxing atmosphere.\n\n**Post-Thanksgiving Tasks:**\n\n1. **Send thank-you notes**: Write and send thank-you notes or emails to your guests for coming and celebrating with you.\n2. **Donate leftovers**: Consider donating any leftover food to a local food bank or shelter.\n3. **Take down decorations**: Remove any decorations and put away any items that were used for the holiday.\n\nI hope this to-do list helps you prepare for a stress-free and enjoyable Thanksgiving!", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 311, 30659, 1160, 369, 37250, 1473, 334, 4808, 12, 13359, 32727, 47571, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 21119, 279, 5130, 96618, 99981, 389, 279, 26863, 311, 8854, 11, 2737, 279, 1925, 3388, 11, 11314, 11, 323, 72513, 13, 21829, 904, 34625, 17294, 477, 19882, 315, 701, 15051, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 8238, 264, 8810, 1160, 96618, 34663, 279, 1396, 315, 15051, 24096, 323, 3708, 704, 59769, 477, 66697, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 20381, 369, 14293, 96618, 7557, 264, 1160, 315, 279, 5995, 14293, 323, 2010, 311, 279, 3637, 311, 7782, 1124, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 51690, 279, 3838, 96618, 9785, 323, 4051, 6339, 279, 5496, 5789, 11, 323, 743, 279, 2007, 449, 264, 59937, 2007, 89054, 11, 25485, 11, 323, 82036, 8839, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 21119, 7640, 96618, 21829, 20256, 3953, 11, 10307, 264, 9141, 1847, 11, 477, 3515, 264, 5818, 45796, 311, 2567, 15051, 65550, 382, 334, 13359, 32727, 6187, 47571, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 59482, 279, 45405, 96618, 32266, 279, 45405, 4184, 311, 701, 11363, 11, 323, 1304, 2771, 433, 596, 30205, 311, 39143, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 51690, 3185, 26863, 96618, 12797, 279, 11314, 11, 1778, 439, 96234, 35267, 11, 6307, 27994, 11, 323, 83616, 11, 4184, 311, 701, 11363, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 1681, 279, 2007, 96618, 2638, 279, 2007, 449, 279, 10235, 26863, 323, 923, 90