, students in a history class might use VR headsets to explore historical sites and environments, while students in a science class might use AR apps to visualize complex concepts, such as the human body or the solar system.\n\nOverall, technology has revolutionized the way we learn and has opened up new opportunities for students to engage with course material, collaborate with peers, and access resources and information from anywhere in the world.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 315, 1268, 5557, 374, 1511, 304, 6873, 1473, 4054, 3187, 315, 1268, 5557, 374, 1511, 304, 6873, 374, 1555, 2930, 6975, 15771, 13, 9176, 16627, 14673, 323, 2930, 3388, 12850, 1005, 6975, 6373, 6067, 320, 43, 4931, 8, 1778, 439, 26782, 11, 5348, 2541, 11, 477, 60543, 311, 6493, 3388, 7384, 11, 32272, 11, 323, 41300, 311, 4236, 13, 4314, 15771, 2187, 4236, 311, 2680, 3388, 2262, 11, 9502, 32272, 11, 323, 19570, 449, 54918, 323, 26081, 505, 12660, 449, 459, 7757, 3717, 382, 2520, 2937, 11, 264, 5575, 304, 264, 7926, 11852, 34458, 538, 2643, 1005, 459, 445, 4931, 311, 1473, 9, 10573, 2835, 46232, 323, 21416, 47590, 311, 22822, 304, 15144, 7754, 198, 9, 19121, 2930, 89323, 323, 32272, 311, 20461, 8830, 315, 3388, 3769, 198, 9, 44581, 349, 304, 2930, 20954, 449, 61190, 323, 54918, 311, 2610, 4860, 323, 4430, 6848, 198, 9, 30270, 5439, 32272, 323, 5371, 11302, 505, 54918, 198, 9, 9742, 2930, 5070, 11, 1778, 439, 384, 84191, 323, 9908, 11, 311, 1862, 872, 6975, 271, 50674, 11, 1690, 16627, 14673, 527, 1101, 1701, 4200, 323, 57088, 8903, 14645, 311, 18885, 279, 6975, 3217, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 4236, 304, 264, 3925, 538, 2643, 1005, 19718, 2010, 5022, 311, 13488, 13970, 6732, 323, 22484, 11, 1418, 4236, 304, 264, 8198, 538, 2643, 1005, 6395, 10721, 311, 51187, 6485, 19476, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 3823, 2547, 477, 279, 13238, 1887, 382, 28589, 11, 5557, 706, 14110, 1534, 279, 1648, 584, 4048, 323, 706, 9107, 709, 502, 10708, 369, 4236, 311, 16988, 449, 3388, 3769, 11, 51696, 449, 26081, 11, 323, 2680, 5