ntihistamines (for allergic reactions)\n\t* Gauze and medical tape\n10. Miscellaneous:\n\t* Flashlight or headlamp\n\t* Extra batteries\n\t* Map and compass\n\t* Sunscreen and insect repellent\n\t* Fire starters (e.g. matches, lighter, firestarters)\n\t* Trash bags and a small shovel for waste disposal\n\nRemember to check the weather forecast and adjust your packing list accordingly. It's also a good idea to check with the campsite for any specific rules or regulations.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 520, 3325, 5899, 3673, 499, 1253, 1390, 311, 3854, 369, 264, 33873, 8577, 1473, 16, 13, 67680, 198, 17, 13, 75247, 9145, 198, 18, 13, 75247, 11262, 198, 19, 13, 72760, 198, 20, 13, 54758, 512, 197, 9, 9636, 12440, 1392, 198, 197, 9, 328, 26246, 198, 197, 9, 350, 49760, 198, 197, 9, 5843, 1355, 8669, 2111, 37824, 198, 197, 9, 67553, 198, 197, 9, 91782, 198, 197, 9, 55870, 477, 23724, 198, 197, 9, 22050, 323, 36516, 320, 81580, 389, 279, 9282, 340, 21, 13, 15819, 23581, 512, 197, 9, 473, 19787, 26302, 198, 197, 9, 8847, 1147, 477, 3090, 15653, 198, 197, 9, 26041, 40086, 198, 22, 13, 2057, 458, 4646, 512, 197, 9, 83499, 37161, 323, 26588, 57968, 198, 197, 9, 1611, 50017, 519, 198, 197, 9, 12371, 536, 78130, 27883, 198, 197, 9, 1443, 48695, 323, 65424, 198, 197, 9, 12371, 536, 78130, 12269, 27883, 198, 197, 9, 8704, 99196, 198, 197, 9, 45956, 84638, 198, 23, 13, 12369, 323, 43402, 512, 197, 9, 11842, 17453, 819, 481, 43402, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 4907, 16283, 11, 31049, 11, 32720, 14098, 340, 197, 9, 19177, 6651, 198, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 11822, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 27994, 11, 75057, 11, 16553, 340, 197, 9, 50141, 323, 9955, 12843, 198, 197, 9, 30260, 14098, 323, 24822, 198, 197, 9, 10164, 27474, 477, 88000, 3854, 198, 197, 9, 57410, 14787, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 33873, 45115, 11, 3419, 11, 82036, 8839, 340, 24, 13, 5629, 12576, 16530, 512, 197, 9, 17366, 1154, 198, 197, 9, 6898, 1082, 27330, 84638, 198, 197, 9, 35567, 59644, 3078, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 65802, 8778, 5237, 268, 1