. As the mist cleared, the prince found himself transported to a realm beyond his wildest dreams.\n\nIn this mystical realm, he encountered wise sages, ancient beings who shared their knowledge and wisdom with him. They taught him about the interconnectedness of all things, the balance of nature, and the importance of harmony between humans and the environment.\n\nThe prince spent many moons in this realm, learning and growing, and when he finally returned to his own world, he was transformed. He brought with him the wisdom and knowledge he had gained, and he used it to bring peace and prosperity to his kingdom. The villagers, who had sent him on his journey, welcomed him back as a hero, and the prince ruled his kingdom with compassion, wisdom, and a deep understanding of the world and its secrets.", token_ids=[2170, 279, 3995, 42826, 31796, 11, 568, 50157, 5304, 264, 8340, 14458, 89777, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 264, 29050, 13952, 13, 578, 61921, 11, 889, 1051, 3967, 369, 872, 25363, 85060, 11, 32069, 1461, 449, 1825, 11977, 13, 2435, 6222, 449, 1461, 872, 24511, 315, 97053, 11, 84709, 11, 323, 83763, 11, 323, 279, 42826, 574, 61914, 555, 872, 7512, 382, 791, 61921, 11, 60199, 279, 42826, 596, 41328, 323, 79340, 29668, 311, 4048, 11, 9076, 1461, 264, 3361, 3465, 13, 2435, 10666, 1461, 449, 264, 26454, 11, 14154, 31348, 3830, 84273, 449, 57216, 1841, 85, 826, 13, 578, 3830, 574, 1071, 311, 6782, 264, 8147, 37739, 430, 1053, 13500, 279, 44830, 38883, 24278, 323, 6677, 382, 791, 42826, 11, 11075, 311, 45063, 279, 24511, 2949, 11, 11928, 279, 8815, 13, 3161, 279, 61921, 6, 19351, 11, 568, 15884, 9107, 279, 3830, 11, 28965, 264, 63172, 315, 8770, 430, 54285, 291, 1461, 13, 1666, 279, 8770, 23803, 11, 279, 42826, 1766, 5678, 40460, 311, 264, 22651, 7953, 813, 31331, 5086, 19226, 382, 644, 420, 69532, 22651, 11, 568, 23926, 24219, 274, 1154, 11, 14154, 23837, 889, 6222, 872, 6677, 323, 24278, 449, 1461, 13, 2435, 15972, 1461, 922, 279, 83416, 2136, 315, 682, 2574, 11, 279, 833