mpeached: Andrew Johnson in 1868 and Bill Clinton in 1998. Both were acquitted by the Senate and remained in office. Richard Nixon resigned from office in 1974 before he could be impeached, and Donald Trump was impeached by the House of Representatives in 2019, but was acquitted by the Senate in 2020.\n\nIn summary, impeachment is a constitutional process that allows Congress to remove a government official from office for wrongdoing, and it is an important check on the power of the executive branch to ensure that officials are held accountable for their actions.', token_ids=[1453, 375, 9064, 374, 264, 25543, 1920, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 3109, 430, 6276, 8151, 311, 4148, 264, 3109, 4033, 505, 5274, 369, 330, 10367, 1525, 11, 93137, 11, 477, 1023, 1579, 17073, 323, 51726, 1105, 1210, 578, 1920, 374, 33740, 304, 13659, 8105, 11, 11360, 220, 19, 315, 279, 3723, 4273, 18039, 11, 902, 5415, 430, 279, 4900, 11, 23270, 4900, 11, 323, 682, 8431, 9808, 649, 387, 36126, 3939, 323, 7108, 505, 5274, 422, 814, 5379, 79359, 11, 93137, 11, 477, 1023, 1579, 17073, 323, 51726, 1105, 382, 791, 64754, 1920, 11383, 12302, 304, 279, 4783, 315, 40845, 11, 1405, 264, 8857, 7055, 374, 2631, 311, 1522, 9908, 315, 64754, 11, 902, 527, 16287, 10405, 2403, 279, 4033, 13, 578, 9908, 315, 64754, 527, 1243, 3288, 311, 279, 10092, 11, 1405, 264, 1403, 45726, 8857, 7055, 374, 2631, 311, 91134, 323, 4148, 279, 4033, 505, 5274, 382, 1453, 375, 9064, 374, 3629, 22568, 449, 17065, 505, 5274, 11, 719, 814, 527, 539, 279, 1890, 3245, 13, 2417, 375, 9064, 374, 279, 1920, 315, 23468, 459, 4033, 449, 65328, 11, 1418, 17065, 505, 5274, 374, 279, 5150, 17065, 315, 279, 4033, 505, 872, 2361, 13, 763, 1023, 4339, 11, 64754, 374, 279, 65506, 11, 1418, 17065, 374, 279, 25060, 382, 644, 279, 3925, 315, 279, 3723, 4273, 11, 1070, 617, 1027, 1403, 13422, 315, 264, 4900, 1694, 36126, 3939, 25, 13929, 11605, 304, 220, 9714, 23, 323, 8766, 8283, 304, 220, 2550, 23, 13, 11995, 1051, 91533, 555, 279, 10092, 323, 14958, 30