Output~2025-04-24 16:55:54.556434: [RequestOutput(request_id=652, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Structures the following instructions into a step by step guide. ### Input: Initiate a conversation with someone on LinkedIn for job related advice. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 71150, 279, 2768, 11470, 1139, 264, 3094, 555, 3094, 8641, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 16065, 6629, 264, 10652, 449, 4423, 389, 33867, 369, 2683, 5552, 9650, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a step-by-step guide to initiate a conversation with someone on LinkedIn for job-related advice:\n\n**Step 1: Find a Relevant Connection**\n\n* Log in to your LinkedIn account and navigate to the "People" tab.\n* Search for someone in your industry or profession who has a job title or role that aligns with your career goals.\n* Filter your search results by "First-degree connections" to find people you already know or have a mutual connection with.\n\n**Step 2: Review Their Profile**\n\n* Click on the profile of the person you\'ve identified as a potential connection.\n* Review their work experience, skills, and education to get a sense of their background and expertise.\n* Take note of any relevant projects, achievements, or awards that demonstrate their credibility in their field.\n\n**Step 3: Craft a Personalized Message**\n\n* Write a personalized message that addresses the person by name and references something specific about their profile or work.\n* Keep your message concise and to the point, focusing on your career goals and what you hope to learn from them.\n* Avoid generic or generic messages that could be sent to anyone.\n\nExample message:\n"Hi [First Name], I came across your profile and was impressed by your work at [Company]. I\'m reaching out because I\'m looking for advice on [specific area of interest]. Would you be willing to chat with me about your experiences and insights?"\n\n**Step 4: Send the Message**\n\n* Click the "Send" button to send your message to the person.\n* Wait for a response, which may take anywhere from a few hours to a few days.\n\n**Step 5: Engage in the Conversation**\n\n* When you receive a response, engage in a conversation by asking follow-up questions and sharing your own experiences and thoughts.\n* Be respectful of the person\'s time and expertise, and avoid asking for too much of their time or attention.\n* Keep the conversation focused on your career goals and what you hope to learn from them.\n\n**Step 6: Follow Up**\n\n* If the person agrees to chat with you, schedule a time to talk and make sure to follow up on your commitment.\n* Take notes during the conversation and follow up with a thank-you message or email to show your appreciation for their time and advice.\n\nBy following these steps, you can initiate a conversation with someone on LinkedIn for job-related advice and gain valuable insights and guidance to help you achieve your career goals.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 8641, 311, 39201, 264, 10652, 449, 4423, 389, 33867, 369, 2683, 14228, 9650, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 7531, 264, 88516, 11278, 57277, 9, 2905, 304, 311, 701, 33867, 2759, 323, 21546, 311, 279, 330, 16298, 1, 5769, 627, 9, 7694, 369, 4423, 304, 701, 5064, 477, 4913, 889, 706, 264, 2683, 2316, 477, 3560, 430, 5398, 82, 449, 701, 7076, 9021, 627, 9, 12619, 701, 2778, 3135, 555, 330, 5451, 38775, 13537, 1, 311, 1505, 1274, 499, 2736, 1440, 477, 617, 264, 27848, 3717, 449, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 10506, 11205, 12609, 57277, 9, 9369, 389, 279, 5643, 315, 279, 1732, 499, 3077, 11054, 439, 264, 4754, 3717, 627, 9, 10506, 872, 990, 3217, 11, 7512, 11, 323, 6873, 311, 636, 264, 5647, 315, 872, 4092, 323, 19248, 627, 9, 12040, 5296, 315, 904, 9959, 7224, 11, 33997, 11, 477, 23146, 430, 20461, 872, 38769, 304, 872, 2115, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 24969, 264, 19758, 1534, 4961, 57277, 9, 9842, 264, 35649, 1984, 430, 14564, 279, 1732, 555, 836, 323, 15407, 2555, 3230, 922, 872, 5643, 477, 990, 627, 9, 13969, 701, 1984, 64694, 323, 311, 279, 1486, 11, 21760, 389, 701, 7076, 9021, 323, 1148, 499, 3987, 311, 4048, 505, 1124, 627, 9, 35106, 14281, 477, 14281, 6743, 430, 1436, 387, 3288, 311, 5606, 382, 13617, 1984, 512, 1, 13347, 510, 5451, 4076, 1145, 358, 3782, 4028, 701, 5643, 323, 574, 25408, 555, 701, 990, 520, 510, 14831, 948, 358, 2846, 19261, 704, 1606, 358, 2846, 3411, 369, 9650, 389, 510, 52340, 3158, 315, 2802, 948, 19418, 499, 387, 10032, 311, 6369, 449, 757, 922, 701, 11704, 323, 26793, 12241, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 11244, 279, 4961, 57277, 9, 9369, 279, 330, 11764, 1, 3215, 311, 3708, 701, 1984, 311, 279, 1732, 627, 9, 14144, 369, 264, 2077, 11, 902, 1253, 1935, 12660, 505, 264, 2478, 4207, 311, 264, 2478, 2919, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 3365, 425, 304, 279, 51930, 57277, 9, 3277, 499, 5371, 264, 2077, 11, 16988, 304, 264, 10652, 555, 10371, 1833, 5352, 4860, 323, 11821, 701, 1866, 11704, 323, 11555, 627, 9, 2893, 49150, 315, 279, 1732, 596, 892, 323, 19248, 11, 323, 5766, 10371, 369, 2288, 1790, 315, 872, 892, 477, 6666, 627, 9, 13969, 279, 10652, 10968, 389, 701, 7076, 9021, 323, 1148, 499, 3987, 311, 4048, 505, 1124, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 21, 25, 11359, 3216, 57277, 9, 1442, 279, 1732, 34008, 311, 6369, 449, 499, 11, 9899, 264, 892, 311, 3137, 323, 1304, 2771, 311, 1833, 709, 389, 701, 15507, 627, 9, 12040, 8554, 2391, 279, 10652, 323, 1