 had done a good job, and that the jungle was a safer place because of her bravery. And with that thought, she drifted off to sleep, dreaming of all the adventures she would have tomorrow.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 1370, 4744, 1473, 47, 8788, 279, 1370, 4744, 574, 264, 34076, 6307, 323, 6437, 12224, 449, 264, 17743, 430, 574, 1120, 439, 10107, 13, 3005, 12439, 304, 264, 43535, 2697, 23634, 304, 264, 5021, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 45520, 11, 23712, 555, 58367, 6307, 11141, 323, 34966, 19837, 13, 94517, 10456, 311, 8493, 1077, 2919, 824, 2454, 389, 264, 9046, 11, 10307, 279, 1917, 733, 555, 323, 8330, 675, 10789, 54945, 15716, 1364, 5602, 2555, 7185, 382, 4054, 1938, 11, 264, 1912, 315, 5906, 5584, 58545, 61820, 3782, 55060, 1555, 279, 12690, 11, 14718, 264, 436, 1983, 355, 323, 39098, 3691, 505, 279, 1023, 10099, 13, 94517, 574, 539, 6380, 922, 420, 323, 6773, 311, 1935, 13146, 1139, 1077, 1866, 387, 587, 13, 3005, 32122, 1523, 505, 1077, 5021, 323, 62920, 1306, 279, 61820, 11, 8330, 675, 10789, 54945, 323, 1344, 3713, 1077, 27296, 311, 1456, 323, 44030, 1124, 3201, 382, 791, 61820, 11, 89815, 555, 279, 11210, 11341, 315, 279, 42442, 1370, 4744, 11, 12504, 872, 23130, 3691, 323, 10837, 1022, 304, 279, 14329, 5216, 13, 94517, 574, 92906, 28022, 11, 3515, 7946, 35844, 1077, 45520, 2162, 13, 5659, 430, 1938, 389, 11, 279, 1023, 10099, 7111, 709, 311, 94517, 439, 264, 12084, 323, 63261, 315, 279, 45520, 382, 2170, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 11, 94517, 6052, 311, 1077, 23634, 11, 19781, 719, 12691, 315, 11937, 13, 3005, 23183, 304, 369, 279, 3814, 11, 1077, 56994, 436, 43435, 323, 1077, 387, 587, 19781, 505, 682, 279, 8330, 675, 10789, 13, 2030, 1364, 7020, 430, 1364, 1047, 2884, 264, 1695, 2683, 11, 323, 430, 279, 45520, 574, 264, 30549, 2035, 1606, 315, 1077, 86166, 13, 1628, 449, 430, 3463, 11, 1364, 92662, 1022, 311, 6212, 11, 56774, 315, 682, 279, 32078, 1364, 1053, 617, 16986, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=sto