Output~2025-04-24 16:57:46.954770: [RequestOutput(request_id=686, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Find all real solutions to\\n\\n1/(x - 1)(x - 2) + 1/(x - 2)(x - 3) + 1/(x - 3)(x - 4) = 1/6.\\nEnter all solutions, separated by commas. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7531, 682, 1972, 10105, 311, 1734, 1734, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 8, 489, 220, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 220, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 284, 220, 16, 14, 21, 7255, 80041, 682, 10105, 11, 19180, 555, 77702, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='To solve this equation, we can start by factoring the left-hand side:\n\n1/(x - 1)(x - 2) + 1/(x - 2)(x - 3) + 1/(x - 3)(x - 4) = (x - 2)/(x - 1)(x - 2) + (x - 3)/(x - 2)(x - 3) + (x - 4)/(x - 3)(x - 4)\n\nSimplifying, we get:\n\n(x - 2)/(x - 1)(x - 2) + (x - 3)/(x - 2)(x - 3) + (x - 4)/(x - 3)(x - 4) = (x - 3)/(x - 1)(x - 3) + (x - 4)/(x - 2)(x - 4)\n\nNow, we can equate the two expressions:\n\n(x - 3)/(x - 1)(x - 3) + (x - 4)/(x - 2)(x - 4) = 1/6\n\nMultiplying both sides by the least common multiple of the denominators, which is (x - 1)(x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4), we get:\n\n(x - 3)(x - 4) + (x - 1)(x - 4) + (x - 1)(x - 3) = (x - 1)(x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4)/6\n\nExpanding and simplifying, we get:\n\nx^2 - 7x + 12 = x^2 - 5x + 4\n\nSubtracting x^2 - 5x + 4 from both sides gives:\n\n-2x + 8 = 0\n\nAdding 2x to both sides gives:\n\n8 = 2x\n\nDividing both sides by 2 gives:\n\nx = 4\n\nSo, the only real solution is x = 4.', token_ids=[1271, 11886, 420, 24524, 11, 584, 649, 1212, 555, 2144, 5620, 279, 2163, 25417, 3185, 1473, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 8, 489, 220, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 220, 16, 12148, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 284, 320, 87, 482, 220, 17, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 19, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 696, 50, 6517, 7922, 11, 584, 636, 1473, 2120, 482, 220, 17, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 19, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 284, 320, 87, 482, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 19, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 696, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 3312, 349, 279, 1403, 24282, 1473, 2120, 482, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 19, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 284, 220, 16, 14, 21, 271, 58351, 6852, 2225, 11314, 555, 279, 3325, 4279, 5361, 315, 279, 62265, 3046, 11, 902, 374, 320, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 705, 584, 636, 1473, 2120, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 8, 489, 320, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 8, 284, 320, 87, 482, 220, 16, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 18, 2432, 87, 482, 220, 19, 5738, 21, 271, 8193, 26673, 323, 15858, 7922, 11, 584, 636, 1473, 87, 61, 17, 482, 220, 22, 87, 489, 220, 717, 284, 865, 61, 17, 482, 220, 20, 87, 489, 220, 19, 271, 3214, 2193, 287, 865, 61, 17, 482, 220, 20, 87, 489, 220, 19, 505, 2225, 11314, 6835, 1473, 12, 17, 87, 489