g the "catcher in the rye," protecting children from falling off a cliff and into the abyss of phoniness and corruption. This symbolizes his desire to preserve childhood innocence and protect others from the corrupting influences of the adult world.\n\nThrough Holden\'s experiences and observations, the novel explores themes of identity, alienation, rebellion, and the struggles of growing up. The book has become a classic of American literature, widely regarded as a relatable and poignant portrayal of adolescent angst and the challenges of transitioning from childhood to adulthood.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 12399, 315, 279, 2363, 330, 791, 21603, 261, 304, 279, 432, 9188, 52518, 10227, 21603, 261, 304, 279, 432, 9188, 1, 374, 264, 11670, 5108, 8838, 44041, 11775, 5439, 555, 622, 920, 13, 8375, 5248, 11, 4756, 304, 220, 6280, 16, 13, 578, 3446, 11263, 279, 46684, 11, 87485, 90538, 2630, 11, 264, 220, 845, 4771, 6418, 1579, 2978, 5575, 11, 439, 568, 34512, 988, 279, 11774, 315, 83909, 323, 1099, 680, 645, 449, 279, 51923, 1918, 323, 59915, 488, 315, 279, 6822, 1917, 382, 791, 3446, 5097, 2035, 927, 279, 3388, 315, 2380, 2919, 11, 2391, 902, 87485, 374, 67331, 505, 264, 41385, 50069, 2978, 11, 47060, 88, 49169, 11, 4245, 311, 8009, 28711, 13, 74658, 40186, 323, 98009, 291, 11, 87485, 35292, 311, 1561, 4356, 4409, 11, 1405, 568, 38202, 279, 3814, 304, 264, 9689, 3130, 11, 42852, 389, 813, 12135, 11, 813, 3938, 11, 323, 279, 51923, 1918, 315, 279, 1917, 2212, 1461, 382, 60105, 279, 11775, 11, 87485, 28970, 449, 16024, 315, 20167, 367, 323, 834, 7898, 11, 8104, 449, 813, 26081, 323, 279, 12884, 304, 813, 2324, 13, 1283, 374, 834, 20345, 7719, 449, 279, 4623, 315, 7982, 709, 323, 10671, 1093, 279, 51923, 552, 568, 62822, 1924, 2212, 1461, 13, 1283, 374, 1101, 57775, 555, 279, 4648, 315, 813, 14992, 10868, 11, 2052, 648, 11, 902, 706, 2163, 264, 5655, 14604, 23087, 382, 791, 11775, 596, 2316, 11, 330, 791, 21603, 261, 304, 279, 432, 9188, 1359, 19813, 311, 87485, 596, 18