brand's personality. Let's add it to the project plan and make it a priority.\n\n**Sarah:** Sounds good to me. I'll start working on the script and you can start brainstorming some ideas for the visuals. We can meet up next week to review our progress and make sure we're on track.\n\n**John:** Sounds like a plan. Thanks for checking in, Sarah. It's always good to collaborate and make sure we're on the same page.\n\n**Sarah:** Absolutely. Let's touch base soon and keep each other updated on our progress.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 21976, 1990, 1403, 18105, 25394, 264, 2447, 814, 527, 3318, 389, 1473, 334, 54183, 68063, 28653, 11, 3842, 11, 1268, 596, 279, 8661, 4901, 5108, 3235, 1980, 334, 13379, 68063, 16770, 11, 433, 596, 5108, 3235, 14297, 719, 22225, 13, 358, 3077, 1027, 3318, 389, 279, 3674, 3772, 8446, 323, 358, 1781, 584, 2351, 3339, 1695, 5208, 13, 3639, 922, 499, 30, 2650, 596, 279, 2262, 9886, 2133, 1980, 334, 54183, 68063, 22335, 11, 358, 3077, 1027, 3318, 389, 279, 5117, 8158, 323, 9908, 13, 1226, 2351, 389, 3839, 311, 3449, 1057, 22143, 11, 719, 358, 2846, 264, 2766, 11920, 922, 279, 4367, 315, 1063, 315, 279, 2262, 13, 358, 1781, 584, 1205, 311, 1304, 2771, 433, 596, 810, 23387, 323, 9959, 311, 1057, 2218, 10877, 382, 334, 13379, 68063, 358, 7655, 13, 358, 3077, 1027, 62464, 430, 1057, 20392, 7969, 617, 1027, 5128, 3428, 389, 3674, 3772, 31445, 13, 358, 1781, 584, 1205, 311, 6651, 2574, 709, 323, 1456, 1063, 502, 20414, 13, 12522, 499, 3463, 922, 6968, 1063, 2835, 2262, 1980, 334, 54183, 68063, 34863, 11, 358, 574, 7422, 922, 430, 2288, 13, 358, 574, 7422, 584, 1436, 1893, 264, 4101, 315, 3327, 1780, 6946, 311, 1520, 10552, 1057, 2027, 304, 264, 810, 9302, 1648, 13, 3639, 656, 499, 1781, 1980, 334, 13379, 68063, 3011, 596, 264, 2294, 4623, 0, 358, 1781, 1057, 10877, 1053, 2216, 6013, 311, 430, 13, 1628, 433, 1053, 387, 264, 1695, 1648, 311, 35883, 1057, 6883, 596, 17743, 13, 6914, 596, 923, 433, 311, 279, 2447, 3197, 323, 1304, 433, 264, 10844, 382, 3