*Construction Process**\n\nThe construction process will be divided into several stages:\n\n1. Site preparation: Clearing and excavation of the seabed, followed by the installation of the pylons.\n2. Cable installation: Laying the cables between the pylons, using a combination of cranes and winches.\n3. Deck construction: Building the concrete deck, using a combination of concrete pumps and formwork.\n4. Finishing work: Installing the railings, lighting, and other finishing touches.\n\n**Timeline**\n\nThe construction timeline is expected to take approximately 24 months, with the following milestones:\n\n* Site preparation and pylon installation: 6 months\n* Cable installation: 6 months\n* Deck construction: 6 months\n* Finishing work: 6 months\n\n**Budget**\n\nThe estimated budget for the project is $50 million, broken down into:\n\n* Materials and equipment: $20 million\n* Labor costs: $15 million\n* Engineering and design: $5 million\n* Contingency fund: $10 million\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nThe proposed bridge design and construction plan will provide a safe and reliable transportation route', token_ids=[334, 33948, 7127, 323, 24987, 9878, 57277, 334, 8006, 35907, 57277, 791, 5915, 315, 420, 2447, 374, 311, 2955, 323, 1977, 264, 14497, 1990, 1403, 30100, 11, 21583, 279, 51115, 311, 264, 8870, 13218, 4029, 13, 578, 14497, 690, 3493, 264, 6220, 323, 15062, 18386, 6149, 369, 11062, 11, 13147, 3600, 11, 323, 11822, 11, 1418, 1101, 22923, 7100, 6650, 323, 4500, 304, 279, 5654, 382, 334, 33948, 7127, 57277, 791, 14497, 690, 387, 264, 14994, 5594, 43995, 14497, 449, 264, 2860, 3160, 315, 220, 16, 11, 2636, 20645, 320, 19, 11, 22536, 7693, 570, 1102, 690, 617, 264, 1925, 9575, 315, 220, 3101, 20645, 320, 23812, 7693, 8, 323, 1403, 3185, 45395, 315, 220, 5067, 20645, 320, 16, 11, 24792, 7693, 8, 1855, 13, 578, 14497, 690, 387, 6319, 311, 51571, 3831, 29592, 11, 66579, 11, 323, 1023, 5933, 51751, 382, 334, 61612, 57277, 791, 14497, 690, 387, 20968, 1701, 1579, 5594, 18323, 969