1840-1926): A founder of Impressionism, Monet was a French painter who is famous for his dreamy, softly focused depictions of landscapes and gardens. His works, such as Impression, Sunrise and Water Lilies, capture the fleeting effects of light and color.\n5. **Frida Kahlo** (1907-1954): A Mexican artist known for her vibrant and emotive self-portraits, Kahlo's work often explored themes of identity, culture, and the human experience. Her paintings, such as The Two Fridas and Self-Portrait with Thorn Necklace and Hummingbird, are celebrated for their bold colors and symbolism.\n\nEach of these individuals has made significant contributions to the art world, pushing boundaries and inspiring future generations of artists.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 2077, 1473, 334, 644, 27256, 2335, 9029, 304, 279, 5277, 8771, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 73004, 21106, 3067, 97866, 334, 320, 9591, 17, 12, 9690, 24, 1680, 362, 837, 55383, 893, 11, 66486, 3067, 97866, 574, 264, 30581, 11, 27863, 269, 11, 11726, 11, 24490, 11, 323, 28568, 889, 374, 13882, 6646, 832, 315, 279, 12474, 97953, 315, 682, 892, 13, 5414, 27373, 4375, 2997, 279, 99883, 29656, 323, 578, 8155, 6433, 716, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 73092, 1189, 5355, 480, 65036, 334, 320, 9741, 18, 12, 9378, 15, 1680, 362, 1772, 22197, 1331, 11433, 380, 30581, 11, 13000, 480, 65036, 374, 3967, 369, 813, 14265, 323, 78223, 1005, 315, 1933, 323, 813, 14604, 11, 3629, 83321, 11, 4375, 13, 5414, 36692, 11, 1778, 439, 7834, 894, 13120, 323, 8219, 89770, 11, 527, 4315, 279, 1455, 27373, 304, 279, 3925, 315, 1989, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 47, 32560, 67283, 334, 320, 9367, 16, 12, 4468, 18, 1680, 362, 15506, 10255, 889, 374, 13882, 27458, 439, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 32549, 13820, 315, 279, 220, 508, 339, 9478, 11, 67283, 374, 3967, 369, 813, 71674, 990, 304, 18521, 2191, 11, 264, 1742, 430, 66159, 53584, 21483, 323, 87195, 7739, 13, 5414, 4375, 2997, 4673, 944, 3074, 323, 11876, 29623, 285, 37907, 294, 6, 10066, 62799, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 65217, 799, 3206, 2