ures at multiple scales.\n\nSome popular CNN architectures for image classification tasks include:\n\n1. VGGNet\n2. ResNet\n3. InceptionNet\n4. MobileNet\n\nThese architectures have been shown to achieve state-of-the-art performance on various image classification benchmarks, such as ImageNet.\n\nAdditionally, other techniques like Transfer Learning, Data Augmentation, and Regularization techniques can be used to improve the performance of the model.\n\nPlease let me know if you have any further questions or if there's anything else I can help you with!", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 7754, 323, 1988, 11, 358, 1053, 7079, 430, 264, 14791, 5780, 6975, 15105, 369, 420, 3465, 1053, 387, 3146, 35992, 3294, 278, 61577, 39810, 320, 56555, 82, 33395, 382, 8586, 596, 3249, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1945, 24790, 96618, 578, 3465, 18065, 538, 7922, 5448, 11, 902, 374, 264, 11670, 3575, 304, 6500, 11376, 13, 20352, 82, 527, 8104, 1664, 87229, 1639, 369, 2217, 24790, 9256, 4245, 311, 872, 5845, 311, 4048, 70994, 4519, 505, 7257, 2217, 828, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 35353, 10550, 96618, 578, 9546, 315, 264, 3544, 10550, 315, 5448, 13533, 430, 264, 5655, 6975, 5603, 1053, 387, 7524, 11, 439, 20352, 82, 649, 4048, 6485, 12912, 323, 12135, 505, 3544, 30525, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 91718, 12694, 1132, 552, 96618, 20352, 82, 527, 6319, 311, 1920, 828, 449, 29079, 12694, 1132, 552, 11, 1778, 439, 5448, 11, 555, 19486, 56812, 278, 323, 75510, 13931, 311, 8819, 4519, 520, 5361, 29505, 382, 8538, 5526, 20352, 78335, 369, 2217, 24790, 9256, 2997, 1473, 16, 13, 650, 23050, 7099, 198, 17, 13, 1838, 7099, 198, 18, 13, 763, 1010, 7099, 198, 19, 13, 13716, 7099, 271, 9673, 78335, 617, 1027, 6982, 311, 11322, 1614, 8838, 10826, 38921, 5178, 389, 5370, 2217, 24790, 63119, 11, 1778, 439, 4758, 7099, 382, 50674, 11, 1023, 12823, 1093, 24078, 21579, 11, 2956, 5033, 32199, 11, 323, 29900, 2065, 12823, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 7417, 279, 5178, 315, 279, 1646, 382, 5618, 1095, 757, 1440, 422, 499, 617, 904, 4726, 4860, 477, 