on\n\t+ Examples: decreased face-to-face interaction, increased screen time\n\t+ Discussion of how technology can contribute to feelings of loneliness and disconnection\n* B. Job Displacement\n\t+ Examples: automation, outsourcing, job market changes\n\t+ Discussion of how technology has led to job losses and changes in the workforce\n* C. Dependence and Addiction\n\t+ Examples: social media, video games, online shopping\n\t+ Discussion of how technology can be addictive and lead to negative consequences\n\nIV. Conclusion\n\n* Restate thesis statement\n* Summarize main points\n* Final thoughts on the impact of technology on society and potential future directions.\n\nThis is just one potential outline, and you may choose to organize your essay differently or include additional points. Remember to support your arguments with evidence and examples to make your essay more convincing and engaging.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 4754, 8712, 21782, 369, 459, 9071, 389, 330, 63507, 323, 1202, 29680, 389, 13581, 52518, 40, 13, 29438, 271, 9, 37618, 24131, 315, 279, 8712, 323, 1202, 26431, 198, 9, 75097, 5224, 25, 12053, 706, 1047, 264, 28254, 5536, 389, 8396, 11, 46890, 279, 1648, 584, 3974, 11, 990, 11, 323, 16681, 449, 1855, 1023, 382, 5660, 13, 45003, 14727, 11613, 315, 12053, 271, 9, 362, 13, 59223, 31966, 198, 197, 10, 26379, 25, 3674, 3772, 11, 2835, 49843, 11627, 11, 9888, 30622, 198, 197, 10, 36613, 315, 1268, 5557, 706, 1903, 433, 8831, 311, 4667, 449, 3885, 4028, 27650, 198, 9, 426, 13, 62697, 9742, 311, 8245, 198, 197, 10, 26379, 25, 7757, 11, 2930, 20797, 11, 16627, 5070, 198, 197, 10, 36613, 315, 1268, 5557, 706, 1903, 433, 8831, 311, 2680, 2038, 323, 4048, 502, 2574, 198, 9, 356, 13, 62549, 5761, 1968, 198, 197, 10, 26379, 25, 33762, 11, 21075, 11478, 11, 3241, 7526, 198, 197, 10, 36613, 315, 1268, 5557, 706, 7319, 15374, 323, 26206, 304, 5370, 19647, 271, 23440, 13, 51957, 14727, 11613, 315, 12053, 271, 9, 362, 13, 9983, 2209, 36062, 198, 197, 10, 26379, 25, 25