Output~2025-04-24 17:00:10.228838: [RequestOutput(request_id=754, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a rule for proper hand-washing technique. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 6037, 369, 6300, 1450, 2695, 19587, 15105, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a rule for proper hand-washing technique:\n\n**The 7-Step Hand-Washing Technique:**\n\n1. **Wet your hands**: Turn on the faucet and wet your hands under warm running water.\n2. **Apply soap**: Use a mild soap that is gentle on your skin and apply a sufficient amount to cover your hands.\n3. **Lather the soap**: Rub your hands together to create a rich lather, making sure to cover all surfaces, including the backs of your hands, wrists, between your fingers, and under your nails.\n4. **Scrub all surfaces**: Rub your hands together for at least 20 seconds, making sure to scrub all surfaces, including:\n\t* Palms\n\t* Backs of hands\n\t* Fingers\n\t* Wrists\n\t* Between fingers\n\t* Under nails\n5. **Pay special attention to high-touch areas**: Spend extra time scrubbing high-touch areas, such as:\n\t* Fingertips\n\t* Nail beds\n\t* Cuticles\n\t* Wrists\n6. **Rinse thoroughly**: Rinse your hands under running water to remove all soap residue.\n7. **Dry completely**: Dry your hands completely with a clean towel or air dryer to prevent bacterial growth.\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n\n* Wash your hands frequently, especially:\n\t+ Before preparing food\n\t+ After using the bathroom\n\t+ After blowing your nose, coughing, or sneezing\n\t+ After touching animals or their waste\n\t+ After being in contact with someone who is sick\n* Use a hand sanitizer if soap and water are not available\n* Avoid touching your face, especially your eyes, nose, and mouth, after washing your hands\n\nBy following this 7-step hand-washing technique, you can help prevent the spread of illness and keep your hands clean and healthy!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6037, 369, 6300, 1450, 2695, 19587, 15105, 1473, 334, 791, 220, 22, 12, 8468, 8704, 13299, 19587, 78719, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 54, 295, 701, 6206, 96618, 12268, 389, 279, 72553, 323, 14739, 701, 6206, 1234, 8369, 4401, 3090, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 29597, 27883, 96618, 5560, 264, 23900, 27883, 430, 374, 22443, 389, 701, 6930, 323, 3881, 264, 14343, 3392, 311, 3504, 701, 6206, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 43, 1894, 279, 27883, 96618, 13134, 701, 6206, 3871, 311, 1893, 264, 9257, 326, 1894, 11, 3339, 2771, 311, 3504, 682, 27529, 11, 2737, 279, 28678, 315, 701, 6206, 11, 86878, 11, 1990, 701, 19779, 11, 323, 1234, 701, 40943, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 3407, 60530, 682, 27529, 96618, 13134, 701, 6206, 3871, 369, 520, 3325, 220, 508, 6622, 11, 3339, 2771, 311, 46001, 682, 27529, 11, 2737, 512, 197, 9, 11165, 1026, 198, 197, 9, 6984, 82, 315, 6206, 198, 197, 9, 435, 14437, 198, 197, 9, 32730, 1705, 198, 197, 9, 28232, 19779, 198, 197, 9, 9636, 40943, 198, 20, 13, 3146, 21243, 3361, 6666, 311, 1579, 40026, 5789, 96618, 78137, 5066, 892, 46001, 7278, 1579, 40026, 5789, 11, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 9, 435, 287, 531, 3153, 198, 197, 9, 75528, 28036, 198, 197, 9, 20223, 4440, 198, 197, 9, 32730, 1705, 198, 21, 13, 3146, 49, 258, 325, 27461, 96618, 58468, 325, 701, 6206, 1234, 4401, 3090, 311, 4148, 682, 27883, 49232, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 86315, 6724, 96618, 31941, 701, 6206, 6724, 449, 264, 4335, 43713, 477, 3805, 47722, 311, 5471, 45964, 6650, 382, 334, 30119, 26788, 25, 57277, 9, 6113, 701, 6206, 14134, 11, 5423, 512, 197, 10, 13538, 20646