thawing.\n5. **Cooking**: Once thawed, cook the food immediately to an internal temperature of at least 165°F (74°C) to ensure food safety.\n\n**Important Safety Tips**:\n\n* Always wash your hands before and after handling frozen food.\n* Prevent cross-contamination by separating raw meat, poultry, and seafood from ready-to-eat foods.\n* Cook frozen food to the recommended internal temperature to prevent foodborne illness.\n* Never refreeze thawed food without cooking it first.\n\nBy following these steps and safety tips, you can safely thaw frozen food and enjoy a delicious and healthy meal.", token_ids=[1016, 675, 287, 20268, 3691, 374, 264, 16996, 3094, 304, 20646, 433, 369, 17677, 323, 15652, 13, 578, 1920, 315, 86478, 287, 20268, 3691, 18065, 27115, 24808, 433, 709, 311, 264, 6220, 9499, 311, 5471, 45964, 6650, 323, 3691, 32096, 17563, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 8641, 389, 1268, 311, 86478, 20268, 3691, 21676, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 21119, 8469, 96618, 24119, 3197, 8469, 323, 2187, 3403, 892, 311, 86478, 20268, 3691, 304, 279, 46044, 477, 304, 9439, 3090, 13, 15037, 86478, 3691, 520, 3130, 9499, 477, 304, 8369, 3090, 11, 439, 420, 649, 12192, 45964, 6650, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 697, 1658, 7420, 859, 666, 675, 287, 96618, 11004, 279, 20268, 3691, 304, 264, 24237, 60267, 9145, 477, 264, 9960, 5593, 389, 279, 6278, 477, 5740, 28745, 315, 279, 46044, 13, 27628, 220, 21, 12, 1187, 4207, 369, 86478, 287, 11, 11911, 389, 279, 1404, 323, 955, 315, 3691, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 77518, 10164, 666, 675, 287, 96618, 11004, 279, 20268, 3691, 304, 264, 24237, 60267, 9145, 323, 1207, 19590, 433, 304, 9439, 3090, 13, 10604, 279, 3090, 1475, 220, 966, 4520, 311, 2567, 433, 9439, 13, 1102, 1253, 1935, 220, 966, 4520, 311, 3892, 4207, 311, 86478, 11, 11911, 389, 279, 1404, 323, 955, 315, 3691, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 98402, 34803, 666, 675, 287, 96618, 3979, 42602, 20268, 3691, 304, 279, 42374, 4184, 311, 279, 14290, 596, 11470, 13, 18230, 279, 3691, 449, 264, 42374, 56219, 27431, 4