320\n* Protein: 22g\n* Fat: 18g\n* Saturated Fat: 3.5g\n* Cholesterol: 180mg\n* Carbohydrates: 20g\n* Fiber: 6g\n* Sugar: 2g\n* Sodium: 200mg\n\n**Why this recipe is healthy:**\n\n* Eggs are an excellent source of protein and omega-3 fatty acids.\n* Avocado provides healthy fats and fiber.\n* Spinach is rich in vitamins A and K, as well as iron and calcium.\n* Whole grain bread provides fiber and B vitamins.\n* Cherry tomatoes add a burst of vitamin C and lycopene.\n\nEnjoy your delicious and nutritious breakfast!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 11363, 369, 264, 9498, 17954, 430, 596, 2225, 18406, 323, 78216, 1473, 334, 10066, 47282, 323, 41785, 613, 507, 2727, 10010, 449, 41593, 75374, 9806, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 16, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 3544, 19335, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 68346, 11, 89964, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 7878, 68798, 11141, 198, 9, 220, 16, 62611, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 220, 17, 35354, 4459, 24875, 16385, 320, 21470, 439, 4459, 34153, 477, 4459, 24875, 436, 9188, 340, 9, 12536, 25, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 41980, 41613, 11, 15104, 2111, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 56045, 279, 19335, 1139, 264, 19763, 323, 41759, 1124, 3871, 449, 264, 23243, 13, 2758, 264, 50346, 315, 12290, 323, 25349, 311, 12945, 627, 17, 13, 27162, 279, 33213, 5707, 304, 264, 2536, 5594, 875, 79085, 927, 11298, 8798, 627, 18, 13, 27058, 279, 19151, 21655, 1139, 279, 79085, 323, 1095, 433, 4394, 369, 922, 220, 17, 12, 18, 4520, 11, 3156, 279, 13116, 1212, 311, 743, 627, 19, 13, 2758, 279, 89964, 68346, 323, 7878, 68798, 11141, 311, 832, 4376, 315, 279, 297, 2727, 10010, 13, 5560, 264, 63983, 5724, 311, 30373, 11816, 279, 1023, 4376, 315, 279, 297, 2727, 10010, 927, 279, 21973, 627, 20, 13, 12797, 369, 459, 5217, 220, 16, 12, 17, 4520, 11, 3156, 279, 19335, 527, 4661, 743, 323, 279, 68346, 374, 32813, 1555, 627, 21, 13, 26982, 11, 23211, 279, 4459, 24875, 16385, 3156, 34504, 14198, 291, 627, 22, 13, 44464, 279, 29