ch is a common scenario for playing board games.\n\n**Additional ideas:**\n\n1. **Influencer partnerships:** Partner with popular board game influencers or content creators to showcase the game and reach a wider audience.\n2. **Giveaways and contests:** Host giveaways or contests where followers can win a copy of the game or a gaming-themed prize pack.\n3. **User-generated content:** Encourage followers to share their own experiences playing the game by using a branded hashtag, and re-share or feature their content on the official Twitter account.\n4. **Live streaming:** Host live streams or Q&A sessions with game developers or experts to provide exclusive insights and build a community around the game.\n\nBy using these strategies, you can effectively promote your board game on Twitter and generate buzz around its release.', token_ids=[1271, 12192, 264, 4580, 1847, 389, 6405, 11, 358, 1053, 1005, 264, 10824, 315, 23387, 54077, 11, 86605, 4221, 11, 323, 19092, 82961, 311, 5662, 264, 7029, 10877, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 6205, 6405, 1772, 1473, 334, 4226, 68063, 330, 1991, 5644, 369, 264, 3814, 304, 449, 4885, 0, 1357, 60637, 1057, 502, 4580, 1847, 11, 510, 4973, 4076, 1145, 1405, 8446, 20628, 2523, 0, 15028, 279, 22901, 11, 6667, 5070, 11, 323, 704, 1543, 20732, 424, 701, 19949, 311, 3243, 0, 674, 12198, 4973, 51537, 674, 38, 6605, 34868, 674, 3648, 16464, 1875, 334, 10445, 433, 4375, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 51158, 84424, 54077, 68063, 578, 1772, 5764, 264, 43395, 33352, 2217, 477, 2835, 315, 279, 4580, 1847, 11, 902, 49155, 279, 6666, 315, 4754, 6444, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 58860, 88, 4221, 68063, 578, 1005, 315, 1957, 4339, 1093, 330, 1991, 5644, 1, 323, 330, 412, 1543, 20732, 424, 1, 11705, 28361, 323, 4907, 2212, 279, 1847, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 697, 8532, 82961, 68063, 578, 82961, 674, 12198, 4973, 51537, 11, 674, 38, 6605, 34868, 11, 323, 674, 3648, 16464, 1520, 279, 1772, 5662, 264, 17550, 10877, 8173, 304, 4580, 3953, 323, 16211, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 7368, 4791, 26115, 6