Output~2025-04-24 17:03:16.655188: [RequestOutput(request_id=831, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest a way to make physical activity a part of your daily routine. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 264, 1648, 311, 1304, 7106, 5820, 264, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here\'s a response that suggests a way to make physical activity a part of your daily routine:\n\n"To incorporate physical activity into your daily routine, I suggest starting with small, achievable goals. Begin by setting aside 10-15 minutes each day for physical activity, such as taking a short walk around your neighborhood, doing a few jumping jacks during commercial breaks while watching TV, or doing a quick yoga routine in the morning. You can also try incorporating physical activity into your daily commute, such as taking the stairs instead of the elevator or walking or biking to work.\n\nAnother way to make physical activity a habit is to schedule it into your daily planner or calendar. Treat physical activity as a non-negotiable part of your daily routine, just like brushing your teeth or taking a shower. This will help you prioritize it and make it a consistent part of your daily routine.\n\nAdditionally, find an activity that you enjoy, whether it\'s walking, running, swimming, or dancing, and make it a part of your daily routine. This will make it more likely that you\'ll stick to it and look forward to it. You can also find a workout buddy or join a fitness class to provide accountability and motivation.\n\nRemember, the key is to start small and be consistent. As you get into the habit of regular physical activity, you can gradually increase the duration and intensity of your workouts. With time, you\'ll find that physical activity becomes an enjoyable and essential part of your daily routine."', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 2077, 430, 13533, 264, 1648, 311, 1304, 7106, 5820, 264, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 1473, 66220, 33435, 7106, 5820, 1139, 701, 7446, 14348, 11, 358, 4284, 6041, 449, 2678, 11, 89253, 9021, 13, 19110, 555, 6376, 16038, 220, 605, 12, 868, 4520, 1855, 1938, 369, 7106, 5820, 11, 1778, 439, 4737, 264, 2875, 4321, 2212, 701, 12818, 11, 3815, 264, 2478, 30102, 503, 7977, 2391, 8518, 18808, 1418, 10307, 6007, 11, 477, 3815, 264, 4062, 27102, 14348, 304, 279, 6693, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 1456, 52913, 7106, 5820, 1139, 701, 7446, 59263, 11, 1778, 439, 4737, 279, 32249, 4619, 315, 279, 39736, 477, 11689, 477, 67180, 311, 990, 382, 14364, 1648, 311, 1304, 7106, 5820, 264, 14464, 374, 311, 9899, 433, 1139, 701, 7446, 50811, 477, 13470, 13, 19409, 7106, 5820, 439, 264, 2536, 5392, 67078, 2205, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 11, 1120, 1093, 77826, 701, 18311, 477, 4737, 264, 17639, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 63652, 433, 323, 1304, 433, 264, 13263, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 382, 50674, 11, 1505, 459, 5820, 430, 499, 4774, 11, 3508, 433, 596, 11689, 11, 4401, 11, 24269, 11, 477, 29066, 11, 323, 1304, 433, 264, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 13, 1115, 690, 1304, 433, 810, 4461, 430, 499, 3358, 9396, 311, 433, 323, 1427, 4741, 311, 433, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 1505, 264, 26308, 37772, 477, 5249, 264, 17479, 538, 311, 3493, 39242, 323, 25835, 382, 29690, 11, 279, 1401, 374, 311, 1212, 2678, 323, 387, 13263, 13, 1666, 499, 636, 1139, 279, 14464, 315, 5912, 7106, 5820, 11, 499, 649, 27115, 5376, 279, 8250, 323, 21261, 315, 701, 46944, 13, 3161, 892, 11, 499, 3358, 1505, 430, 7106, 5820, 9221,