Output~2025-04-24 17:04:49.512765: [RequestOutput(request_id=857, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest some activities for a family game night. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 1063, 7640, 369, 264, 3070, 1847, 3814, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Family game night! A wonderful way to spend quality time together and create lasting memories. Here are some activity suggestions to make your family game night a fun and memorable one:\n\n**Classic Board Games**\n\n1. Monopoly: A timeless favorite that's perfect for families with older kids and adults.\n2. Scrabble: Challenge your vocabulary skills and have a blast competing against each other.\n3. Clue: A detective-themed game that's great for kids and adults alike.\n\n**Indoor Games**\n\n1. Charades: Divide into teams and act out movie titles, song lyrics, or book characters.\n2. Pictionary: Draw and guess words or phrases, a great way to encourage creativity and laughter.\n3. Would You Rather: Present two difficult choices and have each family member decide which one they prefer.\n\n**Video Games**\n\n1. Mario Kart: A fun racing game that's perfect for kids and adults who love gaming.\n2. Overcooked: A cooking simulation game that's great for families with kids aged 8 and up.\n3. Jackbox Party Pack: A collection of party games that can be played by multiple players.\n\n**Creative Activities**\n\n1. DIY Crafts: Set up a craft station with materials like paper, glue, scissors, and paint, and let everyone's creativity shine.\n2. Cooking or Baking: Choose a recipe and cook/bake together as a family.\n3. Karaoke: Sing your favorite songs and have a blast belting out tunes together.\n\n**Other Ideas**\n\n1. Movie Night: Pick a family-friendly movie and have a cozy movie night with snacks and drinks.\n2. Storytelling: Take turns telling stories, either made-up or true, and enjoy each other's company.\n3. Trivia Night: Create a quiz with questions on a topic of your choice, such as history, sports, or pop culture.\n\nRemember, the most important thing is to choose activities that everyone will enjoy and have fun together!", token_ids=[15547, 1847, 3814, 0, 362, 11364, 1648, 311, 8493, 4367, 892, 3871, 323, 1893, 29869, 19459, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 5820, 18726, 311, 1304, 701, 3070, 1847, 3814, 264, 2523, 323, 33596, 832, 1473, 334, 64431, 8925, 11871, 57277, 16, 13, 3206, 40863, 25, 362, 58105, 7075, 430, 596, 4832, 369, 8689, 449, 9191, 6980, 323, 12884, 627, 17, 13, 33234, 73291, 25, 26323, 701, 36018, 7512, 323, 617, 264, 21327, 27260, 2403, 1855, 1023, 627, 18, 13, 2493, 361, 25, 362, 45259, 57689, 1847, 430, 596, 2294, 369, 6980, 323, 12884, 27083, 382, 334, 1451, 10922, 11871, 57277, 16, 13, 4969, 3536, 25, 64002, 1139, 7411, 323, 1180, 704, 5818, 15671, 11, 5609, 24142, 11, 477, 2363, 5885, 627, 17, 13, 393, 4003, 25, 12261, 323, 8101, 4339, 477, 32847, 11, 264, 2294, 1648, 311, 15253, 28697, 323, 43214, 627, 18, 13, 19418, 1472, 26848, 25, 27740, 1403, 5107, 11709, 323, 617, 1855, 3070, 4562, 10491, 902, 832, 814, 10932, 382, 334, 10955, 11871, 57277, 16, 13, 24270, 61197, 25, 362, 2523, 22019, 1847, 430, 596, 4832, 369, 6980, 323, 12884, 889, 3021, 16211, 627, 17, 13, 6193, 99797, 25, 362, 17677, 19576, 1847, 430, 596, 2294, 369, 8689, 449, 6980, 20330, 220, 23, 323, 709, 627, 18, 13, 7762, 2054, 8722, 14114, 25, 362, 4526, 315, 4717, 3953, 430, 649, 387, 6476, 555, 5361, 4311, 382, 334, 64046, 44382, 57277, 16, 13, 32558, 66041, 25, 26