 required when you\'re out and about. We get it, it\'s a new habit to get into, but we\'re all in this together! Let\'s do our part to keep each other safe and healthy."\n\nIn the formal tone, the language is more polite and professional, using phrases like "kindly remind you" and "valued community member" to convey a sense of respect and courtesy. In the casual tone, the language is more relaxed and conversational, using phrases like "Hey friends" and "we\'re all in this together" to create a sense of camaraderie and shared responsibility.', token_ids=[334, 51, 606, 18825, 25, 1035, 791, 16630, 315, 279, 4113, 1495, 374, 42887, 11, 14738, 19738, 11, 323, 10284, 26589, 5382, 13, 578, 1005, 315, 330, 19182, 499, 9135, 323, 330, 8161, 956, 499, 1440, 1, 11705, 264, 5647, 315, 2167, 2136, 323, 54917, 11, 719, 1101, 4131, 4028, 439, 14738, 17302, 1697, 382, 334, 76863, 42419, 311, 1221, 5735, 279, 26823, 4961, 25, 57277, 334, 1876, 278, 68004, 25, 1035, 1, 31765, 33647, 4029, 4562, 11, 584, 47626, 24928, 499, 430, 433, 374, 23911, 311, 10051, 264, 7056, 994, 10594, 1711, 34632, 13, 1226, 3619, 430, 420, 1253, 387, 264, 502, 16686, 11, 719, 584, 15763, 701, 23915, 304, 10695, 311, 10519, 264, 6220, 323, 9498, 4676, 369, 5127, 2266, 334, 50342, 940, 68004, 25, 1035, 1, 19182, 4885, 0, 4702, 264, 11919, 27626, 430, 27227, 527, 2631, 994, 499, 2351, 704, 323, 922, 13, 1226, 636, 433, 11, 433, 596, 264, 502, 14464, 311, 636, 1139, 11, 719, 584, 2351, 682, 304, 420, 3871, 0, 6914, 596, 656, 1057, 961, 311, 2567, 1855, 1023, 6220, 323, 9498, 2266, 644, 279, 16287, 16630, 11, 279, 4221, 374, 810, 48887, 323, 6721, 11, 1701, 32847, 1093, 330, 15674, 398, 24928, 499, 1, 323, 330, 838, 3340, 4029, 4562, 1, 311, 20599, 264, 5647, 315, 5201, 323, 27104, 13, 763, 279, 16736, 16630, 11, 279, 4221, 374, 810, 31467, 323, 7669, 1697, 11, 1701, 32847, 1093, 330, 19182, 4885, 1, 323, 330, 906, 2351, 682, 304, 420, 3871, 1, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 97686, 1013, 648, 323, 6222, 12014, 13, 