Output~2025-04-24 17:05:58.402566: [RequestOutput(request_id=893, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Given that \\n (x+y+z)(xy+xz+yz)=25\\nand that \\n x^2(y+z)+y^2(x+z)+z^2(x+y)=7\\nfor real numbers x, y, and z, what is the value of xyz? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 16644, 430, 1144, 77, 320, 87, 44110, 94052, 2432, 4223, 38992, 89, 10, 18854, 11992, 914, 1734, 438, 430, 1144, 77, 865, 61, 17, 7166, 94052, 7405, 88, 61, 17, 2120, 94052, 7405, 89, 61, 17, 2120, 44110, 11992, 22, 1734, 2000, 1972, 5219, 865, 11, 379, 11, 323, 1167, 11, 1148, 374, 279, 907, 315, 41611, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Let's start by expanding the first equation:\n\n(x+y+z)(xy+xz+yz) = 25\n\nExpanding the left-hand side, we get:\n\nx^2y + x^2z + xy^2 + xyz + xz^2 + y^2z + yz^2 + z^2y = 25\n\nNow, we can combine like terms:\n\nx^2y + x^2z + y^2z + z^2y + xy^2 + xz^2 + yz^2 + xyz = 25\n\nNow, we can use the second equation:\n\nx^2(y+z) + y^2(x+z) + z^2(x+y) = 7\n\nRearranging this equation, we get:\n\nx^2y + x^2z + y^2z + z^2y = 7\n\nComparing this with the expanded first equation, we can see that:\n\nx^2y + x^2z + y^2z + z^2y = 7\n\nand\n\nx^2y + x^2z + y^2z + z^2y + xyz = 25\n\nSubtracting the first equation from the second, we get:\n\nxyz = 18\n\nTherefore, the value of xyz is 18.", token_ids=[10267, 596, 1212, 555, 24050, 279, 1176, 24524, 1473, 2120, 44110, 94052, 2432, 4223, 38992, 89, 10, 18854, 8, 284, 220, 914, 271, 8193, 26673, 279, 2163, 25417, 318