 an hour before bedtime, as they can interfere with your ability to fall asleep.\n* Avoid heavy meals or heavy exercise within a few hours of bedtime, as they can disrupt your sleep.\n\n**Step 5: Limit Exposure to Blue Light**\n\n* Blue light, which is emitted by electronic devices, can suppress the production of melatonin, the hormone that regulates sleep. To minimize exposure:\n\t+ Use blue light filtering glasses, apps, or software\n\t+ Dim the brightness of your devices or use night mode\n\t+ Avoid using electronic devices at least an hour before bedtime\n\n**Step 6: Get Ready for Bed**\n\n* Brush your teeth, change into comfortable pajamas, and prepare your body for sleep.\n* Avoid stimulating activities, such as watching TV or engaging in intense conversations, within 30 minutes of bedtime.\n\n**Step 7: Practice Relaxation Techniques**\n\n* Try relaxation techniques, such as deep breathing, progressive muscle relaxation, or meditation, to help calm your mind and body before sleep.\n* Consider keeping a journal or writing down your thoughts and concerns to clear your mind before bed.\n\n**Step 8: Get Out of Bed**\n\n* If you", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3197, 311, 1520, 499, 636, 1695, 6212, 1855, 3814, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 40498, 264, 7440, 18620, 24708, 24416, 57277, 9, 2638, 264, 5912, 6212, 9899, 323, 9396, 311, 433, 11, 1524, 389, 38102, 13, 6122, 311, 4950, 323, 15508, 709, 520, 279, 1890, 892, 1475, 1938, 627, 9, 71715, 369, 220, 22, 12, 24, 4207, 315, 6212, 1855, 3814, 311, 1520, 701, 2547, 636, 279, 2800, 433, 3966, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 4324, 264, 13394, 1712, 72162, 57277, 9, 8000, 264, 78729, 864, 1355, 3583, 14348, 311, 8450, 311, 701, 2547, 430, 433, 596, 892, 311, 10160, 1523, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 7640, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 18242, 264, 2363, 477, 14756, 198, 197, 10, 36925, 264, 8369, 9061, 477, 17639, 198, 197, 10, 18373, 10332, 22443, 50699, 477, 27102, 198, 197, 10, 77797, 311, 65464, 4731, 477, 7138, 10578, 198, 197, 10, 2