Output~2025-04-24 17:07:03.307824: [RequestOutput(request_id=926, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Given a table of daily stock prices with columns StockID, Date, and Price, write a SQL query to find the maximum price for each stock in the past 7 days. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 16644, 264, 2007, 315, 7446, 5708, 7729, 449, 8310, 12937, 926, 11, 2696, 11, 323, 8650, 11, 3350, 264, 8029, 3319, 311, 1505, 279, 7340, 3430, 369, 1855, 5708, 304, 279, 3347, 220, 22, 2919, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is the SQL query that solves the problem:\n```\nSELECT StockID, MAX(Price) AS MaxPrice\nFROM (\n  SELECT StockID, Price\n  FROM table_name\n  WHERE Date >= DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE, INTERVAL 7 DAY)\n) AS recent_prices\nGROUP BY StockID;\n```\nHere's an explanation of the query:\n\n1. The subquery selects all rows from the table where the `Date` column is within the past 7 days using the `DATE_SUB` function.\n2. The outer query groups the results by `StockID` and uses the `MAX` aggregation function to find the maximum `Price` for each group.\n3. The `AS` keyword is used to give an alias to the subquery result, which is `recent_prices`.\n4. The `GROUP BY` clause groups the results by `StockID`, and the `MAX` function returns the maximum `Price` for each group.\n\nNote: Replace `table_name` with the actual name of your table.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 8029, 3319, 430, 68577, 279, 3575, 512, 14196, 4077, 4963, 12937, 926, 11, 8498, 7, 7117, 8, 5871, 7639, 7117, 198, 31193, 2456, 220, 19638, 12937, 926, 11, 8650, 198, 220, 4393, 2007, 1292, 198, 220, 5401, 2696, 2669, 29643, 17730, 3100, 17955, 19007, 11, 92243, 220, 22, 38788, 340, 8, 5871, 3293, 66788, 198, 42580, 7866, 12937, 926, 280, 14196, 4077, 8586, 596, 459, 16540, 315, 279, 3319, 1473, 16, 13, 578, 1207, 1663, 50243, 682, 7123, 505, 279, 2007, 1405, 279, 1595, 1956, 63, 3330, 374, 2949, 279, 3347, 220, 22, 2919, 1701, 279, 1595, 7242, 17730, 63, 734, 627, 17, 13, 578, 16335, 3319, 5315, 279, 3135, 555, 1595, 19931, 926, 63, 323, 5829, 279, 1595, 10809, 63, 52729, 734, 311, 1505, 279, 7340, 1595, 7117, 63, 369, 1855, 1912, 627, 18, 13, 578, 1595, 1950, 63, 16570, 374, 1511, 311, 3041, 459, 15904, 311, 279, 1207, 1663, 1121, 11, 902, 374, 1595, 47743, 66788, 19154, 19, 13, 578, 1595, 42580, 7866, 63, 22381, 5315, 279, 3135, 555, 1595, 19931, 926, 7964, 323, 279, 1595, 10809, 63, 734, 4780, 279, 7340, 1595, 7117, 63, 369, 1855, 1912, 382, 9290, 25, 30658, 1595, 2048, 1292, 63, 449, 279, 5150, 836, 315, 701, 2007, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
