Output~2025-04-24 17:07:41.363256: [RequestOutput(request_id=943, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a product description for a new mobile. ### Input: iPhone 11 Pro ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 2027, 4096, 369, 264, 502, 6505, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 12443, 220, 806, 1322, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="**Introducing the iPhone 11 Pro: A Revolutionary Mobile Experience**\n\nThe iPhone 11 Pro is the latest addition to Apple's flagship series, pushing the boundaries of what a smartphone can do. With its sleek and durable design, this device is not only a stunning work of art but also a powerful tool that will revolutionize the way you live, work, and play.\n\n**Display**\n\nThe iPhone 11 Pro features a stunning 5.8-inch Super Retina XDR display, boasting a resolution of 1125 x 2436 pixels. With a 120Hz refresh rate, the screen comes alive with vibrant colors, crisp text, and seamless motion. Whether you're watching your favorite movies, playing games, or browsing the web, the iPhone 11 Pro's display is sure to impress.\n\n**Performance**\n\nPowered by Apple's A13 Bionic chip, the iPhone 11 Pro delivers lightning-fast performance and efficient battery life. With up to 1TB of storage, you can store all your favorite apps, photos, and videos without worrying about running out of space. Plus, with advanced Face ID security, your personal data is protected with ease.\n\n**Camera**\n\nThe iPhone 11 Pro boasts a triple-camera setup, featuring a wide-angle lens, telephoto lens, and ultra-wide lens. With advanced features like Night mode, Portrait mode, and 4K video recording, you'll never miss a moment. The camera app is also optimized for augmented reality experiences, allowing you to bring your favorite games and apps to life like never before.\n\n**Battery Life**\n\nThe iPhone 11 Pro boasts an impressive battery life, with up to 12 hours of internet use on a single charge. With fast charging capabilities, you can quickly top up your battery when you're on-the-go.\n\n**Additional Features**\n\n* Water-resistant with IP68 rating\n* Wireless charging capabilities\n* Dual-SIM support\n* iOS 13 operating system\n* Wireless EarPods with Lightning connector\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nThe iPhone 11 Pro is a game-changer in the world of smartphones. With its stunning display, powerful performance, advanced camera capabilities, and impressive battery life, this device is sure to exceed your expectations. Whether you're a tech enthusiast, a gamer, or simply someone who wants the best, the iPhone 11 Pro is the perfect choice. Upgrade your mobile experience today and discover a world of possibilities.", token_ids=[334, 1090, 60637, 279, 12443, 220, 806, 1322, 25, 362, 67679, 13716, 21460, 57277, 791, 12443, 220, 806, 1322, 374, 279, 5652, 5369, 311, 8325, 596, 43772, 4101, 11, 17919, 279, 23546, 315, 1148, 264, 22234, 649, 656, 13, 3161, 1202, 48494, 323, 27220, 2955, 11, 420, 3756, 374, 539, 1193, 264, 20441, 990, 315, 1989, 719, 1101, 264, 8147, 5507, 430, 690, 14110, 553, 279, 1648, 499, 3974, 11, 990, 11, 323, 1514, 382, 334, 7165, 57277, 791, 12443, 220, 806, 1322, 4519, 264, 20441, 220, 20, 13, 23, 25224, 7445, 10608, 2259, 1630, 7842, 3113, 11, 84744, 264, 11175, 315, 220, 7261, 20, 865, 220, 14052, 21, 16128, 13, 3161, 264, 220, 4364, 11732, 10625, 4478, 11, 279, 4264, 4131, 13989, 449, 34076, 8146, 11,