bal warming exceeds 1.5°C above pre-industrial levels, the consequences will be catastrophic. By transitioning to sustainable energy, we can limit global warming to 1.5°C and avoid the most devastating impacts of climate change. In conclusion, sustainable energy is crucial for a cleaner, healthier, and more sustainable future. It is essential that we prioritize the development and implementation of sustainable energy sources to ensure a livable planet for generations to come.", token_ids=[791, 12939, 315, 22556, 4907, 4250, 387, 83509, 660, 304, 3432, 596, 1917, 13, 1666, 279, 3728, 7187, 9731, 311, 3139, 11, 279, 7631, 369, 4907, 374, 7859, 11, 323, 8776, 31376, 40373, 527, 10671, 15098, 59290, 13, 23674, 11, 279, 20252, 315, 31376, 40373, 374, 264, 5199, 26373, 311, 10182, 2349, 11, 3805, 25793, 11, 323, 12434, 53568, 13, 61593, 4907, 11, 389, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 6209, 264, 32981, 11, 810, 15062, 11, 323, 33268, 10778, 382, 50, 42341, 4907, 8336, 11, 1778, 439, 13238, 11, 10160, 11, 323, 17055, 2410, 11, 527, 44611, 323, 649, 387, 305, 1923, 22456, 2085, 409, 698, 1303, 5933, 5070, 13, 4314, 8336, 1101, 8356, 2697, 311, 912, 37647, 6962, 20748, 11, 18189, 279, 5536, 389, 279, 4676, 13, 23212, 11, 22556, 4907, 649, 1893, 7032, 11, 51077, 2254, 37671, 11, 323, 7417, 4907, 4868, 13, 763, 2144, 11, 279, 7327, 93438, 12634, 16784, 17989, 430, 279, 33268, 4907, 10706, 1436, 1862, 709, 311, 220, 2790, 3610, 7032, 31550, 555, 220, 10866, 15, 382, 57417, 11, 22556, 4907, 649, 1520, 50460, 279, 6372, 315, 10182, 2349, 555, 18189, 12782, 20748, 323, 48408, 3728, 24808, 13, 578, 1357, 2431, 26112, 278, 19482, 389, 31636, 10604, 49140, 430, 422, 3728, 24808, 36375, 220, 16, 13, 20, 32037, 3485, 864, 18251, 47479, 5990, 11, 279, 16296, 690, 387, 54677, 13, 3296, 73194, 311, 22556, 4907, 11, 584, 649, 4017, 3728, 24808, 311, 220, 16, 13, 20, 32037, 323, 5766, 279, 1455, 33318, 25949, 315, 10182, 2349, 13, 763, 17102, 11, 22556, 4907, 374, 16996, 369, 264, 32981, 11, 39345, 11, 