ife, liberty, and the pursuit of happiness - are unalienable, meaning they cannot be taken away by any government or individual.\n6. **Consent of the Governed**: The document asserts that government derives its power from the consent of the governed, meaning that government exists to serve the people, not the other way around.\n7. **Protection of Individual Rights**: The Declaration of Independence promises that the government will protect the individual rights of its citizens, including the right to life, liberty, and the pursuit of happiness.\n\nThese values have had a profound impact on American history and continue to shape American society and politics to this day.", token_ids=[791, 3723, 4273, 42021, 315, 44177, 11, 18306, 389, 5887, 220, 19, 11, 220, 11242, 21, 11, 374, 264, 89328, 2246, 315, 3778, 3925, 430, 50729, 279, 16565, 323, 2819, 430, 279, 61759, 3778, 49028, 14610, 439, 279, 8197, 369, 872, 24589, 505, 8681, 13527, 13, 578, 2246, 21300, 3892, 2819, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 26833, 96618, 578, 1314, 311, 2324, 374, 6646, 459, 653, 56418, 481, 1314, 11, 7438, 433, 4250, 387, 4529, 3201, 555, 904, 3109, 477, 3927, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 9374, 1368, 96618, 578, 2246, 57876, 279, 1314, 311, 31220, 11, 902, 5764, 279, 11542, 311, 1304, 11709, 323, 3974, 832, 596, 2324, 439, 832, 16008, 5052, 11, 439, 1317, 439, 433, 1587, 539, 25654, 18177, 389, 279, 3268, 315, 3885, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 47, 1759, 3159, 315, 79244, 96618, 578, 42021, 315, 44177, 5415, 430, 7931, 617, 279, 1314, 311, 23564, 872, 1866, 23871, 11, 902, 374, 3629, 33398, 439, 279, 1314, 311, 23564, 832, 596, 1866, 9021, 11, 19226, 11, 323, 58522, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 51845, 96618, 578, 2246, 57876, 430, 682, 3026, 527, 3549, 6273, 11, 7438, 430, 682, 7931, 617, 279, 1890, 38088, 907, 323, 5922, 11, 15851, 315, 872, 3674, 2704, 11, 12205, 11, 477, 2361, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 1844, 56418, 481, 10734, 96618, 578, 42021, 315, 44177, 5415, 430, 1521, 2380, 2819, 482, 2324, 11, 31220, 11, 323, 279, 33436,