Output~2025-04-24 17:15:29.959783: [RequestOutput(request_id=1150, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Play the role of a wedding planner and provide suggestions on how to make a small, intimate wedding special. ### Input: Estimated budget: $10,000; Wedding location: a beach; Number of guests: 30 ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7199, 279, 3560, 315, 264, 13306, 50811, 323, 3493, 18726, 389, 1268, 311, 1304, 264, 2678, 11, 32487, 13306, 3361, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 83086, 8199, 25, 400, 605, 11, 931, 26, 31917, 3813, 25, 264, 11573, 26, 5742, 315, 15051, 25, 220, 966, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='What a lovely and intimate setting for a wedding! With a budget of $10,000 and a guest list of 30, we can create a truly special and memorable experience for the happy couple. Here are some suggestions to make this small, beachside wedding truly unforgettable:\n\n**Venue:** Since the wedding is taking place on a beach, we can take advantage of the natural beauty of the surroundings. Consider renting a private beachside villa or a secluded cove for the ceremony and reception. This will provide an exclusive and romantic atmosphere for the couple and their closest friends and family.\n\n**Ceremony:** To make the ceremony even more special, we can incorporate some unique elements that take advantage of the beach setting. For example, we can have a sand ceremony, where the couple walks barefoot along the beach, pouring sand from two separate containers into one, symbolizing their union. We can also incorporate seashells, starfish, or other beach finds into the ceremony decor to add a personal touch.\n\n**Food and Beverage:** For a beachside wedding, we can serve a variety of refreshing and light bites, such as seafood, salads, and finger foods. We can also offer signature cocktails, like a "Love Potion" or a "Beach Bum" to keep the party going. To make it even more special, we can have a beachside bonfire and serve s\'mores and other campfire treats.\n\n**Decor:** To complement the beach setting, we can use natural elements like driftwood, seashells, and starfish to create a whimsical and romantic atmosphere. We can also hang lanterns or string lights to add a touch of magic to the evening. For the reception, we can set up a beautiful beachside arch or a gazebo to create a focal point for the ceremony and reception.\n\n**Music:** To set the mood, we can hire a live musician, such as a guitarist or a violinist, to play soft, beachy tunes during the ceremony and cocktail hour. We can also create a playlist of the couple\'s favorite songs to play during the reception.\n\n**Photography:** To capture the beauty of the beach and the special moments of the wedding, we can hire a photographer who specializes in beach weddings. We can also set up a photo booth with props like beach balls, sunglasses, and inflatables to capture fun and playful moments.\n\n**Favors:** To thank our guests for joining us, we can give them a small token of appreciation, such as a bag of homemade treats, a beach', token_ids=[3923, 264, 17104, 323, 32487, 6376, 369, 264, 13306, 0, 3161, 264, 8199, 315, 400, 605, 11, 931, 323, 264, 8810, 1160, 315, 220, 966, 11, 584, 649, 1893, 264, 9615, 3361, 323, 33596, 3217, 369, 279, 6380, 5743, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 18726, 311, 1304, 420, 2678, 11, 11573, 3002, 13306, 9615, 61098, 1473, 334, 91236, 68063, 8876, 2