lent\n* Sunscreen and insect repellent\n\n**Miscellaneous:**\n\n* Map and compass or GPS device\n* Flashlight or headlamp\n* Extra batteries\n* Trash bags\n* Camp chair or camping stool\n* Entertainment (e.g. books, games, cards)\n* Cell phone and portable charger (if needed)\n\nRemember to check the weather forecast and adjust your packing list accordingly. It's also a good idea to check with the campsite for any specific rules or regulations. Have a safe and enjoyable trip!", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 3673, 311, 3854, 369, 264, 3814, 33873, 8577, 1473, 334, 52336, 1626, 25, 57277, 9, 473, 19787, 26302, 15030, 7217, 198, 9, 328, 26246, 198, 9, 67553, 14, 8846, 82, 198, 9, 1443, 20242, 5640, 49760, 198, 9, 55870, 477, 23724, 198, 9, 22050, 323, 36516, 320, 81580, 389, 279, 9282, 340, 9, 9636, 12440, 1392, 198, 9, 24708, 23581, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 91710, 29189, 340, 9, 26041, 40086, 323, 55244, 369, 279, 1828, 1938, 271, 334, 2059, 18354, 323, 75247, 28603, 25, 57277, 9, 67680, 198, 9, 75247, 9145, 198, 9, 75247, 11262, 477, 3805, 33326, 198, 9, 26486, 259, 8035, 477, 55562, 39139, 198, 9, 73141, 45525, 323, 65046, 271, 334, 59482, 287, 323, 60638, 25, 57277, 9, 72760, 287, 45115, 323, 10633, 198, 9, 57410, 3419, 323, 82036, 8839, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 993, 672, 477, 7447, 41324, 340, 9, 80393, 11, 61080, 11, 26446, 11, 323, 15310, 1698, 198, 9, 10164, 16893, 477, 88000, 62564, 198, 9, 10164, 94536, 29679, 477, 4141, 320, 333, 4460, 340, 9, 12369, 323, 43402, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 4907, 16283, 11, 9025, 6651, 11, 32720, 14098, 340, 9, 73141, 45115, 323, 17677, 5707, 198, 9, 6785, 27795, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 9248, 11, 30673, 11, 4027, 2527, 388, 696, 334, 35127, 10320, 43312, 25, 57277, 9, 83499, 37161, 323, 26588, 57968, 198, 9, 12371, 536, 78130, 27883, 323, 27306, 5684, 198, 9, 45956, 84638, 198, 9, 8704, 99196, 198, 9, 12371, 536, 78130, 12269, 27883, 198, 9, 57401, 483, 53056, 3956, 320, 333, 4460, 696, 334, 5451, 38505, 25, 57277, 9, 5629, 12576, 16530, 449, 