l symbol on the board and will require players to work together to solve a puzzle or complete a mini-game. If the players succeed, they will be rewarded with a bonus item or advantage. If they fail, they will be penalized and will need to try again. Teamwork Challenges will add a social element to the game and encourage players to collaborate and communicate with each other.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 502, 5718, 369, 264, 1847, 1473, 334, 11590, 220, 16, 25, 330, 15335, 47197, 27864, 1, 57277, 644, 420, 1847, 11, 1070, 690, 387, 3361, 330, 15335, 47197, 27864, 1, 430, 4311, 649, 6667, 6957, 279, 1847, 13, 4314, 7563, 690, 617, 5016, 18000, 430, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 8895, 459, 9610, 927, 1023, 4311, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 264, 330, 85199, 1, 3786, 2643, 6144, 264, 2851, 505, 13490, 264, 2543, 11, 1418, 264, 330, 11303, 34507, 1, 3786, 2643, 2187, 264, 2851, 311, 3351, 459, 5066, 3634, 389, 872, 2543, 13, 25640, 649, 6667, 264, 7340, 315, 2380, 7572, 47197, 27864, 520, 904, 2728, 892, 11, 323, 814, 649, 387, 1511, 68774, 311, 8895, 459, 6964, 304, 279, 1847, 382, 334, 11590, 220, 17, 25, 330, 17964, 8092, 2336, 1, 57277, 791, 1847, 4580, 690, 4668, 8340, 44014, 430, 4311, 649, 7142, 439, 814, 3351, 1555, 279, 1847, 13, 4314, 44014, 690, 2187, 4311, 311, 31818, 3738, 32116, 477, 5662, 502, 5789, 315, 279, 4580, 810, 6288, 13, 4452, 11, 4311, 690, 1205, 311, 1005, 264, 3361, 330, 72016, 596, 28929, 1, 1537, 311, 16805, 279, 8340, 44014, 13, 1115, 1537, 649, 387, 1766, 304, 3738, 10687, 389, 279, 4580, 477, 15662, 439, 264, 11565, 369, 27666, 11774, 382, 334, 11590, 220, 18, 25, 330, 14939, 1816, 69778, 1, 57277, 644, 420, 1847, 11, 4311, 690, 23781, 2586, 4028, 330, 14939, 1816, 69778, 1, 430, 1397, 1124, 311, 990, 3871, 311, 4686, 264, 3465, 13, 4314, 11774, 690, 387, 13160, 555, 264, 3361, 7891, 389, 279, 4580, 323, 690, 1397, 4311, 311, 990, 3871, 311, 11886, 264, 25649, 477, 4686, 264, 13726, 19959, 13, 1442, 279, 4311, 12265, 11, 814, 690, 387, 44937, 449, 264, 123