:** Sounds good, thanks!\n\n**Chatbot:** You're welcome! Your order is confirmed. We'll see you soon!\n\nThis is just a sample dialogue, but you can customize it to fit your specific store's products and services. The chatbot can ask follow-up questions to clarify the customer's order and provide a smooth and efficient ordering experience.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6205, 6369, 6465, 21976, 311, 1935, 264, 6130, 2015, 1473, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 20776, 311, 510, 6221, 4076, 60, 0, 2650, 649, 358, 7945, 499, 3432, 1980, 334, 13084, 68063, 21694, 0, 358, 4265, 1093, 311, 2035, 459, 2015, 369, 1063, 66508, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 8681, 0, 3639, 955, 315, 66508, 527, 499, 3411, 369, 30, 1226, 617, 264, 7029, 6727, 315, 7878, 8356, 11, 63875, 11, 34479, 3956, 11, 323, 810, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 358, 1205, 1063, 14403, 11, 16385, 11, 323, 19335, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 36539, 0, 1226, 617, 264, 8205, 315, 14403, 2671, 13, 19418, 499, 1093, 4459, 11, 220, 17, 13689, 79669, 11, 477, 63168, 14403, 1980, 334, 13084, 68063, 358, 3358, 1935, 279, 220, 17, 4, 14403, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 8681, 5873, 0, 3639, 955, 315, 16385, 1053, 499, 1093, 30, 1226, 617, 4251, 11, 4459, 34153, 11, 20897, 67, 1409, 11, 323, 810, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 4702, 279, 4251, 16385, 374, 7060, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 36539, 0, 1628, 1268, 1690, 19335, 1053, 499, 1093, 30, 1226, 617, 3544, 11, 5066, 40248, 11, 323, 503, 49709, 19335, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 4702, 264, 21030, 3544, 19335, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 98693, 0, 4718, 2860, 4131, 704, 311, 387, 400, 55, 4436, 55, 13, 19418, 499, 1093, 311, 2343, 449, 6807, 3786, 11, 8515, 11, 477, 2930, 8323, 1980, 334, 13084, 68063, 358, 3358, 2343, 449, 6807, 3786, 382, 334, 16047, 6465, 68063, 8681, 0, 5321, 3493, 701, 6807, 3786, 2038, 323, 358, 3358, 1920, 279, 8323, 13, 4718, 2015, 690, 387, 5644, 369, 30686, 520, 1057, 3637, 2949, 279, 1828, 220, 966, 4520, 382, 334, 13084, 68063, 45241, 1695, 11, 9523, 2268, 334, 