Output~2025-04-24 17:16:07.302008: [RequestOutput(request_id=1167, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Produce a story about a bear. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 87988, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 11984, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='In the heart of the dense forest, there lived a big, fluffy bear named Bert. Bert was a gentle giant, with a coat as white as snow and eyes as bright as the stars. He spent most of his days roaming the forest, searching for berries and honey to fill his belly.\n\nOne sunny afternoon, Bert stumbled upon a hidden clearing deep in the woods. In the center of the clearing stood an old, gnarled tree, its branches twisted and tangled in a way that seemed almost magical. Bert was drawn to the tree, feeling an inexplicable sense of peace wash over him as he approached.\n\nAs he reached out to touch the trunk, a soft voice whispered in his ear, "Welcome, Bert. I have been waiting for you." Bert spun around, but there was no one in sight. The voice seemed to come from the tree itself.\n\nThe tree began to glow with a soft, golden light, and Bert felt himself being drawn into its branches. He climbed higher and higher, the branches growing thicker and more twisted as he ascended. At the top of the tree, Bert found a cozy little nest, lined with soft moss and feathers.\n\nThe tree spoke again, "Bert, you have been chosen to be the guardian of this forest. You must use your strength and kindness to protect the creatures that live here." Bert felt a surge of pride and responsibility, knowing that he was ready for this new role.\n\nFrom that day on, Bert spent his days exploring the forest, making sure that all the creatures were safe and happy. He used his strength to move fallen trees and create pathways, and his kindness to comfort the scared and lost. The other animals looked up to Bert as a hero, and the forest flourished under his care.\n\nYears passed, and Bert grew old and wise. But even in his old age, he remained the guardian of the forest, a symbol of strength, kindness, and protection. And the tree, now a symbol of wisdom and guidance, stood tall and proud, watching over Bert and the forest he loved.', token_ids=[644, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 29050, 13952, 11, 1070, 12439, 264, 2466, 11, 68661, 11984, 7086, 51775, 13, 51775, 574, 264, 22443, 14880, 11, 449, 264, 23724, 439, 4251, 439, 12056, 323, 6548, 439, 10107, 439, 279, 9958, 13, 1283, 7543, 1455, 315, 813, 2919, 69353, 279, 13952, 11, 15389, 369, 63494, 323, 26828, 311, 5266, 813, 36517, 382, 4054, 40798, 13658, 11, 51775, 50157, 5304, 264, 8340, 33850, 5655, 304, 279, 33633, 13, 763, 279, 4219, 315, 279, 33850, 14980, 459, 2362, 11, 39719, 277, 839, 5021, 11, 1202, 23962, 38817, 323, 93941, 304, 264, 1648, 430, 9508, 4661, 24632, 13, 51775, 574, 15107, 311, 279, 5021, 11, 8430, 459, 34678, 47214, 5647, 315, 9096, 11623, 927, 1461, 439, 568, 25735, 382, 2170, 568, 8813, 704, 311, 5916, 279, 38411, 11, 264, 8579, 7899, 58366, 304, 813, 2487, 11, 330, 14262, 11, 51775, 13, 358, 617, 1027, 8748, 369, 499, 1210, 51775, 57585, 2212, 11, 719, 1070, 574, 912, 832, 304, 14254, 13, 578, 7899, 9508, 311, 2586, 505, 279, 5021, 5196, 382, 791, 5021, 6137, 311, 37066, 449, 264, 8579, 11, 21411, 3177, 11, 323, 51775, 6612, 5678, 1694, 15107, 1139, 1202, 23962, 13, 1283, 45519, 5190, 323, 5190, 11, 279, 23962, 7982, 59884, 323, 810, 38817, 439, 568, 14943, 2954, 13, 2468, 279, 1948, 315, 279, 5021, 11, 51775, 1766, 264, 43535, 2697, 23634, 