Output~2025-04-24 17:16:16.522827: [RequestOutput(request_id=1171, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Summarize the story of Little Red Riding Hood. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 8279, 5730, 553, 279, 3446, 315, 15013, 3816, 77419, 36443, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a summary of the story of Little Red Riding Hood:\n\nLittle Red Riding Hood is a classic fairy tale about a young girl named Little Red Riding Hood who lives in a small village at the edge of a forest. One day, her mother asks her to take a basket of freshly baked cookies to her sick grandmother who lives on the other side of the forest. Little Red Riding Hood sets off on her journey, but she is unaware that a sly and hungry wolf is watching her from the shadows.\n\nThe wolf, who has been eyeing the grandmother's house, decides to take advantage of Little Red Riding Hood's innocence and follows her into the forest. When they reach the grandmother's house, the wolf eats the grandmother and disguises himself as her. Little Red Riding Hood arrives at the house and is greeted by the wolf in grandmother's bed. The wolf tries to eat Little Red Riding Hood, but a woodsman who is passing by the house hears her screams and comes to her rescue. He shoots the wolf and saves Little Red Riding Hood and her grandmother. The story ends with Little Red Riding Hood and her grandmother reunited and safe, and the wolf punished for his misdeeds.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 12399, 31