Output~2025-04-24 17:17:09.969461: [RequestOutput(request_id=1192, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a list of questions that you would ask to get to know someone better. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 1160, 315, 4860, 430, 499, 1053, 2610, 311, 636, 311, 1440, 4423, 2731, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a list of questions that you could ask to get to know someone better:\n\n**Personal Background**\n\n1. What's your favorite childhood memory and why is it so special to you?\n2. Where did you grow up and what was your favorite part about living there?\n3. What's your family like? Do you have any siblings?\n4. What's your favorite hobby or activity to do in your free time?\n5. What's something that's on your bucket list to achieve in the next 5 years?\n\n**Interests and Passions**\n\n1. What kind of music do you enjoy listening to and why?\n2. Do you have a favorite book or author? Why do you like it?\n3. What's your favorite type of cuisine and why?\n4. Are you a fan of any sports teams or athletes? Why do you like them?\n5. What's something you're passionate about and why?\n\n**Career and Goals**\n\n1. What do you do for work and what do you like most about it?\n2. What are your short-term and long-term career goals?\n3. What's the most challenging project you've worked on and how did you overcome any obstacles?\n4. What's something you're proud of accomplishing in your career?\n5. If you could switch careers for a day, what would you choose and why?\n\n**Values and Beliefs**\n\n1. What's most important to you in life and why?\n2. What's something you stand up for and why?\n3. Do you have a personal philosophy or mantra that guides your decisions?\n4. What's something you believe in that might be considered unconventional?\n5. How do you like to spend your free time and why?\n\n**Fun and Lighthearted**\n\n1. If you could travel anywhere in the world, where would you go and why?\n2. What's your go-to spontaneous date night idea?\n3. What's the best advice you've ever received and from whom?\n4. If you could have any superpower, what would it be and why?\n5. What's something that always makes you laugh?\n\nRemember, the goal is to ask open-ended questions that encourage the other person to share more about themselves. Avoid asking yes or no questions, and try to be genuinely interested in getting to know the other person better!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 1160, 315, 4860, 430, 499, 1436, 2610, 311, 636, 311, 1440, 4423, 2731, 1473, 334, 35127, 25837, 57277, 16, 13, 3639, 596, 701, 7075, 20587, 5044, 323, 3249, 374, 433, 779, 3361, 311, 499, 5380, 17, 13, 11208, 1550, 499, 3139, 709, 323, 1148, 574, 701, 7075, 961, 922, 5496, 1070, 5380, 18, 13, 3639, 596, 701, 3070, 1093, 30, 3234, 499, 617, 904, 37783, 5380, 19, 13, 3639, 596, 701, 7075, 32628, 477, 5820, 311, 656, 304, 701, 1949, 892, 5380, 20, 13, 3639, 596, 2555, 430, 596, 389, 701, 15994, 1160, 311, 11322, 304, 279, 1828, 220, 20, 1667, 1980, 334, 3386, 18450, 323, 10175, 919, 57277, 16, 13, 3639, 3169, 315, 4731, 656, 499, 4774, 14624, 311, 323, 3249, 5380, 17, 13, 3234, 499, 617, 264, 7075, 2363, 477, 3229, 30, 8595, 656, 499, 1093, 433, 5380, 18, 13, 3639, 596, 701, 7075, 955, 315, 36105, 323, 3249, 5380, 19, 13, 8886, 499, 264, 8571, 315, 904, 10034, 7411, 477, 23579, 30, 8595, 656, 499, 1093, 1124, 5380, 20, 13, 3639, 596, 2555, 499, 2351, 25429, 922, 323, 3249, 1980, 334, 91293, 323, 55293, 57277, 16, 13, 363