nied by loud thunder and lightning.\n5. **Heat Wave**: A heat wave is a prolonged period of abnormally hot weather, often accompanied by high humidity and temperatures above 90°F (32°C). It can cause heat-related illnesses, dehydration, and even death, especially for vulnerable populations such as the elderly and young children.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 10507, 315, 14560, 9282, 4787, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 98428, 26108, 96618, 362, 49784, 374, 264, 8147, 35148, 32343, 606, 430, 7739, 927, 279, 18435, 323, 12716, 3831, 29592, 11, 8987, 53958, 11, 323, 13766, 1765, 4282, 311, 35335, 5789, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 29759, 29592, 315, 520, 3325, 220, 5728, 35061, 320, 9079, 13437, 7682, 8, 323, 374, 3629, 24895, 555, 8987, 53958, 11, 39262, 11, 323, 5674, 311, 14054, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 35, 592, 22620, 96618, 362, 16174, 13766, 11, 1101, 3967, 439, 264, 9462, 27511, 477, 6183, 78, 677, 11, 374, 264, 15748, 9282, 3044, 32971, 555, 264, 3544, 3392, 315, 16174, 323, 9462, 19252, 22340, 304, 279, 3805, 11, 18189, 24035, 323, 14718, 42631, 5435, 13, 1102, 374, 3629, 9057, 555, 3831, 29592, 41442, 927, 9235, 11, 802, 307, 5789, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 5028, 39248, 96618, 362, 1529, 39248, 374, 264, 15748, 12056, 27511, 430, 374, 32971, 555, 3831, 29592, 11, 8987, 12056, 13772, 11, 323, 3428, 24035, 13, 1102, 374, 4613, 439, 264, 13766, 430, 40758, 369, 520, 3325, 2380, 4207, 323, 706, 29759, 29592, 315, 520, 3325, 220, 1758, 35061, 320, 3487, 13437, 7682, 8, 323, 8987, 12056, 13772, 315, 520, 3325, 220, 21, 15271, 320, 868, 10166, 8, 824, 6596, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 51, 64043, 96618, 362, 45272, 374, 264, 42496, 3330, 315, 3805, 430, 29727, 279, 5015, 323, 11384, 5674, 311, 14726, 323, 54832, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 1579, 10160, 25753, 11, 3629, 49005, 220, 1049, 35061, 320, 15805, 13437, 7682, 705, 323, 374, 3629, 24895, 555, 17813, 37943, 323, 33538, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 62406, 32418, 96618, 362, 8798, 12330, 374, 264, 44387, 4261, 315, 671, 86336, 4106, 9282, 11, 3629, 24895, 5