ed, Lily found herself back in the present, the tree's branches still glowing softly in the fading light. She felt changed, as if she had been given a glimpse of the world's true magic. From that day on, she visited the old oak tree often, listening to its whispers and learning the secrets of the past.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2875, 3446, 1473, 791, 10846, 18787, 9119, 271, 791, 2362, 38971, 5021, 14980, 16615, 323, 12691, 11, 1202, 39719, 277, 839, 23962, 42949, 7119, 279, 13180, 1093, 449, 12616, 19779, 13, 1102, 1047, 3970, 22540, 2586, 323, 733, 11, 10307, 439, 8689, 14264, 323, 2911, 6476, 24923, 1202, 28601, 13, 578, 5021, 1047, 1027, 264, 21737, 11550, 311, 28701, 7493, 11, 1202, 54842, 18534, 279, 61699, 315, 892, 323, 9282, 382, 2170, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 11, 264, 3995, 3828, 7086, 48390, 82294, 1139, 279, 33850, 1405, 279, 38971, 5021, 14980, 13, 3005, 1047, 6755, 7493, 315, 279, 5021, 596, 11204, 505, 1077, 39284, 11, 889, 11922, 430, 433, 5762, 279, 24511, 315, 279, 3347, 13, 48390, 596, 6548, 15541, 839, 449, 41328, 439, 1364, 8813, 704, 311, 5916, 279, 11413, 54842, 382, 2170, 1077, 19779, 1903, 3729, 11, 279, 5021, 6137, 311, 37066, 449, 264, 8579, 11, 21411, 3177, 13, 578, 3805, 574, 10409, 449, 279, 10437, 41466, 315, 26828, 323, 279, 89248, 315, 14154, 37565, 13, 48390, 6612, 11937, 1694, 40460, 1203, 304, 892, 11, 1375, 2299, 279, 19459, 315, 279, 5021, 596, 1317, 2324, 382, 8100, 5602, 2911, 5737, 24923, 1202, 23962, 11, 872, 43214, 323, 84936, 94824, 1555, 279, 1667, 13, 3005, 5602, 33218, 10532, 77, 16671, 304, 1202, 28601, 11, 872, 6206, 1218, 86, 1619, 439, 814, 342, 28109, 709, 520, 279, 13180, 13, 3005, 5602, 25981, 323, 2138, 1572, 11, 37846, 82, 323, 61272, 11, 323, 279, 5021, 11509, 3831, 1555, 433, 682, 382, 2170, 279, 58395, 54434, 11, 48390, 1766, 11937, 1203, 304, 279, 3118, 11, 279, 5021, 596, 23962, 2103, 49592, 57150, 304, 279, 59617, 3177, 13, 3005, 6612, 5614, 11, 439, 422, 1364, 1047, 1027, 2728, 264, 40942, 315, 279,