h a spatula as needed to ensure everything is well mixed\n\n**Step 5: Taste and Adjust**\n\n* Taste the smoothie and adjust the sweetness, consistency, or flavor as needed\n* Add more honey, yogurt, or milk if desired\n* Blend again for a few seconds to incorporate the changes\n\n**Step 6: Serve and Enjoy**\n\n* Pour the smoothie into a glass or container\n* Serve immediately and enjoy! You can also store it in the fridge for later or take it on-the-go.\n\nThat's it! With these simple steps, you can create a delicious and refreshing smoothie that's perfect for any time of day.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 279, 7504, 311, 1304, 264, 11113, 648, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 52275, 57277, 9, 22991, 701, 7075, 26390, 11, 1778, 439, 68442, 11, 63494, 11, 70368, 11, 477, 904, 1023, 10824, 499, 1093, 198, 9, 8593, 264, 14812, 2385, 11, 1778, 439, 55575, 11, 14403, 11, 477, 23661, 198, 9, 2758, 904, 5217, 14293, 499, 1093, 11, 1778, 439, 26828, 11, 68798, 11, 477, 13128, 17138, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 6113, 323, 32266, 279, 435, 68998, 57277, 9, 58468, 325, 279, 26390, 1234, 4401, 3090, 311, 4148, 904, 26351, 477, 35098, 198, 9, 7281, 279, 26390, 9235, 449, 264, 4335, 43713, 477, 5684, 53984, 311, 4148, 13937, 32257, 198, 9, 11016, 904, 19595, 11, 63008, 11, 477, 44814, 439, 4460, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 2758, 52275, 311, 279, 88668, 57277, 9, 2758, 279, 10235, 26390, 311, 264, 62895, 477, 3691, 18121, 198, 9, 2758, 279, 14812, 2385, 323, 904, 5217, 14293, 499, 1093, 198, 9, 7557, 2771, 311, 5387, 3403, 3634, 520, 279, 1948, 315, 279, 62895, 369, 279, 14293, 311, 3351, 2212, 1418, 56941, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 55248, 279, 51825, 648, 57277, 9, 13330, 279, 62895, 477, 3691, 18121, 27431, 323, 20955, 279, 14293, 389, 1579, 4732, 3156, 11113, 323, 47985, 198, 9, 14549, 279, 62895, 323, 58228, 1523, 279, 11314, 449, 264, 63983, 5724, 439, 4460, 311, 6106, 4395, 374, 1664, 9709, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 59081, 323, 28295, 57277, 9, 59081, 279, 11113, 648, 