wo lovers ultimately brings peace between their families, as they realize the senseless destruction their feud has caused. The play explores themes of love, fate, and the destructive nature of hate, and its tragic ending has become one of the most famous in all of literature.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 16964, 279, 7234, 315, 42482, 596, 1514, 11, 71292, 323, 72124, 1473, 49, 638, 78, 323, 72124, 11, 264, 35279, 3021, 3446, 5439, 555, 12656, 42482, 11, 10975, 279, 24162, 315, 1403, 3995, 33218, 505, 1172, 51867, 8689, 304, 6383, 6863, 13, 578, 9995, 13796, 323, 279, 8171, 1130, 2641, 617, 1027, 520, 21448, 369, 1667, 11, 323, 872, 35242, 369, 1855, 1023, 374, 779, 3831, 430, 1524, 279, 6420, 315, 279, 1023, 3070, 596, 836, 649, 15541, 264, 4465, 382, 85417, 420, 39577, 315, 35242, 323, 9349, 11, 71292, 11, 264, 9995, 4768, 11, 323, 72124, 11, 264, 8171, 49518, 11, 4498, 17693, 304, 3021, 520, 264, 5041, 21685, 555, 72124, 596, 3070, 13, 2435, 9473, 77541, 315, 3021, 11, 719, 872, 8689, 6, 4039, 22828, 7119, 1855, 1023, 3727, 872, 3021, 12266, 382, 20397, 279, 8137, 11, 279, 1403, 33218, 10491, 311, 32918, 304, 6367, 11, 449, 279, 1520, 315, 31502, 277, 28574, 11, 264, 24219, 323, 8830, 28185, 13, 4452, 11, 994, 71292, 29910, 72124, 596, 36271, 14221, 65, 3223, 304, 264, 66407, 11, 568, 374, 9120, 3384, 505, 6383, 6863, 382, 29185, 3978, 282, 2094, 1077, 1866, 4648, 311, 5766, 78849, 2500, 893, 1077, 6699, 617, 12146, 369, 1077, 11, 719, 71292, 13919, 1364, 374, 2216, 5710, 323, 3273, 19941, 5678, 304, 1077, 44180, 13, 72124, 1384, 71837, 311, 1505, 71292, 5710, 323, 11, 304, 38384, 323, 46996, 11, 357, 3518, 11937, 449, 813, 40331, 311, 5249, 1461, 304, 4648, 382, 791, 35279, 842, 315, 279, 1403, 33218, 13967, 12716, 9096, 1990, 872, 8689, 11, 439, 814, 13383, 279, 5647, 1752, 19814, 872, 57810, 706, 9057, 13, 578, 1514, 41424, 22100, 315, 3021, 11, 25382, 11, 323, 279, 40652, 7138, 315, 12491, 11, 323, 1202, 35279, 13696, 706, 3719, 832, 315, 279, 1455,