Output~2025-04-24 17:18:49.766973: [RequestOutput(request_id=1243, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Tell me a story about a lovable character. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 25672, 757, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 781, 24694, 3752, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Once upon a time, in a small town nestled in the rolling hills of the countryside, there lived a lovable character named Luna. She was a gentle soul with a heart of gold, a mop of curly brown hair, and a smile that could light up the darkest of rooms.\n\nLuna lived in a cozy little cottage on the outskirts of town, surrounded by a lush garden filled with vibrant flowers and the sweet scent of fresh herbs. She spent her days tending to her garden, baking delicious treats in her tiny kitchen, and exploring the surrounding woods, collecting wildflowers and leaves to use in her craft projects.\n\nDespite her quiet nature, Luna had a special gift – she could communicate with animals. She could understand their thoughts and feelings, and they could sense hers. The creatures of the forest adored her, and she loved them just the same. The birds would perch on her windowsill, the rabbits would hop up to her doorstep, and the squirrels would scamper up her arm to play with her hair.\n\nOne day, a fierce storm rolled in, bringing heavy rain and strong winds. The townspeople huddled indoors, worried about the damage the storm might cause. But not Luna. She ventured out into the storm, her umbrella blown inside out, her hair whipping about her face. She knew the animals needed her help, and she was determined to find them.\n\nAs she made her way through the forest, she came across a family of field mice, shivering with fear in their burrow. She scooped them up in her arms and carried them to the safety of her cottage, where she fed them warm soup and wrapped them in soft blankets. She spent the rest of the day tending to the animals, rescuing those trapped in their homes and providing shelter for those who had lost theirs.\n\nAs the storm passed, the townspeople emerged to survey the damage. They were amazed to find that Luna's cottage, though battered and bruised, was still standing, and her garden was untouched. They knew that it was no coincidence – Luna's love and kindness had protected her home and the creatures she cared for.\n\nFrom that day on, the townspeople looked upon Luna as a hero, and her cottage became a sanctuary for all the creatures of the forest. And Luna, happy to be surrounded by her animal friends, continued to live her life with kindness, compassion, and a heart full of love.", token_ids=[12805, 5304, 264, 892, 11, 304, 264, 2678, 6424, 89777, 304, 279, 20700, 35231, 315, 279, 47967, 11, 1070, 12439, 264, 781, 24694, 3752, 7086, 50905, 13, 3005, 574, 264, 22443, 13836, 449, 264, 4851, 315, 6761, 11, 264, 89164, 315, 69203, 14198, 7013, 11, 323, 264, 15648, 430, 1436, 3177, 709, 279, 77069, 315, 12295, 382, 43, 8733, 12439, 304, 264, 43535, 2697, 46722, 389, 279, 71333, 315, 6424, 11, 23712, 555, 264, 58367, 13863, 10409, 449, 34076, 19837, 323, 279, 10437, 41466, 315, 7878, 42393, 13, 3005, 7543, 1077, 2919, 259, 2518, 311, 1077, 13863, 11, 28915, 18406, 32839, 304, 1077, 13987, 9979, 11, 323, 24919, 279, 14932, 33633, 11, 26984, 8545, 89770, 323, 11141, 311, 1005, 304, 1077, 11003, 7224, 382, 20397, 1077, 11594, 7138, 11, 50905, 1047, 264, 3361, 8352, 1389, 1364, 1436, 19570, 449, 10099, 13, 3005, 1436, 3619, 872, 11555, 323, 16024, 