umonia, bronchitis, and sinus and ear infections\n* Reduce the risk of hospitalization and even death from the flu\n* Protect not only yourself, but also those around you, such as family members, friends, and colleagues, by reducing the spread of the virus\n* Help prevent the flu from spreading in your community, which can help reduce the strain on healthcare systems and protect vulnerable populations\n\nIt's also important to note that the flu vaccine is constantly updated to protect against the most common and severe strains of the flu virus, so even if you've had the vaccine before, it's still important to get vaccinated each year.\n\nOverall, the benefits of getting a flu vaccine far outweigh the risks, and I highly recommend getting vaccinated every year to protect yourself and those around you.", token_ids=[2170, 264, 10896, 11, 358, 4265, 1093, 311, 1935, 264, 4545, 311, 4358, 279, 20236, 25474, 449, 499, 13, 578, 20236, 25474, 374, 264, 6220, 323, 7524, 1648, 311, 6144, 2403, 279, 62937, 17188, 11, 902, 649, 5353, 6129, 17563, 323, 1524, 8952, 2065, 11, 5423, 304, 3738, 22673, 1778, 439, 279, 29920, 11, 3995, 2911, 11, 323, 1274, 449, 16940, 2890, 4787, 382, 334, 96711, 54463, 2857, 25, 57277, 8142, 279, 20236, 25474, 374, 8965, 1633, 6220, 11, 1070, 527, 1063, 4754, 15635, 323, 3185, 6372, 311, 387, 8010, 315, 13, 4314, 1253, 2997, 1473, 9, 61289, 25481, 1778, 439, 36366, 2136, 11, 2579, 2136, 11, 477, 55307, 520, 279, 26127, 2816, 198, 9, 11452, 1815, 198, 9, 26417, 22711, 198, 9, 68427, 477, 10496, 6784, 198, 9, 85001, 198, 9, 2052, 75439, 25481, 11, 8051, 9024, 271, 2181, 596, 3062, 311, 5296, 430, 1521, 3185, 6372, 527, 6118, 23900, 323, 13643, 11, 323, 1455, 1274, 649, 3136, 449, 872, 4725, 7640, 2085, 904, 4819, 382, 334, 96711, 39195, 25, 57277, 791, 7720, 315, 3794, 264, 20236, 25474, 3117, 63074, 279, 15635, 13, 3296, 3794, 70558, 11, 499, 649, 1473, 9, 53253, 701, 5326, 315, 3794, 279, 20236, 555, 709, 311, 220, 1399, 14062, 9, 53253, 279, 5326, 3