Output~2025-04-24 17:22:59.449039: [RequestOutput(request_id=1345, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: For integers a, b, c, and d, (x^2+ax+b)(x^2+cx+d)=x^4+x^3-2x^2+17x-5. What is the value of a+b+c+d? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1789, 26864, 264, 11, 293, 11, 272, 11, 323, 294, 11, 320, 87, 61, 17, 10, 710, 36193, 2432, 87, 61, 17, 10, 26929, 52512, 11992, 87, 61, 19, 38992, 61, 18, 12, 17, 87, 61, 17, 10, 1114, 87, 12, 20, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 907, 315, 264, 36193, 50238, 52512, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="To solve this problem, we can start by expanding the left-hand side of the equation:\n\n(x^2+ax+b)(x^2+cx+d) = x^4 + (a+c)x^3 + (b+ac)x^2 + (ad+bc)x + bd\n\nNow, we can equate the coefficients of each term on both sides of the equation:\n\nx^4: 1 = 1 (matches)\nx^3: a+c = 1 (matches)\nx^2: b+ac = -2 (matches)\nx: ad+bc = 17 (matches)\nconstant: bd = -5 (matches)\n\nNow, we can solve for a, b, c, and d. From the x^3 term, we get:\n\na + c = 1 --> c = 1 - a\n\nSubstitute this into the x^2 term:\n\nb + a(1-a) = -2 --> b - a^2 = -2\n\nSolve for a:\n\na^2 - b + 2 = 0 --> a = 1 or a = -3\n\nIf a = 1, then c = 0 and b = -1. If a = -3, then c = 2 and b = 2.\n\nLet's check the x term:\n\nIf a = 1, then ad + bc = 1(-3) + 0(2) = -3, which doesn't match the equation.\n\nIf a = -3, then ad + bc = (-3)(d) + 2(2) = 17, which matches the equation.\n\nSo, a = -3, b = 2, c = 2, and d = 1.\n\nFinally, we can find the value of a + b + c + d:\n\na + b + c + d = -3 + 2 + 2 + 1 = 2\n\nTherefore, the value of a + b + c + d is 2.", token_ids=[1271, 11886, 420, 3575, 11, 584, 649, 1212, 555, 24050, 279, 2163, 25417, 3185, 315, 279, 24524, 1473, 2120, 61, 17, 10, 710, 36193, 2432, 87, 61, 17, 10, 26929, 52512, 8, 284, 865, 61, 19, 489, 320, 64, 50238, 51824, 61, 18, 489, 320, 65, 10, 582, 51824, 61, 17, 489, 320, 329, 10, 9081, 51824, 489, 22206, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 3312, 349, 279, 37929, 315, 1855, 4751, 389, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 1473, 87, 61, 19, 25, 220, 16, 284, 220, 16, 320, 20509, 340, 87, 61, 18, 25, 264, 50238, 284, 220, 16, 320, 20509, 340, 87, 61, 17, 25, 293, 10, 582, 284, 482, 17, 320, 20509, 340, 87, 25, 1008, 10, 9081, 284, 220, 1114, 320, 20509, 340, 18568, 25, 22206, 284, 482, 20, 320, 20509, 696, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 11886, 369, 264, 11, 293, 11, 272, 11, 323, 294, 13, 5659, 279, 865, 61, 18, 4751, 11, 584, 636, 1473, 64, 489, 272, 284, 220, 16, 3929, 272, 284, 220, 16, 482, 264, 271, 3214, 7815, 420, 1139, 279, 865, 61, 17, 4751, 1473, 65, 489, 264, 7, 16, 7561, 8, 284, 482, 17, 3929, 293, 482, 264, 61, 17, 284, 482, 17, 271, 50, 4035, 369, 264, 1473, 64, 61, 17, 482, 293, 489, 220, 17, 284, 220, 15, 3929, 264, 284, 220, 16, 477, 264, 284, 482, 18, 271, 2746, 264, 284, 220, 16, 11, 1243, 272, 284, 220, 15, 323, 293, 284, 482, 16, 13, 1442, 264, 284, 482, 18, 11, 1243, 272, 284, 220, 17, 323, 293, 284, 220, 17, 382, 10267, 596, 1817, 279, 865, 4751, 1473, 2746, 264, 284, 220, 16, 11, 1243, 1008, 489, 18399, 284, 220, 16, 4172, 18, 8, 489, 220, 15, 7, 17, 8, 284, 482, 18, 11, 902, 3250, 956, 2489, 279, 24524, 382, 2746, 264, 284, 482, 18, 11, 1243, 1008, 489, 18399, 284, 10505, 18, 2432, 67, 8, 489, 220, 17, 7, 17, 8, 284, 220, 1114, 11, 902, 9248, 279, 24524, 382, 4516, 11, 264, 284, 482, 18, 11, 293, 284, 220, 17, 11, 272, 284, 220, 17, 11, 323, 294, 284, 220, 16, 382, 24901, 11, 584, 649, 1505, 279, 907, 315, 264, 489, 293, 489, 272, 489, 294, 1473, 64, 489, 293, 489, 272, 489, 294, 2