t known for her pioneering work on radioactivity and the discovery of the elements polonium and radium.\n4. **Martin Luther King Jr.** (1929-1968): An American Baptist minister and civil rights activist, King is known for his leadership in the civil rights movement, advocating for racial equality and social justice through nonviolent means. He was a key figure in the Montgomery Bus Boycott and the March on Washington, and was awarded the Nobel Peace Prize in 1964.\n5. **John F. Kennedy** (1917-1963): The 35th President of the United States, Kennedy is known for his leadership during the Cold War and his vision for a more peaceful and prosperous world. He was a strong advocate for space exploration and was instrumental in establishing the United States' presence in space. His presidency was cut short by his assassination in 1963.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 1160, 315, 4330, 11495, 1274, 505, 279, 220, 508, 339, 9478, 449, 264, 10015, 4096, 315, 1855, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 67722, 55152, 334, 320, 9674, 24, 12, 6280, 20, 1680, 362, 6063, 40260, 83323, 11, 55152, 374, 13882, 27458, 439, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 32549, 14248, 315, 279, 220, 508, 339, 9478, 13, 1283, 374, 1888, 3967, 369, 813, 10334, 315, 1375, 44515, 323, 279, 11495, 24524, 469, 28, 13183, 30556, 13, 5414, 990, 14110, 1534, 1057, 8830, 315, 3634, 323, 892, 11, 323, 568, 574, 22034, 279, 48078, 32293, 304, 28415, 304, 220, 5926, 16, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 47308, 266, 1764, 48994, 334, 320, 9714, 24, 12, 6393, 23, 1680, 1556, 7904, 24589, 28941, 11, 48994, 374, 3967, 369, 813, 19675, 315, 2536, 90162, 13957, 11, 902, 568, 1511, 311, 3063, 6890, 311, 24589, 505, 8013, 6037, 13, 1283, 374, 1101, 3967, 369, 813, 4382, 5496, 323, 813, 35954, 369, 8431, 3268, 323, 3674, 12437, 13, 1283, 574, 26816, 15846, 304, 220, 6393, 23, 11, 719, 813, 20160, 9731, 311, 31740, 19567, 369, 2536, 90162, 2349, 2212, 279, 1917, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 12331, 648, 13182, 648, 334, 320, 9714, 22, 12, 7285, 19, 1680, 362, 33084, 40260, 83323, 32