er view, as a gesture of goodwill.\n\nPlease let me know if this solution meets your expectations, or if there's anything else I can do to make your stay more enjoyable. Your satisfaction is our top priority, and I appreciate your feedback in helping us improve our services.\n\nIf you have any further concerns or questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to me directly. I'm available 24/7 to address any issues that may arise during your stay.\n\nThank you for choosing to stay with us, and I look forward to resolving this issue promptly.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\nHotel Manager", token_ids=[31765, 33647, 8810, 3638, 40, 37979, 369, 279, 44085, 96391, 315, 701, 3130, 5304, 19163, 13, 358, 3619, 1268, 35711, 433, 2011, 387, 311, 1505, 701, 15197, 323, 25112, 539, 709, 311, 1057, 13783, 10886, 13, 358, 1390, 311, 36015, 499, 430, 584, 1935, 682, 21859, 14243, 323, 527, 11411, 311, 8405, 264, 10882, 323, 4335, 4822, 369, 682, 1057, 15051, 382, 40, 1053, 1093, 311, 3085, 311, 7214, 3708, 1057, 3838, 33494, 2128, 311, 312, 92900, 701, 3130, 11, 2737, 279, 15197, 323, 10223, 279, 25112, 13, 1226, 690, 1101, 3493, 499, 449, 264, 54428, 14234, 311, 264, 5190, 6558, 449, 264, 2731, 1684, 11, 439, 264, 31257, 315, 82746, 382, 5618, 1095, 757, 1440, 422, 420, 6425, 20628, 701, 17078, 11, 477, 422, 1070, 596, 4205, 775, 358, 649, 656, 311, 1304, 701, 4822, 810, 32180, 13, 4718, 24617, 374, 1057, 1948, 10844, 11, 323, 358, 15763, 701, 11302, 304, 10695, 603, 7417, 1057, 3600, 382, 2746, 499, 617, 904, 4726, 10742, 477, 4860, 11, 4587, 1541, 956, 39666, 311, 5662, 704, 311, 757, 6089, 13, 358, 2846, 2561, 220, 1187, 14, 22, 311, 2686, 904, 4819, 430, 1253, 31889, 2391, 701, 4822, 382, 13359, 499, 369, 19301, 311, 4822, 449, 603, 11, 323, 358, 1427, 4741, 311, 53583, 420, 4360, 40522, 382, 14809, 24886, 345, 58, 7927, 4076, 933, 46674, 10790, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=Non