ee public speaking resources, including articles, videos, and podcasts. You can learn tips and techniques for improving your public speaking skills, and even practice your speaking skills with their interactive exercises.\n\nWebsite: https://www.speaklikeapro.com/\n\n5. **Toastmasters International**: Toastmasters is a global organization that provides a supportive environment for people to improve their public speaking and leadership skills. Their website offers a range of online resources, including webinars, articles, and videos, to help you improve your public speaking skills.\n\nWebsite: https://www.toastmasters.org/\n\nI hope these online resources help you improve your public speaking skills!', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 2930, 5070, 369, 18899, 586, 12365, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 44349, 805, 64, 482, 3142, 45072, 9984, 2065, 96618, 1115, 2930, 3388, 11, 9076, 555, 279, 3907, 315, 6652, 11, 14861, 279, 57940, 315, 586, 12365, 11, 2737, 9293, 11, 35821, 11, 323, 24944, 264, 8982, 13, 578, 3388, 5764, 2835, 46232, 11, 89323, 11, 323, 32272, 311, 1520, 499, 7417, 701, 586, 12365, 7512, 382, 31151, 25, 3788, 1129, 2185, 522, 414, 805, 64, 2726, 2754, 3037, 8200, 22816, 62290, 271, 17, 13, 3146, 34570, 81547, 96618, 84296, 81547, 374, 264, 5526, 2930, 5452, 430, 4519, 2875, 11, 8147, 13739, 389, 264, 7029, 2134, 315, 13650, 13, 1472, 649, 3821, 323, 4048, 505, 10534, 22032, 11, 323, 1524, 6725, 701, 1866, 586, 12365, 7512, 555, 7231, 264, 84296, 11549, 3137, 382, 31151, 25, 3788, 1129, 2185, 739, 291, 916, 5640, 1727, 82, 271, 18, 13, 3146, 12965, 45072, 8267, 17026, 555, 1608, 55, 96618, 1115, 2930, 3388, 11, 9076, 555, 279, 3907, 315, 7188, 11, 33108, 11, 14861, 279, 32874, 315, 586, 12365, 11, 2737, 8982, 26372, 11, 9889, 11, 323, 10877, 20392, 13, 578, 3388, 5764, 2835, 46232, 11, 89323, 11, 323, 32272, 311, 1520, 499, 7417, 701, 586, 12365, 7512, 382, 31151, 25, 3788, 1129, 2185, 10265, 87, 2726, 85449, 22816, 62290, 271, 19, 13, 3146, 96945, 9086, 264, 1322, 