ve item, like a tiny figurine or a small shell, to the shoe.\n8. Finally, use a hot glue gun to attach a small piece of twine or ribbon to the top of the shoe, creating a hanger for your planter.\n\nVoilà! Your upcycled shoe planter is ready to brighten up any room or outdoor space.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 8815, 2268, 8586, 596, 264, 11782, 4623, 311, 61843, 459, 2362, 30077, 1473, 334, 2378, 66, 37676, 68181, 9878, 466, 57277, 9140, 459, 2362, 30077, 1139, 264, 5016, 3197, 466, 369, 2678, 11012, 477, 42393, 0, 5810, 596, 1268, 1473, 61612, 4460, 1473, 9, 10846, 30077, 320, 3852, 955, 11, 719, 264, 21423, 4506, 477, 264, 9462, 278, 1053, 990, 1888, 340, 9, 28069, 1413, 6308, 320, 582, 44280, 477, 23749, 6308, 340, 9, 362, 2678, 3392, 315, 3419, 1303, 17614, 198, 9, 362, 2678, 6136, 477, 39999, 315, 701, 5873, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 20639, 29580, 11, 68186, 11, 477, 270, 31218, 340, 9, 28069, 1413, 23902, 477, 2678, 1069, 6194, 645, 198, 9, 12536, 25, 38561, 11, 72724, 11, 323, 264, 4106, 38561, 6166, 271, 56391, 1473, 16, 13, 9785, 279, 30077, 27461, 449, 27883, 323, 3090, 311, 4148, 904, 26351, 477, 35098, 627, 17, 13, 31941, 279, 30077, 6724, 449, 264, 43713, 627, 18, 13, 17646, 279, 30077, 449, 46536, 6308, 311, 3041, 433, 264, 7878, 11, 502, 1427, 13, 1472, 649, 923, 12912, 11, 55788, 11, 477, 1524, 264, 2523, 2955, 627, 19, 13, 9843, 279, 6308, 374, 9235, 11, 5266, 279, 30077, 449, 3419, 1303, 17614, 11, 9564, 922, 459, 17560, 520, 279, 1948, 369, 279, 6136, 627, 20, 13, 18317, 701, 12146, 2678, 6136, 477, 39999, 304, 279, 17614, 13, 1472, 649, 31993, 279, 17614, 323, 6136, 311, 1893, 264, 43395, 33352, 2955, 627, 21, 13, 2758, 46536, 23902, 477, 2678, 1069, 6194, 645, 2212, 279, 6136, 311, 923, 1063, 10651, 323, 1933, 627, 22, 13, 1442, 499, 1390, 311, 923, 459, 5066, 5916, 11, 1005, 38561, 311, 15866, 264, 2678, 46536, 1537, 11, 1093, 264, 13987, 56755, 483, 477, 264, 2678, 12811, 11, 311, 279, 30077, 627, 23, 13, 17830, 11, 1005, 264, 4106, 38561, 6166, 