 the sense of global solidarity and shared struggle for human rights and social justice.\n\nOverall, the protests following police brutality in the US have spread to other countries because they have tapped into a broader global movement for social justice and human rights, and have been fueled by the widespread outrage and solidarity with the victims of police brutality.', token_ids=[791, 2944, 3249, 279, 22670, 2768, 4379, 63132, 304, 279, 2326, 617, 9041, 311, 1023, 5961, 374, 4461, 4245, 311, 279, 24716, 30229, 323, 44254, 449, 279, 12697, 315, 4379, 63132, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 279, 26617, 46417, 27052, 323, 4379, 63132, 430, 374, 3970, 439, 264, 3728, 4360, 13, 578, 22670, 304, 279, 2326, 617, 1027, 2322, 449, 6625, 6666, 323, 72106, 11, 449, 1690, 1274, 2212, 279, 1917, 37810, 872, 1862, 369, 279, 5348, 40495, 34464, 7351, 323, 82234, 279, 6299, 315, 279, 4379, 382, 791, 22670, 617, 1101, 1027, 59461, 555, 279, 24716, 18539, 315, 3674, 3772, 11, 902, 706, 5535, 1274, 311, 4430, 2038, 323, 5448, 315, 4379, 63132, 323, 3823, 3268, 50162, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 311, 31335, 323, 29905, 553, 22670, 323, 1023, 7739, 315, 55280, 13, 23212, 11, 279, 22670, 617, 1027, 28160, 555, 279, 7982, 17985, 315, 46417, 27052, 323, 4379, 63132, 304, 1023, 5961, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 279, 5647, 315, 3728, 44254, 323, 6222, 14993, 369, 3823, 3268, 323, 3674, 12437, 382, 28589, 11, 279, 22670, 2768, 4379, 63132, 304, 279, 2326, 617, 9041, 311, 1023, 5961, 1606, 814, 617, 49523, 1139, 264, 27927, 3728, 7351, 369, 3674, 12437, 323, 3823, 3268, 11, 323, 617, 1027, 59461, 555, 279, 24716, 30229, 323, 44254, 449, 279, 12697, 315, 4379, 63132, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
