eptiles are oviparous, meaning that they lay eggs outside of their bodies, rather than giving birth to live young like mammals.\n\nThe red-footed tortoise meets these criteria, as it has a shell that is covered in scaly skin, it is cold-blooded, and it lays eggs. The tree frog and the rabbit, on the other hand, are not reptiles. The tree frog is an amphibian, and the rabbit is a mammal.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 11, 279, 10065, 430, 374, 264, 64873, 458, 374, 279, 2579, 21117, 291, 16831, 69289, 13, 1115, 374, 1606, 64873, 3742, 527, 264, 1912, 315, 10099, 430, 617, 3738, 17910, 11, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 2522, 5893, 6930, 25, 1050, 418, 3742, 617, 9235, 11, 1156, 5893, 6930, 430, 8779, 311, 5471, 3090, 4814, 505, 872, 13162, 627, 9, 24062, 94003, 291, 25, 1050, 418, 3742, 527, 77594, 1605, 21914, 11, 7438, 430, 814, 37377, 872, 2547, 9499, 1701, 9434, 8336, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 7160, 477, 264, 8369, 7091, 11, 4856, 1109, 24038, 8798, 34167, 1093, 56669, 323, 20229, 627, 9, 45024, 19335, 25, 1050, 418, 3742, 527, 25568, 121481, 788, 11, 7438, 430, 814, 11203, 19335, 4994, 315, 872, 13162, 11, 4856, 1109, 7231, 7342, 311, 3974, 3995, 1093, 56669, 382, 791, 2579, 21117, 291, 16831, 69289, 20628, 1521, 13186, 11, 439, 433, 706, 264, 12811, 430, 374, 9960, 304, 1156, 5893, 6930, 11, 433, 374, 9439, 94003, 291, 11, 323, 433, 57622, 19335, 13, 578, 5021, 60981, 323, 279, 39824, 11, 389, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 527, 539, 64873, 3742, 13, 578, 5021, 60981, 374, 459, 89022, 1122, 11, 323, 279, 39824, 374, 264, 36041, 278, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
