 for paper products.\n\n5. **Conserve water**: Conserve water by taking shorter showers, fixing leaks, and using water-efficient appliances. You can also install low-flow showerheads and toilets to reduce water consumption.\n\nRemember, every small action counts, and making these changes can have a significant impact when combined with the efforts of others.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 2574, 499, 649, 656, 311, 8108, 701, 12782, 43972, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 51425, 4907, 15652, 96618, 3861, 315, 279, 45648, 5627, 311, 8108, 701, 12782, 43972, 374, 311, 8108, 701, 4907, 15652, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 2884, 555, 13353, 1022, 13001, 11, 31591, 11, 323, 34802, 994, 539, 304, 1005, 11, 1701, 4907, 73916, 3177, 54320, 11, 323, 43468, 701, 75170, 311, 1005, 2753, 4907, 369, 24494, 323, 28015, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 10464, 586, 18386, 477, 1841, 10497, 96618, 12362, 586, 18386, 11, 1841, 10497, 287, 11, 477, 67180, 477, 11689, 369, 2875, 23277, 649, 12207, 8108, 279, 3392, 315, 12782, 40589, 48042, 555, 11731, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 2980, 1701, 9249, 477, 26038, 11731, 369, 4443, 18386, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 51425, 11, 1050, 817, 11, 4158, 5566, 96618, 53253, 701, 15652, 315, 3254, 25700, 68386, 11, 27068, 3673, 15716, 3284, 11, 323, 61843, 439, 1790, 439, 499, 649, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 34978, 5684, 11, 12466, 11, 9168, 11, 323, 9501, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 57823, 287, 3691, 12571, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 10464, 42688, 22658, 3956, 96618, 22991, 3956, 449, 17832, 24066, 11, 3780, 304, 20155, 11, 323, 3469, 369, 3956, 449, 57340, 11919, 24066, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 5268, 3956, 449, 22556, 82571, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 20585, 800, 24998, 5383, 9251, 320, 37, 3624, 8, 369, 5684, 3956, 382, 20, 13, 3146, 1128, 13570, 3090, 96618, 1221, 13570, 3090, 555, 4737, 24210, 52902, 11, 36351, 37796, 11, 323, 1701, 3090, 73916, 34802, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 4685, 3428, 62413, 17639, 36910, 323, 63287, 311, 8108, 3090, 15652, 382, 29690, 11, 1475, 2678, 1957, 14921, 11, 323, 3339, 1521, 4442, 649, 617, 264, 5199,