Output~2025-04-24 17:30:13.727348: [RequestOutput(request_id=1523, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Give a 5-step process to solve this math equation. ### Input: (x^2+5x+6)/(x-2) ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 21335, 264, 220, 20, 30308, 1920, 311, 11886, 420, 7033, 24524, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 320, 87, 61, 17, 10, 20, 87, 10, 21, 25239, 87, 12, 17, 8, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a 5-step process to solve the given math equation:\n\n**Step 1: Factor the numerator**\n\nThe numerator is a quadratic expression, which can be factored as:\n\nx^2 + 5x + 6 = (x + 2)(x + 3)\n\nSo, the equation becomes:\n\n((x + 2)(x + 3))/(x - 2)\n\n**Step 2: Cancel out any common factors**\n\nNotice that the factor (x + 2) is present in both the numerator and the denominator. We can cancel it out:\n\n(x + 3)/(x - 2)\n\n**Step 3: Simplify the expression**\n\nThe expression is already simplified, as there are no more common factors to cancel out.\n\n**Step 4: Identify any holes or asymptotes**\n\nThe denominator (x - 2) has a hole at x = 2, since the numerator is not defined at x = 2. There are no asymptotes in this expression.\n\n**Step 5: Write the final answer**\n\nThe simplified expression is:\n\n(x + 3)/(x - 2)\n\nThis is the final answer.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 220, 20, 30308, 1920, 311, 11886, 279, 2728, 7033, 24524, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 38829, 279, 64633, 57277, 791, 64633, 374, 264, 80251, 7645, 11, 902, 649, 387, 2144, 3093, 439, 1473, 87, 61, 17, 489, 220, 20, 87, 489, 220, 21, 284, 320, 87, 489, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 489, 220, 18, 696, 4516, 11, 279, 24524, 9221, 1473, 1209, 87, 489, 220, 17, 2432, 87, 489, 220, 18, 68095, 87, 482, 220, 17, 696, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 24451, 704, 904, 4279, 9547, 57277, 35293, 430, 279, 8331, 320, 87, 489, 220, 17, 8, 374, 3118, 304, 2225, 279, 64633, 323, 279, 48012, 13, 1226, 649, 9299, 433, 704, 1473, 2120, 489, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 696, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 62342, 1463, 279, 7645, 57277, 791, 7645, 374, 2736, 44899, 11, 439, 1070, 527, 912, 810, 4279, 9547, 311, 9299, 704, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 65647, 904, 20349, 477, 97354, 6429, 57277, 791, 48012, 320, 87, 482, 220, 17, 8, 706, 264, 14512, 520, 865, 284, 220, 17, 11, 2533, 279, 64633, 374, 539, 4613, 520, 865, 284, 220, 17, 13, 2684, 527, 912, 97354, 6429, 304, 420, 7645, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 9842, 279, 1620, 4320, 57277, 791, 44899, 7645, 374, 1473, 2120, 489, 220, 18, 25239, 87, 482, 220, 17, 696, 2028, 374, 279, 1620, 4320, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
