tone of an image.\n6. **Text and Shape Tools**: Photoshop allows users to add text and shapes to images, including customizable fonts, sizes, and styles.\n7. **Content-Aware Tools**: The software includes content-aware tools, such as the Content-Aware Fill and Content-Aware Move, to remove or move objects in an image while preserving the surrounding area.\n8. **3D Editing**: Photoshop offers basic 3D editing capabilities, including the ability to create and edit 3D models, as well as apply 3D effects to 2D images.\n9. **Collaboration and Sharing**: The software allows users to collaborate with others in real-time, share files, and export images in various formats.\n10. **Extensive Plug-in Support**: Photoshop has a vast library of third-party plug-ins and extensions available, which can add new features and functionality to the software.\n\nThese are just a few of the many features that Adobe Photoshop provides. Its versatility and range of tools make it a popular choice among graphic designers, photographers, and digital artists.', token_ids=[82705, 45979, 374, 264, 8147, 2217, 16039, 3241, 430, 5825, 264, 7029, 2134, 315, 4519, 311, 1520, 3932, 1893, 11, 4600, 11, 323, 37735, 7528, 5448, 13, 4427, 315, 279, 1401, 4519, 315, 29966, 45979, 2997, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1945, 62153, 14173, 96618, 45979, 6209, 264, 8205, 315, 7526, 311, 4600, 323, 37735, 5448, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 68420, 13782, 11, 64443, 13782, 11, 323, 28295, 1392, 19482, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 9368, 287, 96618, 45979, 6276, 3932, 311, 990, 449, 5361, 13931, 11, 28462, 1124, 311, 4600, 323, 37735, 2204, 5596, 315, 459, 2217, 29235, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 11425, 14173, 96618, 578, 3241, 5825, 5370, 6727, 7526, 11, 2737, 279, 2947, 17548, 13782, 11, 445, 29963, 13782, 11, 323, 15852, 70029, 11, 311, 3373, 3230, 5596, 315, 459, 2217, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 40882, 323, 46112, 96618, 45979, 6209, 264, 2134, 315, 6372, 323, 13711, 11, 1778, 439, 29613, 11, 57463, 11, 323, 50971, 11, 311, 18885, 477, 11857, 279, 11341, 315