Output~2025-04-24 17:31:33.902426: [RequestOutput(request_id=1552, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What is the major difference between TCP and UDP? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 374, 279, 3682, 6811, 1990, 27754, 323, 43494, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The major difference between TCP (Transmission Control Protocol) and UDP (User Datagram Protocol) is the way they handle data transmission and guarantee delivery.\n\nTCP is a connection-oriented protocol, which means that it establishes a connection with the destination device before sending data. It ensures that data is delivered in the correct order and reassembles it if packets are lost or corrupted during transmission. TCP also guarantees delivery, meaning that if a packet is lost or corrupted, it will be retransmitted. This makes TCP more reliable, but it also makes it slower and more resource-intensive.\n\nOn the other hand, UDP is a connectionless protocol, which means that it does not establish a connection with the destination device before sending data. UDP does not guarantee delivery, and it does not reassemble packets if they are lost or corrupted. However, UDP is faster and more lightweight than TCP, making it suitable for applications that require real-time communication, such as video streaming or online gaming.\n\nIn summary, the major difference between TCP and UDP is that TCP is a reliable, connection-oriented protocol that guarantees delivery, while UDP is an unreliable, connectionless protocol that is faster and more lightweight.', token_ids=[791, 3682, 6811, 1990, 27754, 320, 92301, 7935, 25590, 8, 323, 43494, 320, 1502, 97904, 25590, 8, 374, 279, 1648, 814, 3790, 828, 18874, 323, 15803, 9889, 382, 50996, 374, 264, 3717, 36185, 11766, 11, 902, 3445, 430, 433, 64664, 264, 3717, 449, 279, 9284, 3756, 1603, 11889, 828, 13, 1102, 26420, 430, 828, 374, 12886, 304, 279, 4495, 2015, 323, 312, 300, 41794, 433, 422, 28133, 527, 5675, 477, 50500, 2391, 18874, 13, 27754, 1101, 36755, 9889, 11, 7438, 430, 422, 264, 10361, 374, 5675, 477, 50500, 11, 433, 690, 387, 312, 1485, 5600, 13, 1115, 3727, 27754, 810, 15062, 11, 719, 433, 1101, 3727, 433, 29493, 323, 810, 5211, 88092, 382, 1966, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 43494, 374, 264, 3717, 1752, 11766, 11, 902, 3445, 430, 433, 1587, 539, 5813, 264, 3717, 449, 279, 9284, 3756, 1603, 11889, 828, 13, 43494, 1587, 539, 15803, 9889, 11, 323, 433, 1587, 539, 312, 70208, 28133, 422, 814, 527, 5675, 477, 50500, 13, 4452, 11, 43494, 374, 10819, 323, 810, 30244, 1109, 27754, 11, 3339, 433, 14791, 369, 8522, 430, 1397, 1972, 7394, 10758, 11, 1778, 439, 2835, 17265, 477, 2930, 16211, 382, 644, 12399, 11, 279, 3682, 6811, 1990, 27754, 323, 43494, 374, 430, 27754, 374, 264, 15062, 11, 3717, 36185, 11766, 430, 36755, 9889, 11, 1418, 43494, 374, 459, 67129, 11, 3717, 1752, 11766, 430, 374, 10819, 323, 810, 30244, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
