Output~2025-04-24 17:32:10.078466: [RequestOutput(request_id=1568, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Name 5 tips to write concise emails. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4076, 220, 20, 10631, 311, 3350, 64694, 14633, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are 5 tips to write concise emails:\n\n**Tip 1: Keep it Short and Sweet**\nKeep your email brief and to the point. Aim for a length of 100-150 words or less. This will help your reader quickly understand the purpose of your email and take action.\n\n**Tip 2: Use a Clear Subject Line**\nYour subject line should accurately summarize the content of your email and grab the reader\'s attention. Avoid using generic subject lines like "Meeting Request" or "Question". Instead, use something like "Meeting Request for Friday at 2 PM" or "Question about Upcoming Project Deadline".\n\n**Tip 3: Focus on One Main Point**\nTry to focus on one main point or topic per email. This will help you stay organized and ensure that your reader knows what you\'re asking or telling them. Avoid sending multiple requests or questions in a single email.\n\n**Tip 4: Use Bullet Points and White Space**\nUse bullet points and white space to make your email easy to read. Break up long blocks of text into shorter paragraphs and use bullet points to list out multiple items or steps. This will make your email look more visually appealing and easier to scan.\n\n**Tip 5: Edit Before Sending**\nBefore hitting send, take a few seconds to review your email for clarity and concision. Check for spelling and grammar errors, and make sure your message is clear and concise. You can also ask a colleague or friend to review your email before sending it to ensure it\'s effective and easy to understand.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 10631, 311, 3350, 64694, 14633, 1473, 334, 16394, 220, 16, 25, 13969, 433, 10928, 323, 27687, 1035, 19999, 701, 2613, 10015, 323, 311, 279, 1486, 13, 71715, 369, 264, 3160, 315, 220, 1041, 12, 3965, 4339, 477, 2753, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 701, 6742, 6288, 3619, 279, 7580, 315, 701, 2613, 323, 1935, 1957, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 17, 25, 5560, 264, 12292, 17908, 7228, 1035, 7927, 3917, 1584, 1288, 30357, 63179, 279, 2262, 315, 701, 2613, 323, 11894, 279, 6742, 596, 6666, 13, 35106, 1701, 14281, 3917, 5238, 1093, 330, 65676, 6274, 1, 477, 330, 14924, 3343, 12361, 11, 1005, 2555, 1093, 330, 65676, 6274, 369, 6740, 520, 220, 17, 5975, 1, 477, 330, 14924, 922, 3216, 5065, 5907, 63056, 11690, 334, 16394, 220, 18, 25, 26891, 389, 3861, 4802, 5236, 1035, 22170, 311, 5357, 389, 832, 1925, 1486, 477, 8712, 824, 2613, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 4822, 17057, 323, 6106, 430, 701, 6742, 8964, 1148, 499, 2351, 10371, 477, 11890, 1124, 13, 35106, 11889, 5361, 7540, 477, 4860, 304, 264, 3254, 2613, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 19, 25, 5560, 32912, 21387, 323, 5929, 11746, 1035, 10464, 17889, 3585, 323, 4251, 3634, 311, 1304, 701, 2613, 4228, 311, 1373, 13, 15996, 709, 1317, 10215, 315, 1495, 1139, 24210, 43743, 323, 1005, 17889, 3585, 311, 1160, 704, 5361, 3673, 477, 7504, 13, 1115, 690, 1304, 701, 2613, 1427, 810, 43395, 33352, 323, 8831, 311, 8737, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 20, 25, 8505, 13538, 58746, 1035, 10438, 20129, 3708, 11, 1935, 264, 2478, 6622, 311, 3477, 701, 2613, 369, 32373, 323, 3613, 1854, 13, 4343, 369, 43529, 323, 32528, 6103, 11, 323, 1304, 2771, 701, 1984, 374, 2867, 323, 64694, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 2610, 264, 37444, 477, 4333, 311, 3477, 701, 2613, 1603, 11889, 433, 311, 6106, 433,