Output~2025-04-24 17:33:05.559757: [RequestOutput(request_id=1584, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a positive experience at a restaurant. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 6928, 3217, 520, 264, 10960, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="I'd be delighted to share a positive experience I had at a restaurant!\n\nI recently had the pleasure of dining at a quaint little Italian restaurant in the heart of the city. As soon as I walked in, I was greeted with the warm aroma of freshly baked bread and the soft hum of lively chatter. The decor was cozy and intimate, with rustic wooden tables and vintage Italian posters adorning the walls.\n\nOur server, Maria, was attentive and friendly, taking the time to explain the daily specials and making recommendations. We started with a shared appetizer of bruschetta, which was simply divine. The toasted bread was crispy and flavorful, topped with a generous helping of creamy mozzarella, fresh tomatoes, and a drizzle of basil-infused olive oil.\n\nFor my main course, I opted for the spaghetti carbonara, which was cooked to perfection. The pasta was al dente, and the rich, creamy sauce was made with farm-fresh eggs and Parmesan cheese. My companion's chicken parmesan was also a hit, with a crispy breading and a side of tangy marinara sauce.\n\nThe real pièce de résistance, however, was the service. Maria checked in on us regularly, refilling our glasses of Pinot Grigio and ensuring that we had everything we needed. The atmosphere was lively but not loud, making it easy to carry on a conversation.\n\nAs we finished our meal and prepared to leave, Maria surprised us with a complimentary tiramisu, saying it was her favorite dessert and she wanted to share it with us. It was the perfect ending to a wonderful dining experience. We left feeling full and content, already planning our next visit to this charming little restaurant.", token_ids=[40, 4265, 387, 35072, 311, 4430, 264, 6928, 3217, 358, 1047, 520, 264, 10960, 2268, 40, 6051, 1047, 279, 17069, 315, 18397, 520, 264, 88608, 2697, 15155, 10960, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 3363, 13, 1666, 5246, 439, 358, 15203, 304, 11, 358, 574, 44865, 449, 279, 8369, 55279, 315, 50999, 41778, 16385, 323, 279, 8579, 2854, 315, 49277, 70457, 13, 578, 10799, 574, 43535, 323, 32487, 11, 449, 58372, 23162, 12920, 323, 24724, 15155, 39568, 1008, 80675, 279, 14620, 382, 8140, 3622, 11, 23880, 11, 574, 73898, 323, 11919, 11, 4737, 279, 892, 311, 10552, 279, 7446, 60874, 323, 3339, 19075, 13, 1226, 3940, 449, 264, 6222, 30168, 3213, 315, 1437, 52178, 27625, 11, 902, 574, 5042, 30467, 13, 578, 93972, 16385, 574, 73624, 323, 94631, 11, 40901, 449, 264, 28771, 10695, 315, 47985, 4647, 96982, 11, 7878, 41613, 11, 323, 264, 1377, 44237, 315, 68186, 48336, 2656, 33213, 5707, 382, 2520, 856, 1925, 3388, 11, 358, 41867, 369, 279, 88010, 12782, 5169, 11, 902, 574, 30205, 311, 39143, 13, 578, 37547, 574, 453, 294, 6960, 11, 323, 279, 9257, 11, 47985, 19737, 574, 1903, 449, 8961, 2269, 2548, 19335, 323, 56744, 63524, 17604, 13, 3092, 22489, 596, 16553, 1370, 9004, 276, 574, 1101, 264, 4295, 11, 449, 264, 73624, 293, 6285, 323, 264, 3185, 315, 22636, 88, 90215, 5169, 19737, 382, 791, 1972, 70477, 346, 409, 31807, 4011, 11, 4869, 11, 574, 279, 2532, 13, 23880, 10273, 304, 389, 603, 15870, 11, 2098, 9585, 1057, 29247, 315, 17929, 354, 2895, 343, 822, 323, 23391, 430, 584, 1047, 4395, 584, 4460, 13, 578, 16975, 574, 49277, 719, 539, 17813, 11, 