ment, learning to balance her emotions and her rational thinking. She is a beloved character in the novel, and her relationship with Mr. Darcy is one of the most iconic and enduring in literature.', token_ids=[10267, 757, 5268, 264, 3752, 505, 279, 11775, 43246, 323, 5075, 18631, 560, 555, 22195, 13222, 268, 382, 40, 4265, 1093, 311, 7664, 21393, 30880, 295, 11, 279, 2132, 74665, 315, 279, 4330, 30880, 295, 30393, 13, 21393, 374, 279, 46684, 315, 279, 11775, 323, 374, 3967, 369, 1077, 11478, 11, 38467, 11, 323, 3831, 5647, 315, 45651, 13, 3005, 374, 264, 6366, 3995, 5333, 449, 264, 49277, 323, 49277, 9090, 11, 889, 374, 539, 16984, 311, 6604, 1077, 4059, 323, 2559, 709, 369, 11937, 382, 67171, 2740, 11, 21393, 374, 7633, 439, 3515, 264, 330, 63157, 6548, 1, 323, 264, 330, 95928, 15648, 3343, 3005, 374, 1101, 7633, 439, 1694, 16615, 323, 73342, 11, 449, 264, 330, 63157, 91679, 1, 323, 330, 23449, 14198, 7013, 3343, 6385, 13444, 374, 539, 1120, 7106, 11, 719, 1101, 9358, 11, 439, 1364, 706, 264, 3169, 323, 60961, 4851, 382, 76637, 374, 264, 3831, 2695, 4473, 323, 9678, 3927, 889, 374, 539, 16984, 311, 8815, 59529, 40851, 323, 45593, 13, 3005, 374, 264, 837, 24364, 520, 4851, 11, 719, 1364, 374, 1101, 15325, 323, 25442, 11, 902, 3629, 11767, 1077, 311, 3488, 279, 52140, 315, 1884, 2212, 1077, 13, 6385, 17676, 38467, 323, 4062, 7422, 3629, 636, 1077, 704, 315, 34553, 15082, 11, 323, 1077, 3831, 5647, 315, 45651, 28292, 1077, 304, 1077, 12135, 323, 11429, 382, 60105, 279, 11775, 11, 21393, 37771, 288, 5199, 4443, 6650, 323, 4500, 11, 6975, 311, 8335, 1077, 21958, 323, 1077, 25442, 7422, 13, 3005, 374, 264, 28530, 3752, 304, 279, 11775, 11, 323, 1077, 5133, 449, 4491, 13, 423, 97479, 374, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 27373, 323, 52876, 304, 17649, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
