2: The United States and the United Kingdom launch Operation Torch, a campaign to capture North Africa from the Axis powers.\n* June 6, 1942: The United States and the United Kingdom launch Operation Barbarossa, a campaign to capture the Mediterranean island of Sicily.\n* August 19, 1942: The United States and the United Kingdom launch Operation Pedestal, a campaign to supply Malta with supplies.\n* November 8, 1942: The United States and the United Kingdom launch Operation Torch, a campaign to capture North Africa from the Axis powers.\n* December 11, 1942: The United States and the United Kingdom launch Operation Husky, a campaign to capture the Italian island of Sicily.\n\n**1944-1945: The Final Year of the War**\n\n* June 6, 1944: The Allied forces launch Operation Overlord, a campaign to capture Normandy, France, and begin the liberation of Western Europe.\n* July 20, 1944: German officers attempt to assassinate Adolf Hitler, but he survives.\n* August 6 and 9, ", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 25845, 315, 279, 1925, 4455, 304, 4435, 5111, 8105, 1473, 334, 7285, 24, 12, 6393, 16, 25, 578, 4470, 9137, 315, 5111, 57277, 9, 6250, 220, 16, 11, 220, 7285, 24, 25, 10057, 11, 6197, 555, 90585, 31654, 11, 1558, 3536, 28702, 11, 50745, 279, 3723, 15422, 323, 9822, 311, 16292, 4208, 627, 9, 6250, 220, 1114, 11, 220, 7285, 24, 25, 19953, 9323, 1558, 3536, 28702, 505, 279, 11226, 11, 6522, 311, 279, 19953, 9323, 596, 20852, 304, 279, 4208, 627, 9, 3297, 220, 605, 11, 220, 6393, 15, 25, 10057, 38175, 264, 13051, 3440, 389, 9822, 11, 34061, 11, 279, 26746, 11, 323, 65971, 11, 3967, 439, 279, 16506, 315, 9822, 627, 9, 5651, 220, 605, 11, 220, 6393, 15, 25, 15704, 50888, 4208, 389, 9822, 323, 279, 3723, 15422, 627, 9, 5887, 220, 605, 11, 220, 6393, 15, 25, 10057, 12302, 279, 16506, 315, 13527, 11, 264, 4901, 311, 8895, 3805, 66732, 927, 279, 3723, 15422, 627, 9, 6250, 220, 22, 11, 220, 6393, 15, 25, 578, 3723, 4273, 88381, 459, 48702, 389, 5707, 13086, 311, 6457, 304, 2077, 311, 1