 minutes or until they are tender and lightly caramelized.\n4. In a separate bowl, toss the broccoli florets with the remaining 1 tablespoon of olive oil, salt, and pepper. Spread the broccoli on a separate baking sheet and roast for 15-20 minutes or until tender and slightly browned.\n5. To make the lemon-tahini sauce, combine the tahini, lemon juice, water, garlic, and salt in a blender or food processor. Blend until smooth and creamy, adding more water if needed to achieve the desired consistency. With the blender or food processor running, slowly pour in the olive oil through the top. Season with salt to taste.\n6. To assemble the quinoa bowls, divide the cooked quinoa among bowls. Top with the roasted sweet potatoes, bell pepper, onion, and broccoli. Drizzle the lemon-tahini sauce over the top and sprinkle with chopped', token_ids=[334, 29880, 25, 12093, 15386, 95392, 3489, 80094, 20904, 449, 52310, 9469, 1494, 6729, 61276, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 2520, 279, 934, 80094, 1473, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 934, 80094, 11, 97139, 291, 323, 61508, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 3090, 477, 36581, 45993, 198, 9, 220, 16, 62611, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 11, 311, 12945, 271, 2520, 279, 54662, 24822, 1473, 9, 220, 17, 3544, 10437, 35267, 11, 83612, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 2579, 29519, 25349, 11, 90916, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 2579, 38427, 11, 83612, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 17, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 79276, 9943, 76430, 198, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 30260, 88621, 11, 38525, 320, 13099, 696, 2520, 279, 30564, 2442, 1494, 6729, 19737, 1473, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 91193, 6729, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 50999, 65262, 30564, 23661, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 3090, 198, 9, 220, 16, 5405, 588, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 12290, 198, 9, 220, 18, 56588, 33213, 5707, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 