Output~2025-04-24 17:37:18.401331: [RequestOutput(request_id=1664, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a short story revolving around a young woman and the power of suggestion. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 2875, 3446, 87126, 2212, 264, 3995, 5333, 323, 279, 2410, 315, 24710, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a short story revolving around a young woman and the power of suggestion:\n\n---\n\nLena had always been fascinated by the world of hypnosis. She had read books on the subject, watched documentaries, and even attended a few seminars. But it wasn't until she stumbled upon a mysterious flyer for a hypnosis workshop in a small town that she decided to take the plunge and sign up.\n\nThe workshop was led by a charismatic instructor named Dr. Lee, who claimed to have the ability to induce deep trance states in his subjects. Lena was skeptical, but she was also curious. She arrived at the workshop feeling a mix of excitement and trepidation.\n\nAs the class began, Dr. Lee led the group through a series of exercises designed to relax and focus their minds. Lena felt her eyelids growing heavy, her breathing slowing, and her thoughts becoming more distant. She was surprised to find that she was actually feeling a sense of calm wash over her.\n\nNext, Dr. Lee began to make suggestions. He told the group that they were all feeling a sense of weightlessness, that their bodies were floating above the ground. Lena felt a strange sensation, as if she were indeed floating. She looked around the room, half-expecting to see the others floating as well, but they all seemed to be sitting normally.\n\nThe next suggestion was that they were all feeling a sense of confidence and self-assurance. Dr. Lee told them that they were capable of achieving anything they set their minds to, that they were worthy and deserving of success. Lena felt a surge of energy and motivation. She looked around the room, and this time she saw that the others were all smiling, their eyes shining with a newfound sense of purpose.\n\nAs the workshop came to a close, Lena felt changed. She felt lighter, freer, and more confident than she had in years. She left the workshop feeling like she could conquer the world.\n\nOver the next few weeks, Lena found that the effects of the workshop were lasting. She was more outgoing, more assertive, and more successful in her personal and professional life. She began to realize that the power of suggestion was not just a trick of the mind, but a real and tangible force that could be harnessed and wielded.\n\nAs she looked back on the workshop, Lena realized that Dr. Lee had not just hypnotized her, but had awakened a part of her that had been dormant for years. She felt grateful for the experience, and she knew that she would never forget the power of suggestion", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2875, 3446, 87126, 2212, 264, 3995, 5333, 323, 279, 2410, 315, 24710, 1473, 45464, 43, 7304, 1047, 2744, 1027, 61914, 555, 279, 1917, 315, 9950, 76205, 13, 3005, 1047, 1373, 6603, 389, 279, 3917, 11, 15746, 88466, 11, 323, 1524, 18677, 264, 2478, 68569, 13, 2030, 433, 5828, 956, 3156, 1364, 50157, 5304, 264, 26454, 76006, 369, 264, 9950, 76205, 26129, 304, 264, 2678, 6424, 430, 1364, 6773, 311, 1935, 279, 67678, 323, 1879, 709, 382, 791, 26129, 574, 6197, 555, 264, 79323, 33315, 7086, 2999, 13, 12336, 11, 889, 11922, 311, 617, 279, 5845, 311, 49853, 5655, 98531, 5415, 304, 813, 15223, 13, 8216