g students.\n2. **Comfortable Seating**: Provide comfortable seating options such as bean bags, pillows, or standing desks to allow students to choose how they want to sit and learn. This can help to reduce distractions and improve focus.\n3. **Calming Colors**: Use calming colors such as blue, green, or yellow on walls, furniture, and decorations to create a soothing atmosphere. This can help to reduce stress and anxiety among students.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 1403, 6848, 449, 2380, 3649, 1855, 389, 1268, 311, 7417, 279, 24978, 4676, 1473, 334, 40, 56188, 220, 16, 25, 54804, 349, 12053, 311, 29757, 685, 60463, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 72786, 5929, 19826, 96618, 19796, 21416, 4251, 19826, 430, 2187, 4236, 311, 16988, 449, 16627, 2262, 304, 264, 810, 21416, 323, 65280, 1648, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 3953, 11, 47590, 11, 323, 57613, 38480, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 34126, 8771, 12639, 1725, 96618, 5560, 4200, 8903, 320, 19330, 8, 477, 57088, 8903, 320, 946, 8, 5557, 311, 1935, 4236, 389, 4200, 2115, 23277, 311, 7634, 814, 1253, 539, 387, 3025, 311, 4034, 304, 1732, 13, 1115, 649, 1520, 311, 1304, 6975, 810, 23387, 323, 21416, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 15623, 4422, 1413, 14173, 96618, 10377, 553, 40806, 7526, 1778, 439, 5195, 77129, 477, 5210, 40713, 311, 28696, 1912, 990, 323, 10758, 4315, 4236, 13, 1115, 649, 1520, 311, 12192, 84633, 323, 20632, 11, 323, 1304, 433, 8831, 369, 4236, 311, 990, 3871, 389, 7224, 382, 334, 40, 56188, 220, 17, 25, 4324, 264, 3400, 5424, 323, 19337, 5977, 54928, 8182, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 55381, 8828, 96618, 54804, 349, 5933, 3177, 1139, 279, 24978, 555, 25012, 76915, 3221, 11276, 477, 1701, 1940, 4010, 2866, 13, 1115, 649, 1520, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 19858, 323, 1664, 33851, 4315, 4236, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 95417, 481, 1369, 1113, 96618, 40665, 10882, 38399, 2671, 1778, 439, 21059, 18381, 11, 67026, 11, 477, 11509, 76915, 311, 2187, 4236, 311, 5268, 1268, 814, 1390, 311, 2503, 323, 4048, 13, 1115, 649, 1520, 311, 8108, 77549, 323, 7417, 5357, 627, 18, 13, 31