Output~2025-04-24 17:39:37.954203: [RequestOutput(request_id=1705, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Tell me a story about a family who goes on a summer road trip. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 25672, 757, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 3070, 889, 5900, 389, 264, 7474, 5754, 8577, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='It was the last day of school, and the Smith family was beyond excited to embark on their annual summer road trip. The kids, Jack and Lily, had been counting down the days for what felt like forever. Their parents, Mark and Sarah, had planned a two-week adventure to the Grand Canyon, Yellowstone, and Yosemite National Parks.\n\nAs they packed up the car, the kids couldn\'t contain their excitement. They had spent hours poring over the maps and guidebooks, planning their itinerary and making lists of all the things they wanted to see and do. Mark and Sarah had promised them a mix of outdoor adventures, cultural experiences, and relaxation time, and the kids were eager to get started.\n\nAs they hit the open road, the family settled in for the long drive. Jack, who was 12, claimed the backseat and spent the first few hours playing video games on his tablet. Lily, who was 9, was content to gaze out the window, watching the scenery roll by. Sarah and Mark took turns driving and chatting with the kids, sharing stories and singing along to their favorite songs.\n\nAfter a few hours, they stopped for lunch at a quirky roadside diner, where they feasted on burgers and milkshakes. The kids ran around outside, burning off energy and making new friends with the other kids at the diner. As they continued on their journey, the landscape shifted from rolling hills to towering mountains and finally, to the vast expanse of the American West.\n\nThe next few days were a blur of hiking, camping, and exploring. They marveled at the Grand Canyon\'s breathtaking vistas, watched Old Faithful erupt at Yellowstone, and hiked to the top of Yosemite\'s Half Dome. The kids loved every minute of it, and Mark and Sarah were thrilled to see them so happy and engaged.\n\nOne evening, as they sat around the campfire, roasting marshmallows and swapping stories, Jack turned to his parents and said, "This has been the best summer ever. I\'m so glad we did this." Lily nodded in agreement, her eyes shining with excitement. Mark and Sarah exchanged a look, feeling grateful for the opportunity to create these memories with their children.\n\nAs they settled in for the night, the stars twinkling above, the Smith family knew that this summer road trip would be one they would never forget.', token_ids=[2181, 574, 279, 1566, 1938, 315, 2978, 11, 323, 279, 9259, 3070, 574, 7953, 12304, 311, 70531, 389, 872, 9974, 7474, 5754, 8577, 13, 578, 6980, 11, 7762, 323, 48390, 11, 1047, 1027, 26060, 1523, 279, 2919, 369, 1148, 6612, 1093, 16058, 13, 11205, 6699, 11, 4488, 323, 21077, 11, 1047, 13205, 264, 1403, 30609, 18427, 311, 279, 10517, 41560, 11, 96179, 11, 323, 95927, 5165, 39272, 382, 2170, 814, 19937, 709, 279, 1841, 11, 279, 6980, 7846, 956, 6782, 872, 28361, 13, 2435, 1047, 7543, 4207, 4247, 287, 927, 279, 14370, 323, 8641, 12383, 11, 9293, 872, 74004, 323, 3339, 11725, 315, 682, 279, 2574, 814, 4934, 311, 1518, 323, 656, 13, 4488, 323, 21077, 1047, 19487, 1124, 264, 6651, 315, 16166, 32078, 11, 13042, 11704, 11, 323, 43685, 892, 11, 323, 279, 6980, 1051, 24450, 311, 636, 3940, 382, 2170, 814, 4295, 279, 1825, 5754, 11, 279, 3070, 23183, 304