:\n\n1. **Report the theft to the authorities**: If the theft is severe and has a significant impact on the workplace, it may be necessary to report it to the authorities. This could involve filing a police report, reporting it to HR, or speaking with a supervisor or manager.\n2. **Confront the friend**: If the woman feels comfortable doing so, she could try to have an open and honest conversation with her friend about the theft. This could help to clear the air and potentially resolve the issue.\n3. **Seek support**: The woman may want to seek support from a trusted colleague, supervisor, or counselor to help her navigate this difficult situation.\n4. **Take a break from the friendship**: If the woman feels that the friendship is no longer healthy or sustainable, she may need to take a break from the friendship or re-evaluate the relationship.\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nUltimately, the decision to report the theft or not will depend on the specific circumstances and the woman's personal values and priorities. It's essential to consider the potential consequences of each course of action and prioritize the well-being of the workplace and the people involved.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 5107, 323, 16614, 6671, 2268, 334, 6475, 61399, 57277, 5451, 398, 11, 358, 1390, 311, 25670, 430, 420, 374, 264, 17436, 323, 6485, 31308, 55867, 13, 1952, 832, 1450, 11, 279, 5333, 706, 264, 5655, 4443, 3717, 449, 1077, 1888, 4333, 11, 902, 3727, 433, 2653, 311, 64508, 279, 68376, 13, 1952, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 39098, 374, 264, 6129, 17193, 430, 649, 617, 5199, 16296, 369, 279, 27465, 323, 279, 1274, 6532, 382, 334, 1622, 24271, 57277, 10438, 3339, 264, 5597, 11, 358, 1053, 2610, 7182, 1473, 16, 13, 2209, 279, 39098, 264, 832, 7394, 16930, 477, 264, 46350, 7865, 5380, 17, 13, 2650, 15748, 374, 279, 5536, 315, 279, 28483, 389, 279, 27465, 323, 279, 1274, 6532, 5380, 18, 13, 3639, 527, 279, 4754, 16296, 315, 13122, 279, 28483, 11, 323, 1148, 527, 279, 4754, 16296, 315, 539, 13122, 433, 5380, 19, 