er Soup**: Roast chicken breast and sliced peppers in the oven with some olive oil, garlic, and your favorite herbs. Then, blend the mixture with chicken broth and cream for a creamy, comforting soup.\n\nThese are just a few ideas to get you started. I hope you enjoy experimenting with these ingredients and creating your own delicious dishes!', token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 10824, 315, 14293, 2268, 8586, 527, 1063, 18406, 12269, 18726, 3196, 389, 16553, 11, 58573, 11, 323, 31735, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 84963, 435, 1662, 21920, 96618, 328, 94943, 89964, 16553, 17659, 449, 48715, 58573, 320, 3852, 1933, 8, 323, 94927, 31735, 11, 10434, 449, 8369, 20415, 477, 14095, 16831, 34344, 11, 20897, 12932, 11, 323, 74314, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 45030, 416, 34619, 65292, 7424, 894, 96618, 65292, 2269, 894, 89964, 16553, 17659, 449, 48715, 58573, 320, 17696, 477, 4106, 8, 323, 94927, 31735, 11, 10434, 927, 20228, 477, 61260, 13, 2758, 29839, 19737, 323, 701, 7075, 23935, 2269, 894, 19737, 369, 5066, 17615, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 84963, 323, 52882, 4923, 365, 388, 96618, 2947, 3357, 16553, 17659, 323, 29519, 25349, 27855, 304, 33213, 5707, 11, 31735, 11, 323, 701, 7075, 3280, 826, 11, 1243, 40158, 477, 23360, 3156, 30205, 1555, 13, 54032, 449, 264, 3185, 315, 934, 80094, 477, 27812, 66, 788, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 84963, 323, 95825, 1229, 1157, 329, 6374, 96618, 1443, 1171, 477, 48094, 30205, 16553, 17659, 323, 829, 332, 978, 433, 449, 94927, 31735, 11, 1243, 6392, 433, 4871, 264, 16831, 6374, 449, 75220, 17604, 323, 48715, 58573, 13, 12797, 304, 264, 79085, 3156, 279, 17604, 374, 50459, 323, 279, 16831, 6374, 374, 73624, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 39972, 15386, 34619, 323, 52882, 61434, 96618, 12093, 561, 16553, 17659, 323, 48715, 58573, 304, 279, 24276, 449, 1063, 33213, 5707, 11, 31735, 11, 323, 701, 7075, 42393, 13, 5112, 11, 20955, 279, 21655, 449, 16553, 45993, 323, 12932, 369, 264, 47985, 11, 69130, 19724, 382, 9673, 527, 1120, 264, 2478, 6848, 311, 636, 499, 3940, 13, 358, 3987, 499, 4774, 60257, 