activities. This may include group projects, presentations, or hands-on learning experiences. Some schools may also have special programs or clubs, such as debate team, robotics, or volunteer work, which take place during this time.\n\nThe school day usually wraps up around 2:30-3:30 pm, depending on the school's schedule. Students then head home, where they may have homework or extracurricular activities to attend to. Overall, a typical school day is a mix of learning, socializing, and personal growth, with a balance of structured instruction and free time.", token_ids=[32, 14595, 2978, 1938, 6118, 8638, 4216, 304, 279, 6693, 11, 2212, 220, 23, 25, 410, 477, 220, 24, 25, 410, 1097, 11, 11911, 389, 279, 2978, 596, 9899, 13, 20783, 11383, 3240, 555, 33111, 520, 2978, 11, 26156, 1022, 872, 34236, 82, 323, 16163, 22995, 304, 872, 5409, 388, 11, 323, 1243, 14836, 311, 872, 1176, 538, 315, 279, 1938, 382, 791, 1176, 4261, 374, 6118, 264, 6332, 3917, 1093, 7033, 11, 4221, 19071, 11, 477, 8198, 11, 1405, 4236, 4048, 502, 19476, 323, 7512, 13, 578, 11326, 18911, 279, 18228, 11, 323, 4236, 1935, 8554, 11, 2610, 4860, 11, 323, 16136, 304, 20954, 13, 1115, 374, 8272, 555, 264, 2875, 1464, 11, 6118, 2212, 220, 868, 12, 508, 4520, 11, 1405, 4236, 649, 11894, 264, 40459, 11, 6369, 449, 4885, 11, 477, 656, 1063, 4062, 29559, 382, 791, 1828, 2478, 18852, 11383, 6824, 315, 810, 6332, 15223, 11, 1778, 439, 3674, 7978, 11, 7362, 4221, 11, 477, 4135, 1924, 1093, 4731, 477, 1989, 13, 20783, 1253, 1101, 617, 264, 7106, 6873, 538, 11, 1405, 814, 16136, 304, 10034, 11, 3953, 11, 477, 17479, 7640, 382, 1688, 16163, 1712, 11, 4236, 2010, 311, 279, 94948, 311, 11894, 264, 23556, 311, 8343, 323, 3674, 553, 449, 4885, 13, 578, 94948, 6118, 6209, 264, 8205, 315, 3691, 2671, 11, 1778, 439, 23317, 11, 57758, 11, 77852, 11, 323, 43402, 13, 20783, 649, 1101, 4546, 872, 1866, 16163, 505, 2162, 382, 6153, 16163, 11, 4236, 471, 311, 872, 58216, 369, 810, 7754, 323, 7640, 13, 1115, 1253, 2997, 1912, 722