Recycling paper, plastic, glass, and metal\n* Composting food waste and yard trimmings to create nutrient-rich soil\n\nBy following the principles of reduce, reuse, and recycle, individuals can make a significant impact on reducing waste and promoting a more sustainable future.', token_ids=[791, 4751, 330, 27369, 11, 27068, 11, 61843, 1, 374, 264, 5526, 12434, 52637, 430, 37167, 7931, 311, 11142, 22556, 12659, 311, 30437, 12571, 323, 78548, 5933, 5070, 13, 1102, 374, 264, 4382, 3686, 7524, 1648, 311, 8108, 279, 3392, 315, 23701, 430, 10548, 709, 304, 4363, 67267, 323, 54280, 382, 1, 51425, 1, 19813, 311, 279, 1180, 315, 77391, 279, 3392, 315, 12571, 8066, 304, 279, 1176, 2035, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 17427, 555, 1473, 9, 55409, 304, 20155, 311, 8108, 24066, 12571, 198, 9, 77351, 3956, 449, 17832, 477, 6160, 536, 78130, 24066, 198, 9, 35106, 287, 3254, 25700, 68386, 323, 44890, 3673, 198, 9, 3816, 59144, 4907, 15652, 323, 3090, 10648, 271, 1, 39181, 1, 3445, 9455, 502, 5829, 369, 3673, 430, 1053, 6062, 387, 15338, 3201, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 1473, 9, 3402, 324, 8478, 2362, 3673, 11, 1778, 439, 13353, 459, 2362, 259, 34768, 1139, 264, 62671, 9145, 198, 9, 4418, 1113, 30373, 1511, 3673, 311, 23693, 477, 11486, 1124, 1555, 2930, 3157, 27170, 198, 9, 12362, 62671, 24794, 11, 18381, 11, 323, 3090, 27474, 4619, 315, 44890, 6305, 271, 1, 3905, 5566, 1, 18065, 34537, 12571, 1139, 502, 3956, 11, 18189, 279, 1205, 369, 7257, 7384, 323, 279, 3392, 315, 12571, 3288, 311, 4363, 67267, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 2884, 555, 1473, 9, 44581, 1113, 304, 2917, 1302, 579, 34978, 7620, 477, 6068, 12744, 34978, 19169, 198, 9, 81685, 5684, 11, 12466, 11, 9168, 11, 323, 9501, 198, 9, 1219, 65664, 3691, 12571, 323, 20085, 11259, 76, 826, 311, 1893, 50123, 41947, 17614, 271, 1383, 2768, 279, 16565, 315, 8108, 11, 27068, 11, 323, 61843, 11, 7931, 649, 1304, 264, 5199, 5536, 389, 18189, 12571, 323, 22923, 264, 810, 22556, 3938, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_r