lumn is used to separate a mixture of liquids based on their boiling points. It is commonly used to separate azeotropic mixtures, which are mixtures that cannot be separated by other methods.\n\n**Question 4:** What is the role of catalysts in chemical reactions?\n\n**Answer:** Catalysts are substances that speed up chemical reactions without being consumed or altered in the process. They work by lowering the activation energy required for a reaction to occur, allowing the reaction to proceed faster and more efficiently.\n\n**Question 5:** What is the importance of safety in chemical engineering?\n\n**Answer:** Safety is crucial in chemical engineering as it involves handling hazardous materials and equipment. Chemical engineers must design and operate processes that minimize the risk of accidents, ensure proper ventilation and containment of hazardous materials, and follow strict safety protocols to prevent injuries and environmental damage.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 4860, 323, 12435, 11503, 922, 36424, 17005, 1473, 334, 14924, 220, 16, 68063, 3639, 374, 279, 6156, 734, 315, 264, 11742, 24490, 304, 264, 15266, 1920, 1980, 334, 16533, 68063, 362, 11742, 24490, 596, 6156, 734, 374, 311, 2955, 11, 2274, 11, 323, 30536, 279, 15266, 1920, 311, 8356, 264, 2027, 30820, 323, 21676, 11, 1418, 1101, 23391, 8907, 449, 12434, 323, 7296, 14640, 382, 334, 14924, 220, 17, 68063, 3639, 374, 279, 6811, 1990, 264, 7309, 1920, 323, 264, 19815, 1920, 304, 11742, 15009, 1980, 334, 16533, 68063, 362, 7309, 1920, 18065, 8863, 264, 8521, 12472, 315, 3769, 304, 264, 3254, 7309, 11, 20444, 264, 19815, 1920, 18065, 8863, 264, 19815, 6530, 315, 3769, 13, 35004, 11618, 527, 3629, 1511, 369, 2678, 13230, 5788, 11, 1418, 19815, 11618, 527, 1511, 369, 3544, 13230, 5788, 382, 334, 14924, 220, 18, 68063, 3639, 374, 279, 7580, 315, 264, 1612, 67184, 3330, 304, 264, 11742, 6136, 1980, 334, 16533, 68063, 362, 1612, 67184, 3330, 374, 1511, 311, 8821, 264, 21655, 315, 67849, 3196, 389, 872, 50937