velopment of certain conditions such as sepsis or pneumonia. This information can be used to identify high-risk patients and provide targeted interventions to prevent complications, improving patient outcomes and reducing healthcare costs. Additionally, AI can help identify patterns and trends in patient data that may not be apparent to human analysts, allowing healthcare providers to develop more effective treatment strategies.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 1403, 10507, 315, 1268, 59294, 22107, 320, 15836, 8, 374, 1511, 304, 279, 18985, 5064, 1473, 334, 13617, 220, 16, 25, 13235, 65606, 18825, 57277, 9470, 16895, 22107, 374, 1694, 1511, 311, 24564, 6593, 5448, 1778, 439, 1630, 82817, 11, 19084, 43739, 11, 323, 52460, 43739, 311, 1520, 16410, 58681, 19338, 810, 30357, 323, 6288, 13, 1789, 2937, 11, 15592, 41503, 26249, 649, 387, 16572, 311, 10765, 75815, 304, 6593, 5448, 11, 1778, 439, 56071, 11, 78332, 11, 323, 1023, 4787, 11, 10923, 16410, 311, 1304, 810, 16369, 11429, 922, 8893, 6514, 13, 1115, 5557, 706, 1027, 6982, 311, 7417, 15439, 13708, 555, 709, 311, 220, 1954, 4, 7863, 311, 3823, 12164, 22012, 13, 23212, 11, 15592, 649, 1520, 8108, 279, 892, 433, 5097, 311, 24564, 6593, 5448, 11, 10923, 16410, 311, 3493, 10819, 6514, 311, 6978, 382, 334, 13617, 220, 17, 25, 33810, 535, 33527, 369, 30024, 4470, 6716, 57277, 9470, 16895, 22107, 374, 1101, 1694, 1511, 311, 24564, 3544, 15055, 315, 8893, 828, 311, 7168, 8893, 20124, 323, 5471, 36505, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 15592, 26249, 649, 24564, 264, 8893, 596, 6593, 3925, 11, 10278, 3135, 11, 323, 1023, 828, 311, 7168, 279, 29736, 315, 1373, 2796, 311, 279, 8952, 477, 279, 4500, 315, 3738, 4787, 1778, 439, 513, 1725, 285, 477, 69329, 13, 1115, 2038, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 10765, 1579, 46570, 6978, 323, 3493, 17550, 39455, 311, 5471, 36505, 11, 18899, 8893, 20124, 323, 18189, 18985, 7194, 13, 23212, 11, 15592, 649, 1520, 10765, 12912, 323, 18845, 304, 8893, 828, 430, 1253, 539, 387, 10186, 311, 3823, 31499, 11, 10923, 18985, 12850, 31