 enjoy!\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n* Use your favorite vegetables or add other options like mushrooms, zucchini, or snow peas to the stir-fry.\n* For an extra kick, add some red pepper flakes or sriracha to the sauce.\n* Serve with a sprinkle of sesame seeds or chopped green onions for added flavor and texture.\n* Make it a meal by adding cooked protein like chicken, beef, or tofu to the stir-fry.\n\nEnjoy your delicious and healthy vegetable stir-fry!', token_ids=[334, 16939, 9824, 95392, 65292, 7424, 894, 26371, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 1274, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 36581, 5707, 198, 9, 220, 16, 38427, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 2579, 29519, 25349, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14071, 29519, 25349, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 79276, 9943, 76430, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 62517, 11, 83612, 323, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 10885, 47136, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 29839, 19737, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 297, 22604, 19737, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 12797, 291, 20228, 477, 61260, 11, 369, 13788, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 27162, 279, 36581, 5707, 304, 264, 3544, 79085, 477, 289, 564, 927, 11298, 28661, 8798, 627, 17, 13, 2758, 279, 48715, 38427, 323, 4394, 369, 220, 17, 12, 18, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 433, 8638, 311, 81045, 627, 18, 13, 2758, 279, 94927, 31735, 323, 4394, 369, 459, 5217, 220, 16, 9568, 11, 55054, 15320, 311, 5471, 20252, 627, 19, 13, 2758, 279, 48715, 2579, 323, 14071, 29519, 58573, 323, 4394, 369, 220, 18, 12, 19, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 814, 1212, 311, 28682, 553, 627, 20, 13, 2758, 279, 79276, 11, 62517, 11, 323, 10885, 47136, 311, 279, 79085, 13, 12797, 369, 220, 19, 12, 20, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 24822, 527, 28682, 1824, 6091, 79, 627, 21, 13, 763, 264, 2678, 19763, 11, 41759, 3871, 279, 29839, 19737, 323, 297, 22604, 19737, 320, 333, 1701, 570, 27058, 279, 19737, 927, 279, 24822, 323, 23935, 311, 16343, 627, 