 In a large cast-iron pot or Dutch oven, heat the oil over medium heat. Add the flour and whisk until it forms a smooth paste. Cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring constantly, until the roux is dark brown and has a nutty aroma.\n2. **Add the aromatics:** Add the chopped onion, celery, garlic, bell pepper, thyme, oregano, cayenne pepper, and paprika to the pot. Cook until the vegetables are softened, about 5 minutes.\n3. **Add the meat and seafood:** Add the sliced sausage, chicken, shrimp, and crab meat to the pot. Cook until the meat is browned, about 5-7 minutes.\n4. **Add the okra:** Add the sliced ok", token_ids=[56, 65948, 11, 358, 2846, 6380, 311, 3493, 499, 449, 264, 11363, 369, 264, 18406, 42365, 754, 0, 480, 49709, 374, 264, 11670, 29974, 12269, 430, 596, 264, 50056, 315, 7948, 1286, 323, 96879, 359, 36105, 13, 1102, 596, 264, 82651, 11, 94631, 61443, 1903, 449, 264, 10824, 315, 14293, 1093, 5509, 969, 11, 20228, 11, 323, 264, 8205, 315, 63875, 323, 53405, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 11363, 430, 17482, 220, 19, 12, 21, 1274, 1473, 334, 38, 49709, 26371, 57277, 334, 7979, 266, 323, 15379, 14239, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 31123, 323, 283, 4618, 59986, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 31123, 17685, 1752, 11, 6930, 1752, 16553, 60611, 11, 4018, 1139, 23556, 28935, 9863, 198, 9, 220, 16, 31123, 56626, 11, 83612, 323, 37244, 1619, 198, 9, 220, 16, 31123, 60512, 13339, 320, 73, 49709, 49629, 477, 57590, 13339, 340, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 36581, 5707, 271, 334, 32, 442, 29470, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 38427, 11, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 18, 55972, 82, 70121, 11, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 18, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 29519, 25349, 11, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 32720, 270, 31218, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 32720, 297, 1610, 5770, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 272, 352, 26193, 25349, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 26365, 41554, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 271, 334, 11839, 969, 323, 29622, 87, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 5509, 969, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 1