ds of social responsibility. The company has also been recognized for its commitment to diversity and inclusion, with a diverse workforce and a strong focus on promoting diversity and inclusion in the outdoor industry.\n\nOverall, Patagonia is a great example of a company that gives back to the community through its environmental activism, community grants, and commitment to social responsibility.', token_ids=[32, 2294, 3187, 315, 264, 2883, 430, 6835, 1203, 311, 279, 4029, 374, 7281, 6241, 689, 11, 264, 16166, 55425, 2883, 13, 7281, 6241, 689, 374, 3967, 369, 1202, 12434, 55280, 323, 15507, 311, 13166, 3674, 12014, 13, 578, 2883, 706, 264, 3831, 5357, 389, 12434, 41329, 323, 706, 11798, 5370, 28271, 311, 8108, 1202, 12434, 5536, 382, 4054, 1648, 7281, 6241, 689, 6835, 1203, 311, 279, 4029, 374, 1555, 1202, 12434, 25076, 2068, 11, 902, 5825, 11006, 311, 12434, 11351, 323, 28271, 430, 5398, 449, 279, 2883, 596, 2819, 13, 8876, 220, 3753, 20, 11, 7281, 6241, 689, 706, 34468, 927, 400, 4578, 3610, 311, 12434, 11351, 323, 28271, 11, 2737, 279, 36903, 10349, 11, 279, 22037, 20650, 6709, 11, 323, 279, 8242, 1658, 1814, 5114, 382, 28205, 6241, 689, 1101, 706, 264, 2068, 2663, 330, 54, 1540, 42162, 1359, 902, 37167, 6444, 311, 13023, 323, 27068, 872, 7281, 6241, 689, 3956, 4619, 315, 2624, 29510, 1124, 13, 578, 2883, 706, 1101, 11798, 264, 34978, 2068, 369, 1202, 2362, 3956, 11, 902, 8779, 311, 8108, 12571, 323, 78548, 5933, 5070, 382, 644, 5369, 11, 7281, 6241, 689, 706, 264, 3831, 15507, 311, 6762, 9511, 12659, 323, 706, 11798, 10396, 311, 6106, 430, 1202, 20972, 49553, 311, 1579, 10886, 315, 3674, 12014, 13, 578, 2883, 706, 1101, 1027, 15324, 369, 1202, 15507, 311, 20057, 323, 28286, 11, 449, 264, 17226, 32027, 323, 264, 3831, 5357, 389, 22923, 20057, 323, 28286, 304, 279, 16166, 5064, 382, 28589, 11, 7281, 6241, 689, 374, 264, 2294, 3187, 315, 264, 2883, 430, 6835, 1203, 311, 279, 4029, 1555, 1202, 12434, 55280, 11, 4029, 25076, 11, 323, 15507, 311, 3674, 12014, 13, 128