3 ± √3\n\nNow, we can find the value of ab for each solution:\n\nCase 1: a = 3 + √3\nab = (3 + √3)(3 - √3) = 9 - 3 = 6\n\nCase 2: a = 3 - √3\nab = (3 - √3)(3 + √3) = 9 - 3 = 6\n\nIn both cases, we get:\n\nab = 6\n\n', token_ids=[32, 6555, 47976, 3575, 2268, 1687, 527, 2728, 1403, 39006, 1473, 16, 8, 264, 489, 293, 284, 220, 18, 2564, 320, 25523, 367, 220, 16, 340, 17, 8, 264, 61, 18, 489, 293, 61, 18, 284, 220, 5932, 2564, 320, 25523, 367, 220, 17, 696, 1687, 649, 1212, 555, 24050, 279, 24671, 315, 264, 323, 293, 304, 85770, 220, 17, 1473, 64, 61, 18, 489, 293, 61, 18, 284, 320, 64, 489, 293, 2432, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 696, 7184, 11, 28779, 85770, 220, 16, 1139, 420, 17626, 1376, 1473, 7, 18, 2432, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 8, 284, 220, 5932, 271, 50, 71306, 279, 24524, 1473, 18, 64, 61, 17, 482, 220, 18, 370, 489, 220, 18, 65, 61, 17, 284, 220, 5932, 271, 12792, 579, 2225, 11314, 555, 220, 18, 1473, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 284, 220, 1544, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 1456, 311, 8331, 279, 80251, 7645, 1473, 2948, 482, 293, 30876, 17, 284, 220, 1544, 271, 18293, 279, 9518, 3789, 315, 2225, 11314, 1473, 64, 482, 293, 284, 20903, 110682, 1544, 271, 64, 482, 293, 284, 20903, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 923, 293, 311, 2225, 11314, 311, 636, 1473, 64, 284, 293, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 1687, 527, 3411, 369, 279, 907, 315, 671, 11, 779, 584, 649, 31370, 2225, 11314, 555, 293, 1473, 370, 284, 293, 2948, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 696, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 1005, 85770, 220, 16, 311, 3237, 293, 304, 3878, 315, 264, 1473, 65, 284, 220, 18, 482, 264, 271, 3214, 7815, 420, 7645, 369, 293, 1139, 279, 24524, 3485, 1473, 370, 284, 320, 18, 482, 264, 2432, 64, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 696, 40046, 323, 40821, 1473, 370, 284, 220, 18, 64, 482, 264, 61, 17, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 64, 482, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 82214, 1093, 3878, 1473, 370, 284, 482, 64, 61, 17, 489, 220, 18, 64, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 6