l for the time we had spent together as a family. It was a day filled with laughter, adventure, and making memories that I will always treasure.", token_ids=[4054, 315, 856, 99952, 19459, 374, 505, 264, 3070, 20769, 311, 279, 11573, 994, 358, 574, 264, 1716, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 40798, 7474, 1938, 11, 323, 856, 37783, 323, 358, 1047, 1027, 3411, 4741, 311, 420, 8577, 369, 5672, 13, 1666, 5246, 439, 584, 11721, 520, 279, 13962, 11, 584, 10837, 7833, 311, 279, 3090, 596, 6964, 11, 24450, 311, 2733, 279, 8369, 9462, 1990, 1057, 45713, 323, 279, 7155, 18435, 46385, 304, 1057, 7013, 382, 5159, 6699, 743, 709, 264, 34966, 11573, 48998, 323, 264, 2466, 39139, 11, 323, 584, 7543, 279, 6693, 4857, 9462, 3914, 645, 323, 26984, 513, 1003, 6572, 13, 3092, 37783, 323, 358, 1053, 1935, 10800, 42200, 53827, 323, 4647, 1900, 11, 323, 1243, 18678, 304, 264, 5052, 315, 70718, 645, 439, 279, 17301, 38593, 927, 1057, 53862, 382, 6153, 16163, 11, 584, 6773, 311, 1935, 264, 1464, 323, 733, 369, 264, 16587, 13, 578, 3090, 574, 26110, 2867, 11, 323, 584, 7543, 4207, 12786, 19587, 2212, 11, 5737, 3953, 315, 35281, 73871, 323, 4560, 311, 2339, 279, 17301, 13, 358, 6227, 8430, 2512, 10816, 323, 83212, 11, 449, 279, 7160, 49025, 1523, 389, 603, 323, 279, 5222, 315, 279, 17301, 46574, 2403, 279, 31284, 382, 2170, 279, 1938, 28670, 389, 11, 584, 23183, 1523, 389, 1057, 39139, 311, 3821, 279, 44084, 13, 3092, 6699, 7263, 704, 264, 2466, 14351, 315, 43402, 11, 323, 584, 296, 10880, 389, 6761, 18668, 94911, 323, 14098, 1418, 584, 15746, 279, 13180, 2543, 18718, 323, 19087, 13, 1102, 574, 279, 4832, 13696, 311, 264, 4832, 1938, 382, 2170, 584, 19937, 709, 311, 5387, 11, 358, 6227, 8430, 26259, 369, 279, 892, 584, 1047, 7543, 3871, 439, 264, 3070, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 1938, 10409, 449, 43214, 11, 18427, 11, 323, 3339, 19459, 430, 358, 690, 2744, 32726, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_