was committed to providing exceptional service.\n\nI was so impressed with my experience that I ended up returning to The Book Nook multiple times, not just for the excellent selection and competitive prices, but also for the warm and welcoming atmosphere that Sarah and her team created. In fact, I\'ve become a loyal customer and have recommended the store to all my friends and family. The experience taught me that even in a digital age, personal touch and attention to detail can make all the difference in building a loyal customer base.', token_ids=[40, 19635, 264, 8104, 33596, 3217, 1405, 358, 4036, 9250, 6130, 2532, 505, 264, 2883, 2663, 330, 791, 6017, 452, 1982, 498, 264, 2678, 11, 9678, 79761, 304, 856, 44116, 13, 358, 1047, 1027, 15389, 369, 264, 9024, 2363, 555, 856, 7075, 3229, 11, 323, 1306, 5672, 315, 15389, 2930, 11, 358, 5616, 1766, 433, 10212, 389, 872, 3997, 13, 358, 574, 38564, 11, 719, 1101, 264, 2766, 47291, 4114, 922, 22106, 505, 264, 2678, 11, 2254, 2626, 382, 40, 9277, 279, 2015, 2930, 323, 4036, 459, 2613, 20109, 505, 279, 3637, 596, 6506, 11, 21077, 11, 889, 28478, 757, 430, 1364, 1053, 16102, 3790, 856, 2015, 13, 362, 2478, 2919, 3010, 11, 358, 4036, 264, 4641, 1650, 505, 21077, 11937, 11, 13598, 304, 311, 7838, 856, 2015, 323, 2610, 422, 358, 1047, 904, 4860, 477, 10742, 13, 358, 574, 25408, 555, 1077, 6666, 311, 7872, 323, 11919, 94115, 382, 4599, 279, 2363, 11721, 11, 358, 574, 35072, 311, 1505, 430, 433, 574, 304, 4832, 3044, 11, 7041, 439, 7633, 13, 2030, 1148, 2216, 42423, 757, 3201, 574, 279, 35649, 5296, 430, 21077, 5343, 449, 279, 6462, 13, 3005, 1047, 4529, 279, 892, 311, 3350, 264, 99489, 5296, 11, 94121, 757, 369, 856, 2626, 323, 65774, 1023, 6603, 555, 279, 1890, 3229, 430, 1364, 3463, 358, 2643, 4774, 13, 1102, 574, 2867, 430, 1364, 36297, 42777, 922, 1077, 6444, 323, 574, 11411, 311, 8405, 25363, 2532, 382, 40, 574, 779, 25408, 449, 856, 3217, 430, 358, 9670, 709, 13758, 311, 578, 6017, 452, 1982, 5361, 3115, 11, 539, 1120, 369