 sunlight, I gasped in surprise. The stranger was tall and gaunt, with eyes that seemed to bore into my very soul. Its skin was deathly pale, and its hair was as white as the snow-capped mountains that loomed in the distance.\n\n"I am the guardian of this forest," it said in a voice that sent shivers down my spine. "And you, little one, are searching for the lost treasure."\n\nI nodded, feeling a sense of trepidation. "Yes, I\'ve been searching for it for years. My family\'s map says it\'s hidden somewhere in this forest."\n\nThe stranger\'s eyes seemed to bore deeper into mine. "Ah, yes. The map. A clever trick, that. But the treasure is not for the taking. It is for those who prove themselves worthy."\n\nI felt a surge of determination. "I\'m willing to prove myself. What do I need to do?"\n\nThe stranger smiled, its lips curling upwards in a way that sent a shiver down my spine. "I will set you three trials. If you succeed, the treasure shall be yours. But if you fail... well, let us just say that the forest has a way of dealing with those who are not worthy."\n\nI steeled myself and nodded. "I\'m ready. What are the trials?"\n\nThe stranger\'s eyes glinted with a mischievous light. "Ah,', token_ids=[2170, 358, 82294, 1555, 279, 29050, 80105, 315, 279, 24632, 13952, 11, 279, 40120, 30770, 1555, 279, 64071, 3485, 6445, 294, 680, 839, 35612, 389, 279, 13952, 6558, 13, 578, 3805, 574, 12314, 449, 279, 41466, 315, 14545, 18238, 8545, 89770, 323, 279, 8579, 71546, 10194, 315, 20229, 10409, 279, 3805, 13, 358, 1047, 1027, 15389, 369, 4207, 11, 2768, 279, 14774, 292, 2472, 1880, 2454, 389, 264, 6710, 315, 87204, 430, 1047, 1027, 5946, 1523, 1555, 856, 3070, 369, 22540, 13, 578, 2472, 19487, 430, 433, 1053, 3063, 757, 311, 279, 5675, 32726, 315, 279, 13952, 11, 264, 32726, 70468, 311, 13500, 904, 6562, 311, 39371, 1766, 433, 382, 2170, 358, 15753, 16038, 264, 46866, 315, 86529, 11, 358, 50157, 5304, 264, 33850, 13, 763, 279, 4219, 315, 279, 33850, 14980, 459, 14154, 11, 