ccurate responses to customer queries, reducing wait times and frustration.\n* Increased efficiency: The chatbot can handle a high volume of customer inquiries simultaneously, freeing up human customer support agents to focus on more complex issues.\n* Cost savings: By automating routine customer service tasks, the company can reduce the need for human customer support agents, resulting in cost savings.\n\nIn this example, the GPT language model is used to generate human-like responses to customer queries, enabling the chatbot to provide a more personalized and effective customer service experience.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 1005, 1162, 369, 1701, 264, 480, 2898, 320, 5648, 1413, 5075, 70024, 63479, 8, 4221, 1646, 1473, 334, 10464, 11799, 68063, 21382, 22103, 369, 12557, 5475, 13149, 63005, 271, 32, 2883, 11, 330, 35197, 95895, 498, 6944, 311, 7417, 1202, 6130, 2532, 555, 25976, 264, 6369, 6465, 430, 649, 7945, 6444, 449, 4279, 20126, 323, 4819, 13, 578, 2883, 28727, 311, 1005, 264, 480, 2898, 4221, 1646, 311, 2410, 1202, 6369, 6465, 382, 8586, 596, 1268, 433, 4375, 1473, 16, 13, 578, 6369, 6465, 374, 16572, 389, 264, 3544, 10550, 315, 6130, 2532, 21633, 11, 2027, 2038, 11, 323, 87684, 627, 17, 13, 3277, 264, 6130, 84261, 449, 279, 6369, 6465, 11, 433, 5829, 279, 480, 2898, 1646, 311, 7068, 264, 2077, 3196, 389, 279, 6130, 596, 1988, 627, 18, 13, 578, 480, 2898, 1646, 374, 3025, 311, 3619, 279, 6130, 596, 3319, 323, 7068, 264, 9959, 2077, 11, 1778, 439, 8405, 2038, 922, 264, 2027, 11, 36864, 264, 14134, 4691, 3488, 11, 477, 1524, 77157, 279, 4360, 311, 264, 3823, 6130, 1862, 8479, 627, 19, 13, 578, 6369, 6465, 649, 1101, 1005, 279, 480, 2898, 1646, 311, 7068, 1833, 5352, 4860, 311, 38263, 279, 6130, 596, 4360, 11, 23391, 430, 279, 10652, 374, 27331, 323, 11297, 382, 85423, 1473, 9, 59223, 6130, 24617, 25, 578, 6369, 6465, 374, 3025, 311, 3493, 4062, 323, 13687, 14847, 311, 6130, 20126, 11, 18189, 3868, 3115, 323, 33086, 627, 9, 62697, 15374, 25, 5