mn is a popular season for outdoor activities like apple picking, hayrides, and bonfires.\n\n**Winter**: Winter is the coldest season of the year, typically lasting from December to February in the Northern Hemisphere. It is characterized by cold temperatures, snowfall, and short days. The weather is often icy, with temperatures ranging from freezing to below freezing. Winter is a popular season for indoor activities like skiing, ice skating, and cozying up by the fireplace.', token_ids=[791, 3116, 15956, 315, 279, 1060, 527, 1473, 334, 26208, 96618, 12531, 374, 279, 3280, 430, 15785, 279, 7314, 315, 279, 1060, 323, 374, 32971, 555, 23900, 20472, 11, 14545, 18238, 19837, 11, 323, 6307, 727, 13, 1102, 374, 264, 892, 315, 43901, 323, 6650, 11, 439, 279, 9578, 1384, 71837, 505, 1202, 12688, 1776, 900, 13, 578, 9282, 374, 6118, 23900, 11, 449, 20472, 27115, 24808, 709, 11, 323, 279, 2919, 636, 5129, 13, 12531, 374, 264, 5526, 3280, 369, 16166, 7640, 1093, 38464, 11, 60299, 11, 323, 10532, 77, 1233, 382, 334, 51787, 96618, 19367, 374, 279, 8369, 478, 3280, 315, 279, 1060, 11, 11383, 29869, 505, 5651, 311, 6287, 304, 279, 17355, 96878, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 1317, 11, 4106, 2919, 11, 323, 8369, 22178, 13, 578, 9282, 374, 6118, 40798, 11, 449, 20472, 3629, 19261, 279, 5209, 12, 1490, 82, 311, 5209, 12, 1954, 82, 69823, 320, 966, 12, 1758, 32037, 570, 19367, 374, 264, 5526, 892, 369, 75667, 11, 11573, 23277, 11, 323, 16166, 7640, 1093, 24269, 11, 33873, 11, 323, 3703, 17106, 1157, 382, 334, 20175, 22082, 334, 320, 269, 3146, 50872, 334, 1680, 60902, 374, 279, 3280, 430, 15785, 279, 9320, 505, 7474, 311, 12688, 11, 11383, 29869, 505, 6250, 311, 6841, 304, 279, 17355, 96878, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 36921, 20472, 11, 10223, 80105, 11, 323, 279, 24322, 3280, 13, 578, 11141, 389, 279, 12690, 2543, 20333, 37199, 315, 19087, 11, 2579, 11, 323, 14071, 11, 6968, 264, 75001, 18921, 13, 60902, 374, 264, 5526, 3280, 369, 16166, 7640, 1093, 24149, 21816, 11, 18137, 18746, 11, 323