Output~2025-04-24 17:55:59.030346: [RequestOutput(request_id=2074, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a brief speech to persuade individuals to take action against climate change. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 10015, 8982, 311, 51041, 7931, 311, 1935, 1957, 2403, 10182, 2349, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a brief speech to persuade individuals to take action against climate change:\n\n"Fellow citizens,\n\nWe stand at a critical moment in human history. The science is clear: climate change is real, it\'s happening now, and it\'s having devastating consequences. Rising temperatures are melting polar ice caps, sea levels are rising, and extreme weather events are becoming more frequent and intense. The consequences are not just environmental; they\'re also economic, social, and humanitarian.\n\nBut I don\'t stand before you today to simply recite the facts. I stand before you to urge you to take action. We can no longer afford to ignore the warning signs or pretend that someone else will solve this problem. We must take responsibility for our own actions and work together to address this crisis.\n\nWe can start by making conscious choices in our daily lives. We can reduce our carbon footprint by using public transportation, carpooling, or driving electric vehicles. We can reduce our energy consumption by turning off lights and electronics when not in use. We can choose sustainable products and support companies that prioritize the environment.\n\nBut we must also demand more from our leaders. We must demand policies that prioritize renewable energy, invest in clean technologies, and protect our natural resources. We must hold our elected officials accountable for taking bold action to address climate change.\n\nThis is not a partisan issue; it\'s a human issue. Climate change affects us all, regardless of our political beliefs or socioeconomic status. It\'s a matter of justice, equality, and our collective future.\n\nSo I urge you to join me in taking action. Let\'s work together to reduce our carbon footprint, to demand more from our leaders, and to create a sustainable future for ourselves and for generations to come. We can do this. We must do this. The time for action is now.\n\nTogether, we can make a difference. Together, we can save our planet. Let\'s do it."', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 10015, 8982, 311, 51041, 7931, 311, 1935, 1957, 2403, 10182, 2349, 1473, 87655, 5412, 10495, 3638, 1687, 2559, 520, 264, 9200, 4545, 304, 3823, 3925, 13, 578, 8198, 374, 2867, 25, 10182, 2349, 374, 1972, 11, 433, 596, 12765, 1457, 11, 323, 433, 596, 3515, 33318, 16296, 13, 49987, 20472, 527, 50684, 25685, 10054, 19079, 11, 9581, 5990, 527, 16448, 11, 323, 14560, 9282, 4455, 527, 10671, 810, 21420, 323, 19428, 13, 578, 16296, 527, 539, 1120, 12434, 26, 814, 2351, 1101, 7100, 11, 3674, 11, 323, 38748, 382, 4071, 358, 1541, 956, 2559, 1603, 499, 3432, 311, 5042, 1421, 635, 279, 13363, 13, 358, 2559, 1603, 499, 311, 33147, 499, 311, 1935, 1957, 13, 1226, 649, 912, 5129, 10150, 311, 10240, 279, 10163, 12195, 477, 35840, 430, 4423, 775, 690, 11886, 420, 3575, 13, 1226, 2011, 1935, 12014, 369, 1057, 1866, 6299, 323, 990, 3871, 311, 2686, 420, 11501, 382, 1687, 649, 1212, 555, 3339, 17371, 11709, 304, 1057, 7446, 6439, 13, 1226, 649, 8108, 1057, 12782, 43972, 555, 1701, 586, 18386, 11, 1841, 10497, 287, 11, 477, 10043, 9249, 11731, 13, 1226, 649, 8108, 1057, 4907, 15652, 555, 13353, 1022,