Output~2025-04-24 17:56:18.490468: [RequestOutput(request_id=2081, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest a theme for a 90s themed party. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 264, 7057, 369, 264, 220, 1954, 82, 49644, 4717, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Tubular! Here\'s a theme that\'s sure to bring back some radical memories: "Neon Rave: A Blast from the Past"\n\nImagine a party that\'s a fusion of the iconic styles and trends of the 1990s, with a neon twist. The decor could feature glow-in-the-dark accents, lava lamps, and black lights to create a psychedelic atmosphere. The playlist would be a mix of popular 90s tunes, from grunge to pop to hip-hop, with a focus on songs that feature neon-colored music videos.\n\nGuests could dress up in their best 90s-inspired outfits, think high-waisted jeans, oversized flannel shirts, chokers, and platform shoes. You could also have a "best dressed" contest with prizes for the most creative and outrageous outfits.\n\nTo add an extra layer of fun, you could set up stations for guests to make their own neon-colored accessories, like glow sticks, neon hair clips, and temporary tattoos. And, of course, no 90s party would be complete without a photo booth stocked with retro props like oversized sunglasses, fanny packs, and scrunchies.\n\nTo make it a truly immersive experience, you could also have a "time capsule" station where guests can write notes and predictions about what they think the future will be like in the year 2023 (or whenever the party is taking place). It\'ll be a blast from the past that\'s sure to bring everyone together and create some unforgettable memories!', token_ids=[51, 392, 1299, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 7057, 430, 596, 2771, 311, 4546, 1203, 1063, 18336, 19459, 25, 330, 8989, 263, 432, 525, 25, 362, 58436, 505, 279, 24561, 1875, 52157, 264, 4717, 430, 596, 264, 37608, 315, 279, 27373, 9404, 323, 18845, 315, 279, 220, 2550, 15, 82, 11, 449, 264, 47752, 27744, 13, 578, 10799, 1436, 4668, 37066, 3502, 10826, 22592, 59570, 11, 58668, 50552, 11, 323, 3776, 13001, 311, 1893, 264, 82082, 16975, 13, 578, 27889, 1053, 387, 264, 6651, 315, 5526, 220, 1954, 82, 55090, 11, 505, 1099, 14208, 311, 2477, 311, 18638, 49819, 11, 449, 264, 5357, 389, 11936, 430, 4668, 47752, 58822, 4731, 6946, 382, 38904, 82, 1436, 8679, 709, 304, 872, 1888, 220, 1954, 82, 53161, 48374, 11, 1781, 1579, 2695, 64, 13539, 34389, 11, 62305, 1344, 2659, 37824, 11, 523, 41781, 11, 323, 5452, 15653, 13, 1472, 1436, 1101, 617, 264, 330, 16241, 26435, 1, 14130, 449, 38508, 369, 279, 1455, 11782, 323, 55588, 48374, 382, 1271, 923, 459, 5066, 6324, 315, 2523, 11, 499, 1436, 743, 709, 17789, 369, 15051, 311, 1304, 872, 1866, 47752, 58822, 23090, 11, 1093, 37066, 34240, 11, 47752, 7013, 27203, 11, 323, 13643, 54742, 13, 1628, 11, 315, 3388, 11, 912, 220, 1954, 82, 4717, 1053, 387, 4686, 2085, 264, 6685, 36506, 71116, 449, 17189, 7059, 1093, 62305, 60469, 11, 282, 13184, 31406, 11, 323, 9406, 3265, 552, 382, 1271, 1304, 433, 264, 9615, 65280, 3217, 11, 499, 1436, 1101, 617, 264, 330, 1712, 48739, 1, 8216, 1405, 15051, 649, 3350, 8554, 323, 20492, 922, 1148, 814, 1781, 279, 3938, 690, 387, 1093, 304, 279, 1060, 220, 2366, 18, 320, 269, 15716, 279, 4717, 374, 4737, 2035, 570, 1102, 3358, 387, 264, 21327, 505, 279, 3347, 430, 596, 2771, 311, 4546, 5127, 3871, 323, 1893, 1063, 61098, 19459, 0, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], fini