.\n\n**Step 5: Add milk**\n\n* Once the tea has steeped, remove the tea bag from the cup or mug.\n* Add milk to the tea, stirring gently to combine.\n* You can add as much or as little milk as you prefer.\n\n**Step 6: Enjoy your tea**\n\n* Stir the tea again to ensure the milk is fully incorporated.\n* Your cup of tea with milk is now ready to drink and enjoy!\n\nThat's it! With these simple steps, you can make a delicious cup of tea with milk.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 8641, 389, 1268, 311, 1304, 264, 10747, 315, 15600, 449, 14403, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 279, 5995, 14293, 323, 7241, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 15600, 9145, 320, 11708, 11, 6307, 11, 477, 51487, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 22698, 340, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 23, 25616, 8, 315, 3090, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 23, 25616, 8, 315, 14403, 320, 67733, 11, 79669, 11, 477, 264, 2536, 1773, 22704, 10778, 11, 1778, 439, 63168, 477, 29839, 14403, 340, 9, 362, 15600, 73418, 477, 264, 3419, 198, 9, 362, 10747, 477, 52589, 198, 9, 362, 46605, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 2577, 321, 279, 3090, 57277, 9, 22748, 279, 15600, 73418, 477, 3419, 449, 7878, 11, 9439, 3090, 627, 9, 11004, 279, 73418, 477, 3419, 389, 279, 45115, 323, 2543, 279, 8798, 311, 1579, 627, 9, 14144, 369, 279, 3090, 311, 44790, 13, 1472, 649, 1817, 422, 279, 3090, 706, 8813, 264, 44790, 555, 3411, 369, 2466, 44783, 16448, 311, 279, 7479, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 2758, 279, 15600, 9145, 57277, 9, 9843, 279, 3090, 706, 66185, 11, 4148, 279, 73418, 477, 3419, 505, 279, 8798, 627, 9, 2758, 832, 15600, 9145, 311, 279, 10747, 477, 52589, 627, 9, 7557, 2771, 279, 15600, 9145, 374, 7373, 85177, 304, 279, 3090, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 3441, 752, 279, 15600, 57277, 9, 27628, 279, 15600, 9145, 311, 32366, 304, 279, 4106, 3090, 369, 279, 11349, 3392, 315, 892, 11, 6118, 220, 16, 12, 18, 4520, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 15236, 8333, 315, 15600, 627, 9, 1472, 649, 1817, 279, 15600, 9145, 369, 279, 11349, 32366, 287, 892, 389, 279, 2406